    # mc "Para mí es el momento ideal para relajarme un rato sin tener que tostarme al sol."
    mc "For me, it's the ideal time to relax for a bit without having to roast in the sun."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1665
translate english c30s004_Eva_cdbfcf6f:

    # deb "Entonces no te entretenemos más, o vas a acabar bañándote de noche."
    deb "Then we won't hold you up any longer, or you'll end up swimming at night."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1666
translate english c30s004_Eva_b5198100:

    # lis "Un día tenemos que hacer algo de noche en la piscina. Un día que haga buena noche."
    lis "One day we should do something at the pool at night. On a nice night."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1667
translate english c30s004_Eva_fcdd7512:

    # mc "Cuando queráis. Aunque, si queréis contar conmigo, deberá ser pronto."
    mc "Whenever you want. Although, if you want me there, it'll have to be soon."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1669
translate english c30s004_Eva_66962f8b:

    # lis "Ya lo hablaremos. Y no hay prisa."
    lis "We'll talk about it. And there's no rush."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1670
translate english c30s004_Eva_9686ef1b:

    # mc "[ama] y yo nos vamos el jueves."
    mc "[ama] and I are leaving on Thursday."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1671
translate english c30s004_Eva_81691883:

    # deb "Y nosotras seguiremos aquí cuando volváis."
    deb "And we'll still be here when you get back."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1673
translate english c30s004_Eva_145f905b:

    # "Te despides de las dos chicas y, al llegar a la piscina, está más oscuro de lo que creías y está obviamente vacía."
    "You say goodbye to the two girls, and, when you get to the pool, it's darker than you expected and obviously empty."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1674
translate english c30s004_Eva_7b47e759:

    # "El tema con [emm] te ha retrasado más de lo que creías. Parece que tus últimos días en casa los vas a pasar bastante solo."
    "The thing with [emm] delayed you more than you thought. It looks like you'll be spending your last few days at home pretty much alone."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1676
translate english c30s004_Eva_f400c10e:

    # "Si no fuera por ratos como el de [emm]..."
    "If it weren't for moments like the one with [emm]..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1677
translate english c30s004_Eva_60241888:

    # "Anoche parecía que te evitaba y sin embargo hoy ha sido ella la que te ha buscado para una visita a la sala de la colada."
    "Last night it seemed like she was avoiding you, yet today she was the one who sought you out for a visit to the laundry room."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1679
translate english c30s004_Eva_a58c3a4c:

    # "Y después hay cosas como lo de [emm]. Anoche parecía claro que te quería evitar y hoy ha estado hablando contigo de las cámaras como si no pasara nada."
    "And then there are things like the situation with [emm]."
    "Last night it seemed clear she wanted to avoid you, and today she was talking to you about the cameras like nothing happened."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1680
translate english c30s004_Eva_0ff32bf6:

    # "No entiendes nada..."
    "You don't understand anything..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1682
translate english c30s004_Eva_8f9d772f:

    # "Al cabo de un rato empieza a nublarse. Habían anunciado lluvias para toda la noche."
    "After a while, it starts to get cloudy. Rain was forecasted for the whole night."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1683
translate english c30s004_Eva_4fe5e8d2:

    # "Parece que tu sesión en la piscina ha terminado. No ha durado ni siquiera 10 minutos."
    "Looks like your pool session is over. It didn't even last 10 minutes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1684
translate english c30s004_Eva_9c27087b:

    # "No crees que ninguna de las chicas vaya a bajar a la piscina lloviendo. Decides recoger los colchones de las tumbonas."
    "You don't think any of the girls will come down to the pool in the rain. So, you decide to gather the cushions from the lounge chairs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1686
translate english c30s004_Eva_4ae8e209:

    # "Cuando acabas de recogerlos, escuchas sollozos detrás de casa."
    "When you finish picking them up, you hear sobbing behind the house."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1687
translate english c30s004_Eva_68158c91:

    # "No has visto llegar a nadie en los 15 minutos que has estado solo en la piscina."
    "You haven't seen anyone in the 15 minutes you've been here at the pool."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1688
translate english c30s004_Eva_77eb08b5:

    # "*Sollozo*"
    "*Sob*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1689
translate english c30s004_Eva_e7bb65f5:

    # "No reconoces a quién pertenecen. Te acercas por si alguien te necesita."
    "You don't recognize who it belongs to. You approach in case someone needs you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1691
translate english c30s004_Eva_7aa3106f:

    # "Al girar la esquina ves a [eva] en un rincón, sentada en el césped y sollozando."
    "Turning the corner, you see [eva] in the opposite corner, sitting on the grass and sobbing."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1692
translate english c30s004_Eva_b771dc78:

    # "Pocas veces la has visto con un aspecto tan frágil."
    "You've rarely seen her looking so fragile."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1693
translate english c30s004_Eva_4325c52b:

    # mc "¿Quieres compañía?"
    mc "Want some company?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1695
translate english c30s004_Eva_709d1566:

    # eva "*Voz llorosa* No te he oído llegar."
    eva "*Tearful voice* I didn't hear you coming."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1696
translate english c30s004_Eva_0ba42166:

    # eva "Supongo que, aunque te dijera que no quiero compañía no me dejarías sola, ¿no?"
    eva "I guess even if I told you I didn't want company, you wouldn't leave me alone, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1697
translate english c30s004_Eva_39a95212:

    # mc "Te dejaría sola, pero me quedaría cerca por si cambias de opinión."
    mc "I'd leave you alone, but I'd stay close by in case you change your mind."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1698
translate english c30s004_Eva_2ad3000a:

    # mc "Estás en mi rincón de las rabietas. Cuando era un niño venía aquí cuando quería estar solo."
    mc "You're in my tantrum corner. When I was a kid, I used to come here when I wanted to be alone."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1700
translate english c30s004_Eva_33077a2f:

    # eva "Es un buen rincón. Nadie pasa por aquí nunca."
    eva "It's a good spot. No one ever comes here."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1701
translate english c30s004_Eva_00e831be:

    # mc "Lo sé. Por eso venía cuando algo me enfadaba, o, especialmente, cuando me ponía triste."
    mc "I know. That's why I used to come here when I was angry about something, or, especially, when I was sad."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1703
translate english c30s004_Eva_d0ee7abf:

    # eva "Por entonces no había un [mc] que viniera a interrumpir tu soledad..."
    eva "Back then there wasn't a [mc] to come and interrupt your solitude..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1704
translate english c30s004_Eva_7ef46807:

    # mc "Bueno, yo tenía que convivir con el [mc] de 12 años 24 horas al día."
    mc "Well, I had to live with the 12-year-old [mc] 24 hours a day."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1705
translate english c30s004_Eva_cd725aa4:

    # mc "Entiendo que puede ser un poco molesto. Por eso te pregunto si quieres que me quede."
    mc "I understand it can be a bit annoying. That's why I'm asking if you want me to stay."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1707
translate english c30s004_Eva_da543972:

    # eva "Gracias, [mc], pero preferiría estar sola ahora mismo."
    eva "Thanks, [mc], but I'd rather be alone right now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1708
translate english c30s004_Eva_672c626e:

    # mc "No hay ningún problema, [eva]. Estaré aquí mismo, doblando la esquina, por si necesitas un abrazo."
    mc "No problem, [eva]. I'll be right here, just around the corner, in case you need a hug."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1710
translate english c30s004_Eva_36f791a0:

    # "Te sientas fuera de la vista de [eva], al doblar la esquina."
    "You sit out of [eva]'s sight, around the corner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1711
translate english c30s004_Eva_d1aab035:

    # "Sabes que, a veces, lo mejor es permanecer callado, esperando a que te necesiten."
    "You know that, sometimes, the best thing is to stay quiet, waiting until you're needed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1712
translate english c30s004_Eva_fdcb6492:

    # "Te han acusado muchas veces de hablar demasiado, pero conoces tu rincón, ahora el rincón de [eva], demasiado bien."
    "You've been accused of talking too much many times, but you know your corner, now also [eva]'s corner, all too well."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1713
translate english c30s004_Eva_bc9c30c5:

    # "Cuando alguien quiere estar solo en ese rincón, significa que está en un mal momento."
    "When someone wants to be alone in that corner, it means they're going through a hard time."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1715
translate english c30s004_Eva_7e79e456:

    # "Te das cuenta de que habéis pasado bastante rato en silencio cuando las luces de la piscina se encienden."
    "You realize you've spent quite a while in silence when the pool lights turn on."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1716
translate english c30s004_Eva_beb81eed:

    # "El sol casi se ha puesto ya."
    "The sun has almost set by now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1717
translate english c30s004_Eva_5fcb84a6:

    # "Empiezas a dudar sobre si deberías irte o no. Parece que [eva] no va a querer hablar contigo."
    "You start to doubt whether you should leave or not. It seems like [eva] isn't going to want to talk to you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1718
translate english c30s004_Eva_a556d1fc:

    # "Estás seguro de que, sea lo que sea lo que le pasa, hablar de ello le iría bien."
    "You're sure that, whatever is wrong with her, talking about it would do her good."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1719
translate english c30s004_Eva_e01ddb1d:

    # "Tú nunca solucionaste nada pasando horas en el rincón. De lo único que te sirvió fue para autocompadecerte."
    "You never solved anything by spending hours in the corner. The only thing it was good for was feeling sorry for yourself."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1720
translate english c30s004_Eva_26cb77ba:

    # "O para sentirte un idiota."
    "Or feeling like an idiot."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1721
translate english c30s004_Eva_48c302b9:

    # eva "¿Aún estás ahí?"
    eva "Are you still there?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1722
translate english c30s004_Eva_8ca02d00:

    # mc "Claro. Te he dicho que estaría aquí por si querías hablar."
    mc "Of course. I told you I'd be here in case you wanted to talk."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1723
translate english c30s004_Eva_80f438cd:

    # mc "Y si no quieres hablar, estaré aquí hasta que quieras ir a cambiarte para la cena."
    mc "And if you don't want to talk, I'll be here until you want to go change for dinner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1725
translate english c30s004_Eva_a80052a9:

    # eva "Sabes que soy sigilosa y que me podría haber ido sin darte cuenta, ¿verdad?"
    eva "You know I'm stealthy and could have left without you noticing, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1726
translate english c30s004_Eva_3eb2bb2d:

    # "Se ha secado las lágrimas de sus mejillas, pero la expresión en su cara te indica que podría seguir llorando si no estuvieras ahí."
    "She has wiped the tears from her cheeks, but the expression on her face tells you she might still be crying if you weren't there."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1727
translate english c30s004_Eva_4a9f8fd7:

    # mc "Lo sé. También sé que no lo harías."
    mc "I know. I also know you wouldn't."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1729
translate english c30s004_Eva_d09ddf67:

    # eva "¿Alguna vez me vas a dejar estar triste sin meterte por en medio?"
    eva "Are you ever going to let me be sad without getting involved?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1730
translate english c30s004_Eva_d101184b:

    # mc "No si estoy a menos de 50 kilómetros de distancia."
    mc "Not if I'm less than 50 kilometers away."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1732
translate english c30s004_Eva_dd552125:

    # mc "Es una de mis prerrogativas como tu pareja."
    mc "It's one of my prerogatives as your boyfriend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1734
translate english c30s004_Eva_70eb0cf1:

    # mc "Es lo que hacemos en esta familia."
    mc "It's what we do in this family."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1736
translate english c30s004_Eva_0ca39587:

    # eva "Eres el único que ha venido..."
    eva "You're the only one who came..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1737
translate english c30s004_Eva_7707a3fe:

    # mc "Porque te he oído cuando recogía los colchones de las tumbonas."
    mc "Because I heard you when I was picking up the mattresses from the lounge chairs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1738
translate english c30s004_Eva_d77bb47f:

    # mc "Sé lo solo que se puede estar en ese rincón. A veces sirve de más hablar que estar solos aquí, mortificándonos."
    mc "I know how lonely it can get in that corner. Sometimes it helps more to talk than to be alone here, beating ourselves up."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1740
translate english c30s004_Eva_b52d94e8:

    # eva "Es que... si te lo explico... voy a parecer idiota."
    eva "It's just... if I explain it to you... I'll sound like an idiot."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1741
translate english c30s004_Eva_0c6d3ab4:

    # mc "Nadie se pasa dos horas en ese rincón si no tiene una buena razón, [eva]."
    mc "Nobody spends two hours in that corner without a good reason, [eva]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1742
translate english c30s004_Eva_cc9cd7b4:

    # mc "Es posible que la razón sea que somos idiotas. Eso no lo voy a negar."
    mc "It's possible the reason is that we're idiots. I won't deny that."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1744
translate english c30s004_Eva_0a966d31:

    # eva "*Risa triste* ¿Incluso hoy tienes que intentar hacerme reír?"
    eva "*Sad laugh* Do you have to try and make me laugh even today?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1745
translate english c30s004_Eva_a85e8477:

    # mc "Especialmente hoy."
    mc "Especially today."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1746
translate english c30s004_Eva_e4734882:

    # mc "No me gusta verte triste, y menos aún llorando."
    mc "I don't like seeing you sad, and even less crying."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1748
translate english c30s004_Eva_b9421df7:

    # mc "Entiendo que dejarnos llevar por las emociones y llorar un rato a veces es balsámico."
    mc "I understand that letting ourselves get carried away by emotions and crying for a while is sometimes soothing."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1749
translate english c30s004_Eva_508ea622:

    # mc "Y también entiendo que, cuando estamos así, lo que menos queremos es un payaso intentando hacernos reír."
    mc "And I also understand that, when we're like this, the last thing we want is a clown trying to make us laugh."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1750
translate english c30s004_Eva_ef0cb7c2:

    # mc "Pero si la tristeza es sustituida por ira hacia el payaso, es un paso en la buena dirección."
    mc "But if the sadness is replaced by anger towards the clown, it's a step in the right direction."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1752
translate english c30s004_Eva_cd38fb39:

    # eva "No quieres ser el centro de mi ira..."
    eva "You don't want to be the focus of my anger..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1753
translate english c30s004_Eva_f3e2d6aa:

    # mc "No, no quiero serlo. Le tengo mucho aprecio a mis huesos intactos."
    mc "No, I don't. I'm very fond of my intact bones."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1754
translate english c30s004_Eva_04407c15:

    # mc "Pero si la ira te saca de la tristeza, estoy dispuesto a que me rompas alguno."
    mc "But if anger pulls you out of sadness, I'm willing to let you break one."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1755
translate english c30s004_Eva_dc0963be:

    # mc "Uno pequeñito, que duela poco, si es posible."
    mc "A tiny one, one that doesn't hurt too much, if possible."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1757
translate english c30s004_Eva_b3231c9d:

    # eva "*Risa triste* Ciertamente eres un payaso."
    eva "*Sad laugh* You certainly are a clown."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1758
translate english c30s004_Eva_5ab3c5c0:

    # eva "Pero no conozco ningún hueso que no duela. Estoy entrenada para infligir dolor."
    eva "But I don't know of any bone that doesn't hurt when broken. I'm trained to inflict pain."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1760
translate english c30s004_Eva_c977471a:

    # eva "No sirve de nada romper un hueso si no duele, ¿no?"
    eva "There's no point in breaking a bone if it doesn't hurt, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1761
translate english c30s004_Eva_613cc66e:

    # mc "Podría servir de algo. Especialmente cuando hay un payaso bienintencionado alrededor."
    mc "It could be good for something. Especially when there's a well-meaning clown around."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1763
translate english c30s004_Eva_4602417c:

    # eva "Creo que debería ir a cambiarme para la cena."
    eva "I think I should go change for dinner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1764
translate english c30s004_Eva_411579bd:

    # mc "Me parece bien. ¿Dónde tienes la ropa? ¿Quieres que te acompañe?"
    mc "Sounds good. Where are your clothes? Do you want me to come with you?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1766
translate english c30s004_Eva_1f0c0104:

    # eva "¿No vas a intentar sonsacarme qué es lo que me pasa?"
    eva "Aren't you going to try to pry what's wrong out of me?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1767
translate english c30s004_Eva_3cff4d8e:

    # mc "No. Si quieres contármelo algún día, lo harás."
    mc "No. If you want to tell me someday, you will."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1769
translate english c30s004_Eva_d0d61e9f:

    # mc "Te quiero, pero no tengo derecho a interrogarte si no me lo quieres contar."
    mc "I love you, but I have no right to interrogate you if you don't want to talk to me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1771
translate english c30s004_Eva_6379e635:

    # mc "Te quiero, te has convertido en una nueva hermana para mí, pero no tengo derecho a interrogarte si no me lo quieres contar."
    mc "I love you, you've become a new sister to me, but I have no right to interrogate you if you don't want to talk to me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1773
translate english c30s004_Eva_2c88a7c1:

    # "La tristeza vuelve a aparecer en sus ojos, pese a que nunca la ha abandonado del todo."
    "Sadness reappears in her eyes, even though it never completely left."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1774
translate english c30s004_Eva_dbda846e:

    # eva "¿Puedes abrazarme?"
    eva "Can you hug me?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1775
translate english c30s004_Eva_a2807aec:

    # mc "Por supuesto. Sabes que eso se me da muy bien."
    mc "Of course. You know I'm really good at that."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1777
translate english c30s004_Eva_98f2b8dc:

    # eva "Incluso mejor que hacer el payaso."
    eva "Even better than at goofing around."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1778
translate english c30s004_Eva_3cc9ab83:

    # mc "Y eso se me da cojonudamente bien."
    mc "And I'm fucking great at that."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1781
translate english c30s004_Eva_4e0afb04:

    # "Os mantenéis abrazados, en silencio, durante mucho rato, hasta que os separáis cuando el sol termina de ponerse."
    "You hold each other in silence for a long time, until you pull apart when the sun finally sets."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1782
translate english c30s004_Eva_d4a9578d:

    # eva "Nos van a echar de menos en la cena..."
    eva "They're going to miss us at dinner..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1783
translate english c30s004_Eva_2cebebc1:

    # mc "¿Quieres ir a cambiarte?"
    mc "Do you want to go change?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1785
translate english c30s004_Eva_39cbe7ab:

    # eva "No."
    eva "No."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1786
translate english c30s004_Eva_c91446bb:

    # eva "Cuando has dicho que me querías..."
    eva "When you said you loved me..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1787
translate english c30s004_Eva_1eea4b43:

    # mc "Te quiero. No puedo evitarlo. No quiero evitarlo."
    mc "I love you. I can't help it. I don't want to help it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1789
translate english c30s004_Eva_cd888979:

    # eva "[deb.nick] y [lis] me han dicho casi lo mismo..."
    eva "[deb.nick] and [lis] told me almost the same thing..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1790
translate english c30s004_Eva_3175a1cf:

    # mc "¿Y por eso te has puesto así? A mí me gusta que me digan que me quieren."
    mc "Is that why you got like this? I like it when people tell me they love me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1791
translate english c30s004_Eva_fa98651a:

    # mc "¿Quieres explicármelo?"
    mc "Do you want to explain it to me?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1793
translate english c30s004_Eva_52dbf186:

    # eva "Vas a pensar que soy una idiota..."
    eva "You're going to think I'm an idiot..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1794
translate english c30s004_Eva_323072aa:

    # mc "No lo creo."
    mc "I don't think so."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1795
translate english c30s004_Eva_ac075516:

    # mc "Te he visto llorar varias veces y siempre ha sido de alegría."
    mc "I've seen you cry a few times, and it's always been tears of joy."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1796
translate english c30s004_Eva_c94b00d8:

    # mc "La única vez que te vi realmente triste fue cuando pasó lo de Gavin... Y hoy supera con creces a aquel día."
    mc "The only time I saw you truly sad was when that thing with Gavin happened... And today it seems way worse than that day."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1798
translate english c30s004_Eva_585be301:

    # eva "Es que creo que les he hecho daño... a [lis] y a [deb.nick]."
    eva "It's just that I think I hurt them... [lis] and [deb.nick]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1799
translate english c30s004_Eva_f29eb02a:

    # mc "Las he visto cuando venía hacia aquí y no me han comentado nada."
    mc "I saw them on my way here, and they didn't mention anything to me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1800
translate english c30s004_Eva_883a4dd3:

    # mc "Si quieres, sigo aquí para que me lo expliques."
    mc "If you want, I'm still here for you to talk about it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1802
translate english c30s004_Eva_62613c0d:

    # eva "Estábamos las tres en la piscina, sentadas en las tumbonas..."
    eva "The three of us were by the pool, sitting on the lounge chairs..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1803
translate english c30s004_Eva_7fb332f8:

    # eva "Le he dado las gracias a [deb.nick] por lo que dijo sobre mí y sobre [ama] hace un par de días."
    eva "I thanked [deb.nick] for what she said about me and [ama] a couple of days ago."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1805
translate english c30s004_Eva_f812d691:

    # deb "No hace falta que me des las gracias. Lo dije de corazón. Las dos te queremos."
    deb "There's no need to thank me. I meant it from the bottom of my heart. We both love you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1807
translate english c30s004_Eva_25bd460b:

    # lis "Sé que suena raro, pero el sábado, cuando [deb.nick] me dijo lo que había pasado, estuvimos hablando."
    lis "I know it sounds weird, but on Saturday, when [deb.nick] told me what had happened, we talked."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1808
translate english c30s004_Eva_4f0e826b:

    # lis "No sé cómo explicarlo, pero con todo este sentimiento familiar que se ha creado..."
    lis "I don't know how to explain it, but with this whole family feeling that's been building..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1810
translate english c30s004_Eva_b2198fd8:

    # deb "Me niego a llamarte prima o algo por el estilo. Una prima suena como algo lejano."
    deb "I refuse to call you cousin or anything like that. A cousin sounds like someone distant."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1812
translate english c30s004_Eva_76792c1d:

    # lis "Lo que [deb.nick] quiere decir es que las dos te queremos... os queremos a [ama] y a ti... como si fuerais nuestras nuevas hermanas."
    lis "What [deb.nick] means is that we both love you... we love you and [ama]... as if you were our new sisters."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1814
translate english c30s004_Eva_cc6a0437:

    # deb "Sabemos que es raro, que hace menos de un mes que os conocemos..."
    deb "We know it's weird, that we've known you for less than a month..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1816
translate english c30s004_Eva_caf335ec:

    # lis "Pero si algo me enseñó la fiesta en la que estuve el viernes es que cuando pienso en alguna chica en quien confío ciegamente es en vosotras."
    lis "But if the party I was at on Friday taught me anything, it's that, when I think of a girl I trust blindly, it's you two."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1818
translate english c30s004_Eva_757024e5:

    # eva "Y ahí se ha venido todo abajo..."
    eva "And that's when I completely broke down..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1821
translate english c30s004_Eva_1b659726:

    # eva "Me he quedado con la boca abierta, como una tonta, mirándolas a una y a la otra."
    eva "I just sat there with my mouth open, like an idiot, looking back and forth between them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1822
translate english c30s004_Eva_488c7252:

    # eva "No sabía qué decir."
    eva "I didn't know what to say."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1824
translate english c30s004_Eva_2d7609e8:

    # eva "Y he salido corriendo, sin poder decir nada, hasta este rincón."
    eva "And I ran off, unable to say a word, all the way to this corner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1826
translate english c30s004_Eva_a63d5b17:

    # eva "Ahora lo puedes decir. Soy idiota. Prometo no romperte nada si lo dices."
    eva "You can say it now. I'm an idiot. I promise I won't break any of your bones if you say it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1827
translate english c30s004_Eva_4e33eff4:

    # mc "No eres idiota, [eva]. No estás acostumbrada a que la gente te diga cuánto te quiere."
    mc "You're not an idiot, [eva]. You're not used to people telling you how much they love you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1828
translate english c30s004_Eva_855d18df:

    # mc "No has sabido cómo reaccionar."
    mc "You didn't know how to react."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1830
translate english c30s004_Eva_895b4116:

    # eva "No es porque me hayan dicho que me quieren. Es porque me han dicho que me quieren como a su hermana."
    eva "It's not because they told me they love me. It's because they told me they love me like a sister."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1831
translate english c30s004_Eva_7f403519:

    # eva "Las dos estaban allí. Las dos se quieren un montón. Y me estaban incluyendo..."
    eva "They were both there. They love each other a lot. And they were including me..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1832
translate english c30s004_Eva_4cd46698:

    # eva "Nos estaban incluyendo a [ama] y a mí. Como sus hermanas."
    eva "They were including [ama] and me. As their sisters."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1833
translate english c30s004_Eva_4520f6ce:

    # mc "Ahora entiendo lo que te ha pasado. Y me reafirmo en lo que he dicho. No eres idiota."
    mc "Now I understand what happened to you. And I stand by what I said. You're not an idiot."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1835
translate english c30s004_Eva_bf2bed23:

    # eva "¿De verdad lo entiendes?"
    eva "Do you really understand?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1836
translate english c30s004_Eva_e3254ff8:

    # mc "Por supuesto que sí. Ya habías aceptado a dos hermanas con las que compartes genes. Ellas también te han dicho que te consideran sus hermanas."
    mc "Of course I do. You had already accepted two sisters you share genes with. They also told you they consider you their sister."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1838
translate english c30s004_Eva_d2053b24:

    # eva "Sí... pero eso es natural. Como dices, somos casi trillizas."
    eva "Yeah... but that's natural. As you said, we're almost triplets."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1839
translate english c30s004_Eva_19022a24:

    # mc "Eso es lo más importante. [lis] y [deb.nick] te han nombrado su hermana de elección."
    mc "That's the most important thing. [lis] and [deb.nick] have named you their sister by choice."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1841
translate english c30s004_Eva_61e7a1ba:

    # eva "Y yo no les he podido decir lo mismo."
    eva "And I couldn't say the same to them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1842
translate english c30s004_Eva_d56b9c53:

    # mc "Lo entiendo."
    mc "I understand."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1844
translate english c30s004_Eva_a85c1677:

    # eva "[dap] y [eri] no son mis hermanas de elección. Tenemos los mismos genes. Somos hermanas lo queramos o no, al menos hasta cierto punto."
    eva "[dap] and [eri] aren't my sisters by choice. We have the same genes. We're sisters whether we like it or not, at least to some extent."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1846
translate english c30s004_Eva_a1c4c5db:

    # eva "Con Diana y Fiona también compartía genes, y también eran mis hermanas."
    eva "I also shared genes with Diana and Fiona, and they were also my sisters."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1847
translate english c30s004_Eva_b2922e48:

    # eva "[ama], Beatrice, y Clarice eran mis hermanas de elección."
    eva "[ama], Beatrice, and Clarice were my sisters by choice."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1849
translate english c30s004_Eva_6c67dbbc:

    # eva "[ama], Fiona, Clarice, Diana, y Beatrice eran mis hermanas de elección."
    eva "[ama], Fiona, Clarice, Diana, and Beatrice were my sisters by choice."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1850
translate english c30s004_Eva_2041812b:

    # eva "Con ellas no compartía genes, pero compartía... otras cosas. Mi vida."
    eva "I didn't share genes with them, but I shared... other things. My life."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1851
translate english c30s004_Eva_47983c58:

    # mc "Es normal."
    mc "That's normal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1853
translate english c30s004_Eva_4104ee9a:

    # eva "No puedo decirles a [lis] y a [deb.nick] que las considero mis hermanas..."
    eva "I can't tell [lis] and [deb.nick] that I consider them my sisters..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1854
translate english c30s004_Eva_67dcdea5:

    # mc "Tiene sentido."
    mc "Makes sense."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1856
translate english c30s004_Eva_2c9c5fa9:

    # eva "Mis hermanas mueren a mi alrededor. A veces por culpa mía."
    eva "My sisters die around me. Sometimes it's my fault."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1857
translate english c30s004_Eva_ca47d6e3:

    # eva "Tenía cinco hermanas. Y ahora cuatro de ellas no están. Y a una la maté yo."
    eva "I had five sisters. And now four of them are gone. And I killed one of them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1858
translate english c30s004_Eva_6cb79bcd:

    # mc "Me dijisteis que murió en una explosión en un entrenamiento..."
    mc "You told me she died in an explosion during training..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1859
translate english c30s004_Eva_f6bbca12:

    # eva "Aquel día yo preparé los explosivos..."
    eva "I prepared the explosives that day..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1861
translate english c30s004_Eva_8615866e:

    # mc "No lo sabía, [eva]..."
    mc "I didn't know, [eva]..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1862
translate english c30s004_Eva_da59a365:

    # "La abrazas fuertemente. Con uno de esos abrazos típicos de los Marks que podrían romper costillas."
    "You hug her tightly. With one of those typical Marks hugs that could break some ribs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1863
translate english c30s004_Eva_776397c7:

    # "Creías que la entendías."
    "You thought you had started to understand her."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1864
translate english c30s004_Eva_348bff84:

    # "Te equivocabas."
    "You were wrong."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1865
translate english c30s004_Eva_749c5ee0:

    # "Nunca podrás entender qué se siente al pensar que eres el culpable de la muerte de un ser querido."
    "You'll never understand what it feels like to think you're to blame for the death of a loved one."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1866
translate english c30s004_Eva_d1d0c98e:

    # "Aún tienes mucho que aprender de lo que pasó en NTR en aquella época."
    "You still have a lot to learn about what happened at NTR back then."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1867
translate english c30s004_Eva_770d228a:

    # eva "Me estás... haciendo daño..."
    eva "You're... hurting me..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1868
translate english c30s004_Eva_ab3c76a7:

    # "Su voz suena extrañada. Casi sorprendida."
    "Her voice sounds puzzled. Almost surprised."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1870
translate english c30s004_Eva_9a87d34e:

    # mc "Lo siento."
    mc "I'm sorry."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1871
translate english c30s004_Eva_94af0af1:

    # "La frase sirve tanto para la fuerza del abrazo como para lo que tuvo que pasar siendo una niña en Aruba."
    "The line applies to both the strength of the hug and what she had to go through as a little girl in Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1872
translate english c30s004_Eva_53ee831c:

    # eva "Aaron dice que no fue culpa mía. Aquel día él estaba supervisando la preparación de los explosivos y dice que lo hice bien."
    eva "Aaron told me it wasn't my fault. He was supervising the preparation of the explosives that day, and he said I did it right."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1873
translate english c30s004_Eva_c7fac3f2:

    # eva "Pero..."
    eva "But..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1875
translate english c30s004_Eva_d12ea19e:

    # "La mano de la chica busca el collar que casi siempre lleva puesto. Hoy, el collar no está ahí."
    "The girl's hand searches for the necklace she almost always wears. Today, the metal heart isn't there."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1876
translate english c30s004_Eva_5e3354b4:

    # mc "Pero no te puedes quitar de la cabeza qué hubiera pasado si hubieras hecho algo diferente."
    mc "But you can't stop thinking about what would have happened if you had done something differently."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1878
translate english c30s004_Eva_d78ec5e1:

    # eva "Exacto. Siempre sabré que a Fiona la maté yo."
    eva "Exactly. I'll always know that I killed Fiona."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1879
translate english c30s004_Eva_37106757:

    # mc "Y piensas que, si les dices a [lis] y a [deb.nick] que las quieres como hermanas la estarías traicionando."
    mc "And you think that, if you tell [lis] and [deb.nick] that you love them like sisters, you'd be betraying her."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1880
translate english c30s004_Eva_dd52780b:

    # mc "Y a Beatrice, Clarice, y Diana."
    mc "And Beatrice, Clarice, and Diana."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1882
translate english c30s004_Eva_d87766ae:

    # eva "Sí... ¿Aún no piensas que soy idiota?"
    eva "Yes... You still don't think I'm an idiot?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1883
translate english c30s004_Eva_26622ef6:

    # mc "No, [eva]. Ninguno de nosotros puede pensarlo, porque ninguno de nosotros puede imaginar lo que experimentasteis."
    mc "No, [eva]. None of us would think that, because none of us can imagine what you all experienced."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1884
translate english c30s004_Eva_6f6fb122:

    # mc "Las seis pasasteis 24 horas al día juntas durante 12 años. Y pasasteis por muchas cosas malas juntas."
    mc "The six of you spent 24 hours a day together for 12 years. And you went through a lot of bad shit together."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1885
translate english c30s004_Eva_8ebf8376:

    # mc "Una relación de menos de un mes no se puede comparar a eso."
    mc "A relationship of less than a month can't compare to that."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1887
translate english c30s004_Eva_9cb7ce3b:

    # eva "Es... diferente..."
    eva "It's... different..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1888
translate english c30s004_Eva_3d31bd2a:

    # mc "Es exactamente eso. Diferente. Tuviste cinco hermanas y ahora tienes dos más."
    mc "That's exactly it. Different. You had five sisters and now you have two more."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1889
translate english c30s004_Eva_0c5252b3:

    # mc "Y ahora empiezas a ver al resto de las chicas bajo otra luz. Si no lo hicieras, no te hubiera afectado lo que [deb.nick] y [lis] dijeron."
    mc "And now you're starting to see the rest of the girls in a different light. If you didn't, what [deb.nick] and [lis] said wouldn't have affected you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1891
translate english c30s004_Eva_041d4bf7:

    # "Su mano vuelve a buscar el collar."
    "Her hand reaches for the necklace again."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1892
translate english c30s004_Eva_4e0c011e:

    # eva "Sí..."
    eva "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1893
translate english c30s004_Eva_684771b7:

    # mc "Aún no están a la altura de tus hermanas originales. Quizás no lo estén nunca."
    mc "They're still not on the same level as your original sisters. Maybe they never will be."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1894
translate english c30s004_Eva_4a04cd67:

    # mc "Pero empiezas a sentir por ellas cosas que sólo habías sentido por tus hermanas."
    mc "But you're starting to feel things for them that you've only ever felt for your sisters."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1896
translate english c30s004_Eva_476cc54a:

    # eva "Eso es lo que me da miedo. No solo las estoy traicionando, sino que..."
    eva "That's what scares me. Not only am I betraying them, but..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1897
translate english c30s004_Eva_2e65084d:

    # mc "No las vas a olvidar nunca. Ni las vas a sustituir."
    mc "You're never going to forget them. Nor are you going to replace them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1899
translate english c30s004_Eva_49527e9f:

    # mc "Cuando descubrimos que [sca] era mi medio hermana, no sustituyó a [emm]."
    mc "When we found out that [sca] was my half-sister, she didn't replace [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1901
translate english c30s004_Eva_ed547e37:

    # mc "Cuando [mar] de a luz, tendré un hermano o una hermana nuevos. No va a sustituir a [emm]."
    mc "When [mar] gives birth, I'll have a new brother or sister. They won't replace [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1903
translate english c30s004_Eva_d5ae5432:

    # mc "Si [mar] se queda embarazada, tendré un hermano o una hermana nuevos. No va a sustituir a [emm]."
    mc "If [mar] gets pregnant, I'll have a new brother or sister. They won't replace [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1905
translate english c30s004_Eva_71f60128:

    # mc "Si [mar] tiene otro bebé algún día, tendré un hermano o una hermana nuevos. No sustituiría a [emm]."
    mc "If [mar] has another baby someday, I'll have a new brother or sister. They wouldn't replace [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1907
translate english c30s004_Eva_6b0180f6:

    # mc "Si mi padre tuviera un bebé, tendría un hermano o una hermana nuevos. No sustituiría a [emm]."
    mc "If my dad had a baby, I'd have a new brother or sister. They wouldn't replace [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1909
translate english c30s004_Eva_af44863a:

    # eva "Pero eso es porque hay genes en común... Esto es diferente. Es elegir hermanas nuevas."
    eva "But that's because there are shared genes... This is different. This is choosing new sisters."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1910
translate english c30s004_Eva_473ff680:

    # "Está empezando a estar molesta por no poder convencerte de verlo desde su punto de vista."
    "She's starting to get annoyed that she can't convince you to see it from her point of view."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1911
translate english c30s004_Eva_51ece621:

    # "Es el momento de cambiar de táctica."
    "It's time to change tactics."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1912
translate english c30s004_Eva_82b376c5:

    # mc "Jamaal nunca sustituyó a [emm]. Yo elegí que fuera mi hermano."
    mc "Jamaal never replaced [emm]. I chose him to be my brother."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1913
translate english c30s004_Eva_0bf270b9:

    # mc "Lo sé. *Risa* Quizás fuera una elección rara."
    mc "I know. *Laugh* Maybe it was a weird choice."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1915
translate english c30s004_Eva_d485bceb:

    # eva "*Risa* Eres idiota."
    eva "*Laugh* You're an idiot."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1916
translate english c30s004_Eva_58e968a8:

    # "Por primera vez, no hay una nota de tristeza en su risa."
    "For the first time, there isn't a hint of sadness in her laughter."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1917
translate english c30s004_Eva_d41fcbb1:

    # "Parece que tus palabras la están empezando a convencer de lo equivocada que está."
    "It seems your words are starting to convince her of how wrong she is."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1918
translate english c30s004_Eva_7f1fdae5:

    # mc "*Risa* También lo sé."
    mc "*Laugh* I know that too."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1919
translate english c30s004_Eva_d9b61fcc:

    # mc "Pero lo que quiero decir es que puedes tener varias hermanas de elección y no se sustituirán entre ellas."
    mc "But what I mean is that you can have several sisters by choice and they won't replace each other."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1920
translate english c30s004_Eva_c59fa87f:

    # mc "Pasa lo mismo con la familia. ¿Te acuerdas de la Navidad en la playa?"
    mc "It's the same with family. Do you remember Christmas at the beach?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1922
translate english c30s004_Eva_1016b3e0:

    # eva "Sí. ¿A qué te refieres?"
    eva "Yeah. What about it?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1923
translate english c30s004_Eva_0cabf84d:

    # mc "Me dijiste algo como 'Esa no es mi familia. Mi familia es [ama]. Y ni siquiera es Navidad'."
    mc "You told me something like 'That's not my family. My family is [ama]. And it's not even Christmas.'"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1925
translate english c30s004_Eva_195614e1:

    # eva "¡Es que no era Navidad!"
    eva "Because it wasn't Christmas!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1926
translate english c30s004_Eva_dc21964f:

    # mc "Sabes que no es eso a lo que me refiero."
    mc "You know that's not what I mean."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1927
translate english c30s004_Eva_1d7bfbec:

    # mc "Ahora consideras tu familia a las chicas y a mí. Quizás incluso a Jamaal."
    mc "Now you consider the girls and me your family. Maybe even Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1928
translate english c30s004_Eva_21569a58:

    # mc "*Risa* Tú también puedes hacer elecciones raras."
    mc "*Laugh* You can make weird choices, too."

