    # mc "No sé. A lo mejor tienes razón."
    mc "I don't know. Maybe you're right."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2093
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_44b5e884:

    # mcp "(Creo que nunca me cansaré de verlas... Y con ese vestido están espectaculares.)"
    mcp "(I don't think I'll ever get tired of looking at them... And they look spectacular in that dress.)"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2095
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_0c08fa27:

    # nor "Y, por lo que sé, ayudaste a [mar] a ir a hacer la compra, y fuiste a recoger a las chicas al café..."
    nor "And, as far as I know, you helped [mar] with the grocery shopping, and you went to pick up the girls from the cafe..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2096
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_18d8ed55:

    # nor "Te seguimos necesitando, pero no todos los días hay un gran problema que resolver."
    nor "We still need you, but there isn't a huge problem to solve every day."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2097
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_9ba77f4f:

    # mc "*Risa* Por suerte."
    mc "*Laugh* Luckily."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2099
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_9dd5ed65:

    # nor "Y otras veces no te pedimos cosas que por norma te pediríamos a ti."
    nor "And other times we don't ask you for things that we normally would."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2100
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_41799d59:

    # nor "Ahora voy a ir a buscar a tu abuela y a [bet] al aeropuerto, por ejemplo."
    nor "Right now, I'm going to pick up your grandma and [bet] from the airport, for example."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2101
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_281e92c7:

    # mc "Eso por norma lo hacía yo..."
    mc "I would usually do that..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2103
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_1280cb3d:

    # nor "Lo sé, pero era porque yo estaba ocupada. Ahora mismo no tengo nada que hacer, y me apetece ver a mi madre."
    nor "I know, but that was because I was busy. Right now, I have nothing to do, and I feel like seeing my mom."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2104
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_5bb0865f:

    # nor "*Risa* Si hace un mes me hubieran dicho que podría decir esa frase..."
    nor "*Laugh* If someone had told me a month ago that I'd be able to say that sentence..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2105
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_1c516d0c:

    # mc "*Risa* No se lo hubiera creído nadie. Estabas super tensa cuando tenía que venir, y mírate ahora."
    mc "*Laugh* Nobody would have believed it. You were super tense before she came to visit, and look at you now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2107
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_1386f66b:

    # nor "Ha cambiado mucho desde que vino a casa. Nos hemos hecho amigas..."
    nor "She's changed a lot since she came to the house. We've become friends..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2108
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_2b10e778:

    # mc "Algo que hubiera sido imposible hace unos años."
    mc "Something that would have been impossible a few years ago."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2110
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_ab2d9feb:

    # nor "Lo importante es que ahora es posible que lo seamos."
    nor "The important thing is that it's possible for us to be that way now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2111
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_c742d32d:

    # nor "En el momento en que descubrimos que teníamos más cosas en común de lo que pensábamos..."
    nor "The moment we discovered we had more things in common than we thought..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2112
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_892ed13a:

    # mc "Dejasteis aparcadas vuestras diferencias. Me alegro mucho por las dos."
    mc "You put your differences aside. I'm really happy for both of you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2113
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_f8eb8161:

    # mc "También ayudó que dejara de querer dirigir la vida de todo el mundo."
    mc "It also helped that she stopped wanting to run everyone's lives."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2115
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_36d8656b:

    # nor "*Risa* ¡Oh! ¡Eso todavía quiere hacerlo! Pero nadie se lo permite."
    nor "*Laugh* Oh! She still wants to do that! But nobody lets her."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2116
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_a0b011e0:

    # nor "También ayudó mucho que vuestro juego de verdad o reto la inmunizara sobre los besos en la familia."
    nor "It also helped a lot that your game of truth or dare desensitized her to kissing within the family."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2117
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_16e15063:

    # mc "*Risa* Tienes razón. Casi le da un infarto aquella primera noche."
    mc "*Laugh* You're right. She almost had a heart attack that first night."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2121
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_6e658155:

    # nor "La tentación de quedarme aquí criticando a la antigua versión de mi madre es muy grande."
    nor "The temptation to stay here and criticize the old version of my mom is huge."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2122
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_81437ea6:

    # nor "Pero si no llego a tiempo al aeropuerto se va a enfadar."
    nor "But if I don't get to the airport on time, she's going to get mad. And rightly so."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2123
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_89e735bf:

    # mc "*Risa* No creo que nunca cambie en lo estricta que es con la puntualidad. Te veo luego."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't think she'll ever change how strict she is about punctuality. See you later."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2125
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_ed234425:

    # nor "Creo que [sam.nick] quería hablar contigo de algo. A lo mejor te pide algo que hace que se te pase un poco la paranoia."
    nor "I think [sam.nick] wanted to talk to you about something. Maybe she'll ask you for something that will help you get over your paranoia a bit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2126
translate english c30s004_NorGetsBetMee_f5d64d64:

    # mc "*Risa* Mientras no me pida que vaya a buscar a Jamaal..."
    mc "*Laugh* As long as she doesn't ask me to go pick up Jamaal..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2130
translate english c30s004_getJam_d9b95fcc:

    # "Das una vuelta por la casa, buscando a [sam]. La encuentras hablando con [oma] y [meg]."
    "You walk around the house, looking for [sam]. You find her talking to [oma] and [meg]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2131
translate english c30s004_getJam_58732a6b:

    # "Hoy ha venido casi todo el mundo a comer. Sólo han faltado las chicas que están trabajando en el café, [mad.nick], y Jamaal."
    "Almost everyone came to eat today. The only ones missing are the girls working at the cafe, [mad.nick], and Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2132
translate english c30s004_getJam_a42c1eab:

    # "Incluso [meg] ha venido. Es la primera vez que viene fuera del fin de semana o el lunes, que es su día libre."
    "Even [meg] came. It's the first time she has come outside of the weekend or Monday, which is her day off."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2133
translate english c30s004_getJam_85e79d42:

    # mc "Hey, [sam.nick]. [nor] me ha dicho que me estabas buscando."
    mc "Hey, [sam.nick]. [nor] told me you were looking for me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2135
translate english c30s004_getJam_c33f7b7e:

    # meg "*Risa* ¿Solo 'Hey, [sam.nick]'? ¿[oma] y yo somos invisibles?"
    meg "*Laugh* Just 'Hey, [sam.nick]'? Are [oma] and I invisible?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2136
translate english c30s004_getJam_4606a7e1:

    # oma "*Risa* Este tío quiere que lo arreste. Seguro que hay alguna oscura normativa que me permite hacerlo."
    oma "*Laugh* This guy wants me to arrest him. I'm sure there's some obscure regulation that lets me do it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2137
translate english c30s004_getJam_906ef3de:

    # sam "*Risa* Chicas, dadle un respiro. Ha empezado por la más guapa. Estoy segura de que os iba a saludar a vosotras también."
    sam "*Laugh* Girls, give him a break. He started with the prettiest one. I'm sure he was going to say hi to you guys too."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2139
translate english c30s004_getJam_97124512:

    # meg "*Risa* O a lo mejor ha empezado por la más vieja porque quiere saludarte antes de que te tengas que ir a cambiar los pañales de la incontinencia."
    meg "*Laugh* Or maybe he started with the oldest because he wants to say hi before you have to go change your adult diapers."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2140
translate english c30s004_getJam_38352e95:

    # oma "*Risa* [sam.nick], yo no me metería con [meg]. Esta chica tiene la lengua afilada."
    oma "*Laugh* [sam.nick], I wouldn't mess with [meg]. This girl has a sharp tongue."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2141
translate english c30s004_getJam_54a2a052:

    # sam "*Risa* Vale, vale. Ha empezado por orden de edad y, coincidentemente, por la más guapa."
    sam "*Laugh* Okay, okay. He started by age and, coincidentally, with the prettiest."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2142
translate english c30s004_getJam_1104dc0b:

    # sam "Jamaal ya me había avisado de las cosas que pueden salir de esa boca. Y no me refiero solo a cómo canta."
    sam "Jamaal had already warned me about the things that can come out of that mouth. And I don't just mean her singing."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2143
translate english c30s004_getJam_c4ce7c62:

    # mc "Hola, [oma] y [meg]. ¿Contentas?"
    mc "Hi, [oma] and [meg]. Happy?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2145
translate english c30s004_getJam_0e536994:

    # todas "*Risa* Sí."
    todas "*Laugh* Yes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2146
translate english c30s004_getJam_293ce005:

    # mc "Bueno, ¿me necesitabas para algo, [sam.nick]?"
    mc "Anyway, did you need me for something, [sam.nick]?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2148
translate english c30s004_getJam_65211fba:

    # sam "Me ha escrito Jamaal y me ha dicho que ya ha acabado el trabajo. ¿Puedes ir a buscarlo?"
    sam "Jamaal texted me and said he's done with his online meeting. Can you go pick him up?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2149
translate english c30s004_getJam_34aa9838:

    # mc "Ya se ha acabado la comida. *Risa* ¿Para qué quiere venir?"
    mc "The food's already gone. *Laugh* Why does he want to come?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2151
translate english c30s004_getJam_33fafc71:

    # sam "No seas idiota. Mi hijo piensa en más cosas aparte de la comida. Algunas veces, al menos."
    sam "Don't be an idiot. My son thinks about more than just food. Sometimes, at least."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2153
translate english c30s004_getJam_1d5084d6:

    # meg "¿Desde cuándo?"
    meg "Since when?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2155
translate english c30s004_getJam_633a199f:

    # oma "Supongo que desde que está con Anthony, ¿no?"
    oma "I guess since he's been with Anthony, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2157
translate english c30s004_getJam_57113e86:

    # sam "*Risa* Más o menos. Diría que Jamaal ha perdido cuatro o cinco libras desde empezaron a salir."
    sam "*Laugh* More or less. I'd say Jamaal has lost four or five pounds since they started dating."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2158
translate english c30s004_getJam_8fe31f3d:

    # mc "¿Jamaal está adelgazando? ¡Eso quiere decir que van en serio!"
    mc "Jamaal is losing weight? That means they're getting serious!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2159
translate english c30s004_getJam_6e67cb25:

    # "No quieres que te cuenten cotilleos. Si vas a recoger a Jamaal, ya se lo preguntarás a él."
    "You don't want to hear gossip. If you're going to pick Jamaal up, you'll ask him yourself."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2160
translate english c30s004_getJam_2b38d1f8:

    # mc "Pero ¿por qué no me ha escrito a mí para que vaya a buscarlo?"
    mc "But why didn't he text me to come pick him up?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2162
translate english c30s004_getJam_c7c18dd7:

    # oma "Mmmm... ¿Llevas el móvil encima?"
    oma "Mmmm... Do you have your phone on you?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2163
translate english c30s004_getJam_e09a5724:

    # "Te palpas los bolsillos buscando el móvil sin encontrarlo."
    "You pat your pockets looking for your phone but don't find it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2164
translate english c30s004_getJam_bf089608:

    # mc "Ermmm... No. Lo he dejado cargando en mi habitación."
    mc "Ermmm... No. I left it charging in my room."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2166
translate english c30s004_getJam_8dcf5021:

    # meg "Pues por eso. A lo mejor te ha escrito y, al no contestarle, ha escrito a [sam.nick]."
    meg "Well, that's why. Maybe he texted you and, when you didn't answer, he texted [sam.nick]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2167
translate english c30s004_getJam_34baac08:

    # mc "Tiene lógica... Bueno, voy a buscar a Jam. Os veo en un rato."
    mc "Makes sense... Well, I'm going to get Jam. See you in a bit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2169
translate english c30s004_getJam_9a0d788d:

    # sam "Sube la maleta que hay en la camioneta a mi casa, por favor."
    sam "Take the suitcase that's in the truck up to my apartment, please."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2170
translate english c30s004_getJam_4a9677a8:

    # sam "Supongo que [mar] ya la habrá dejado ahí. Si no hay maleta, pregúntale a ella."
    sam "I guess [mar] already left it there. If there's no suitcase, ask her."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2171
translate english c30s004_getJam_1f5b924d:

    # "No es la primera maleta con ropa que llevas a esa casa."
    "It's not the first suitcase full of clothes you've taken to that house."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2172
translate english c30s004_getJam_cb9501e9:

    # "[emm] o [mar] les han regalado ropa a [sim] y a [sam] algunas veces, especialmente cuando van mal de dinero."
    "[emm] or [mar] have given clothes to [sim] and [sam] a few times, especially when they're tight on money."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2173
translate english c30s004_getJam_8de53067:

    # "Lo del supermercado de hace unos días te enseñó que es uno de esos momentos para ellas."
    "The supermarket thing a few days ago showed you that it's one of those times for them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2174
translate english c30s004_getJam_d9146de0:

    # "Lástima que no quieran aceptar ayuda. Al menos esperas que los planes que has trazado con [nor] sean una forma de ayudarlas."
    "Too bad they won't accept help. At least you hope the plans you've made with [nor] will be a way to help them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2175
translate english c30s004_getJam_67e86de4:

    # "También esperas que no te maten cuando se enteren. Por suerte, estarás en Aruba por entonces."
    "You also hope they don't kill you when they find out. Luckily, you'll be in Aruba by then."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2176
translate english c30s004_getJam_4a4167a5:

    # mc "OK. Nos vemos luego."
    mc "OK. See you later."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2178
translate english c30s004_getJam_ffa166e7:

    # "Ciertamente hay un mensaje de Jamaal en tu móvil."
    "Sure enough, there's a message from Jamaal on your phone."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2179
translate english c30s004_getJam_ee70e584:

    # "La maleta está en el asiento trasero, con lo que conduces hasta casa de Jamaal."
    "The suitcase is in the back seat, so you drive to Jamaal's house."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2181
translate english c30s004_getJam_6092ea65:

    # "*Ding-Dong*"
    "*Ding-Dong*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2182
translate english c30s004_getJam_aa4b93a4:

    # jam "*A través de la puerta* ¡Voy!"
    jam "*Through the door* I'm coming!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2184
translate english c30s004_getJam_c706d1e7:

    # jam "¡Ya era hora de que vinieras!"
    jam "It's about time you got here!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2185
translate english c30s004_getJam_cc585557:

    # mc "¿Qué haces vestido así? ¿Ahora te pones traje para hacer videoconferencias?"
    mc "Why are you dressed like that? Do you wear suits for video calls now?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2187
translate english c30s004_getJam_0276fe5a:

    # jam "¿Tú eres tonto? Hoy es la fiesta. Llegan Tía [bet] y [mee]."
    jam "Are you dumb? Today's the party. Aunt [bet] and [mee] are arriving."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2188
translate english c30s004_getJam_71d7bc69:

    # mc "¿Qué fiesta? Nadie me ha dicho nada..."
    mc "What party? No one told me anything..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2190
translate english c30s004_getJam_e77a4cbb:

    # jam "¿Nadie te ha dicho que íbamos a dar una fiesta porque vuelven [mee] y Tía [bet]?"
    jam "No one told you we were throwing a party because [mee] and Aunt [bet] are coming back?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2191
translate english c30s004_getJam_601abea2:

    # jam "Creo que tendré que hablar con esas chicas. La comunicación no fluye fuera del grupo de WhatsUp."
    jam "I guess I'll have to talk to those girls. Communication doesn't really flow outside the WhatsUp group."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2192
translate english c30s004_getJam_fa33bf59:

    # mc "Espera... creo que sí que me dijeron algo, pero no recuerdo cuando."
    mc "Wait... I think they did tell me something, but I don't remember when."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2193
translate english c30s004_getJam_5c7c3dfe:

    # mc "Y no voy vestido para una fiesta. Bueno, tengo mejor pinta que tú con ese traje, pero..."
    mc "And I'm not dressed for a party. Well, I still look better than you in that suit, but..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2195
translate english c30s004_getJam_2c463c57:

    # jam "Me ha dicho mi madre que metían tu ropa en la maleta o no te iba a dar tiempo de cambiarte."
    jam "My mom told me they packed your clothes in the suitcase, otherwise you wouldn't have time to change."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2196
translate english c30s004_getJam_c479d9e4:

    # jam "Pasa a la habitación de [sim] a cambiarte, si quieres, mientras yo recojo la mía. Deja el resto de la ropa en la maleta."
    jam "Go to [sim]'s room to change, if you want, while I tidy up mine. Leave the rest of the clothes in the suitcase."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2197
translate english c30s004_getJam_ed1b131d:

    # mc "OK. Espérame ahí sentado. Pero me tendrás que dejar pasar, ¿no?"
    mc "OK. Sit there and wait for me. But you'll have to let me enter, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2199
translate english c30s004_getJam_ae9c5fad:

    # mc "Por cierto, ¿qué tal con Anthony?"
    mc "By the way, how are things with Anthony?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2200
translate english c30s004_getJam_cbcbcc15:

    # mc "Desde que estás con él no te vemos apenas."
    mc "Since you've been with him, we barely see you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2201
translate english c30s004_getJam_372070e1:

    # mc "No es que tenga ganas de ver tu fea cara, pero..."
    mc "Not that I'm eager to see your ugly face, but..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2202
translate english c30s004_getJam_2fd4f180:

    # jam "*A través de la puerta* ¿Mi fea cara? ¿Tú te has mirado a un espejo últimamente?"
    jam "*Through the door* My ugly face? Have you looked in a mirror lately?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2203
translate english c30s004_getJam_db2afdc8:

    # mc "Yo sí. ¿Y tú? Los espejos seguramente se descuelguen de la pared y salgan corriendo cuando te acercas."
    mc "I have. What about you? Mirrors probably jump off the wall and run away when you get close."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2204
translate english c30s004_getJam_780024a2:

    # mc "Pero me doy cuenta de que, hablando contigo a través de una puerta, no me dan ganas de vomitar."
    mc "But I just realized that, talking to you through a door, I don't feel like throwing up."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2205
translate english c30s004_getJam_94239c3f:

    # jam "*A través de la puerta* *Risa* Eso es porque [sim] no tiene un espejo en el interior de la puerta para que te reflejes."
    jam "*Through the door* *Laugh* That's because [sim] doesn't have a mirror on the back of the door for you to see your reflection."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2206
translate english c30s004_getJam_52f3b3ab:

    # mc "*Risa* Yo no soy feo. Tengo una belleza... Picassiana... Lo que me convierte en una obra de arte."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm not ugly. I have a... Picasso-esque beauty... Which makes me a work of art."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2207
translate english c30s004_getJam_4f51aca3:

    # jam "*A través de la puerta* *Risa* Más bien una belleza Daliniana. Parece que la cara se te ha derretido en algunas partes."
    jam "*Through the door* *Laugh* More like a Dali-esque beauty. It looks like your face melted in some places."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2208
translate english c30s004_getJam_3f74aaa3:

    # mc "*Risa* Acabas de reconocer que soy una obra de arte. Punto para mí."
    mc "*Laugh* You just admitted I'm a work of art. Point for me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2209
translate english c30s004_getJam_7ae48021:

    # jam "*A través de la puerta* *Risa* ¡Mielda!"
    jam "*Through the door* *Laugh* Sheep!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2210
translate english c30s004_getJam_eafb011d:

    # mc "Pero no me has contestado a la pregunta sobre Anthony."
    mc "But you didn't answer my question about Anthony."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2211
translate english c30s004_getJam_34377d13:

    # jam "*A través de la puerta* Te lo explico cuando acabes de cambiarte. Me jode hablar con una puerta."
    jam "*Through the door* I'll explain it when you're done changing. It pisses me off talking to a door."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2212
