    jam "Let's go see your girl. She's waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2606
translate english c30s006_lastWedding_09988987:

    # jam "Sígueme. Nos toca ir a ver a [personaje.nick]."
    jam "Follow me. It's time to go see [personaje.nick]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2608
translate english c30s006_lastWedding_43b5562c:

    # jam "Sígueme. Nos toca ir a ver a [personaje]."
    jam "Follow me. It's time to go see [personaje]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2611
translate english c30s006_firstWedding_e810d49e:

    # jam "Ve a hablar con ella. Tiene algo que decirte. Yo te esperaré aquí."
    jam "Go talk to her. She has something to tell you. I'll wait for you here."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2612
translate english c30s006_firstWedding_090fb5ae:

    # jam "Mi madre me ha dicho que no me cocinará postres durante un mes si me inmiscuyo."
    jam "My mom told me she won't bake me desserts for a month if I meddle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2613
translate english c30s006_firstWedding_17233e76:

    # mc "*Risa* Tu madre te tiene pillado por los huevos con la comida."
    mc "*Laugh* Your mom has you by the balls with her food."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2615
translate english c30s006_firstWedding_74610427:

    # mc "Te veo en un rato."
    mc "See you in a bit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2622
translate english c30s006_approach_f9890838:

    # "Te acercas a [nombre] con un nudo en el estómago. No sabes qué esperar."
    "You approach [nombre] with a knot in your stomach. You don't know what to expect."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2624
translate english c30s006_approach_ade7721f:

    # mc "Hola, [nombre]. Estás preciosa. Alguien me ha dicho que quieres hablar conmigo."
    mc "Hello, [nombre]. You look beautiful. Someone told me you wanted to talk to me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2626
translate english c30s006_approach_154c27ab:

    # mc "Hola, [nombre]. Alguien me ha dicho que quieres hablar conmigo."
    mc "Hello, [nombre]. Someone told me you wanted to talk to me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2628
translate english c30s006_approach_ba3e5355:

    # mc "Hola, Meemaw. Estás preciosa. Alguien me ha dicho que quieres hablar conmigo."
    mc "Hello, Meemaw. You look beautiful. Someone told me you wanted to talk to me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2630
translate english c30s006_approach_9aad732a:

    # personaje "*Risa* ¿Te lo ha dicho un pajarito?"
    personaje "*Laugh* A little bird told you?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2631
translate english c30s006_approach_b980ac90:

    # mc "*Risa* Un pájaro negro, grande y comilón. Un buitre carroñero."
    mc "*Laugh* A big, black, greedy bird. A scavenging vulture."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2634
translate english c30s006_sentence_3c73706e:

    # mc "¿Habéis ensayado esa frase? ¿La de 'con este tatuaje me declaro tu esposa'?"
    mc "Did you guys rehearse that line? The 'with this tattoo I declare myself your wife' one?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2635
translate english c30s006_sentence_227d209a:

    # personaje "*Risa* Sí. No queríamos hacer unos votos eternos o que los votos de una chica eclipsaran a los de otra."
    personaje "*Laugh* Yes. We didn't want to make eternal vows or have one girl's vows overshadow another's."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2636
translate english c30s006_sentence_d9c29990:

    # personaje "Sabemos que se te hará repetitivo, pero... Tuvimos que llegar a un acuerdo."
    personaje "We know it'll get repetitive for you, but... We needed to reach an agreement."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2637
translate english c30s006_sentence_55f5017f:

    # mc "Me parece una idea fantástica."
    mc "I think it's a fantastic idea."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2641
translate english c30s006_tattoo_6086d772:

    # mc "No tengo ninguna queja sobre que te hayas hecho el tatuaje, pero... ¿qué hubiera pasado si no me gustaran?"
    mc "I have no complaints about you getting the tattoo, but... what would have happened if I didn't like them?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2643
translate english c30s006_tattoo_e052a1d5:

    # personaje "Sales con [eri], con lo que no hemos dudado ni por un momento que te desagradaran los tatuajes."
    personaje "You're dating [eri], so we never thought for a second that you'd dislike tattoos."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2645
translate english c30s006_tattoo_dd1701c5:

    # personaje "Como tú has dicho varias veces, hay que aceptar a todo el mundo como es."
    personaje "Like you've said several times, you have to accept everyone as they are."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2646
translate english c30s006_tattoo_c7c1aa8f:

    # personaje "Ahora te toca aceptarme a mí con un tatuaje."
    personaje "Now it's your turn to accept me with a tattoo."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2647
translate english c30s006_tattoo_ae6724a1:

    # mc "Y los tatuajes son para siempre."
    mc "And tattoos are forever."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2650
translate english c30s006_BetMee_77ed95c5:

    # personaje "No se lo digas a ellas, pero creo que ahora mismo odio a Tía [bet] y a [mee]. *Risa*"
    personaje "Don't tell them, but I think right now I hate Aunt [bet] and [mee]. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2651
translate english c30s006_BetMee_d777ad4d:

    # mc "Me lo puedo imaginar. A mí también me gustaría pasar más tiempo aquí contigo, pero..."
    mc "I can imagine. I'd also like to spend more time here with you, but..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2653
translate english c30s006_BetMee_04a7a254:

    # personaje "Pero esto es una fiesta para ellas. Aunque nos hayamos inmiscuido un poco antes de que empiece."
    personaje "But this is a party for them. Even if we intruded a bit before it started."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2654
translate english c30s006_BetMee_97b0cb23:

    # "Crees que recordarás este día por razones diferentes a la bienvenida de [mee] y [bet]."
    "You think you'll remember this day for different reasons than welcoming [mee] and [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2656
translate english c30s006_BetMee_888b95d5:

    # personaje "Pero esto es una fiesta para ellas. Aunque me haya inmiscuido un poco antes de que empiece."
    personaje "But this is a party for them. Even if I intruded a bit before it started."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2657
translate english c30s006_BetMee_e82c9358:

    # "Crees que recordarás este día por una razón diferente a la bienvenida de [mee] y [bet]."
    "You think you'll remember this day for a different reason than welcoming [mee] and [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2660
translate english c30s006_orangutan_852d27ae:

    # mc "Pero no acabo de entender por qué un tatuaje."
    mc "But I just don't understand why a tattoo."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2661
translate english c30s006_orangutan_272fee18:

    # personaje "Hay varias respuestas. La primera es que un tatuaje no se puede perder. Se puede quitar, pero... me entiendes."
    personaje "There are several answers. The first is that a tattoo can't be lost. It can be removed, but... you know what I mean."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2663
translate english c30s006_orangutan_d954e198:

    # personaje "Después, nunca nos podríamos poner de acuerdo en qué modelo de anillo queremos. Lo que significa que deberías llevar un anillo diferente por cada chica."
    personaje "Plus, we could never agree on what kind of ring we want. Which means you'd have to wear a different ring for each girl."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2664
translate english c30s006_orangutan_68dedb05:

    # personaje "Si sigues añadiendo chicas al harén, acabarías arrastrando los brazos como un orangután, debido al peso de los anillos."
    personaje "If you keep adding girls to the harem, you'd end up dragging your arms like an orangutan, due to the weight of the rings."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2665
translate english c30s006_orangutan_54f45397:

    # personaje "Y, además, cada una de nosotras podíamos personalizarlo para que significara algo único."
    personaje "And besides, each of us could customize it so it meant something unique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2667
translate english c30s006_orangutan_c34d3535:

    # personaje "Un anillo podría servir para una boda... oficial. Un tatuaje nos hace únicos hasta cierto punto."
    personaje "A ring could work for an... official wedding. A tattoo makes us unique to a certain extent."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2668
translate english c30s006_orangutan_7a23e400:

    # personaje "Además, no creo que pudiera encontrar un anillo que simbolizara lo que este tatuaje significa para nosotros."
    personaje "Besides, I don't think I could find a ring that symbolizes what this tattoo means to us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2669
translate english c30s006_orangutan_d56b9c53:

    # mc "Lo entiendo."
    mc "I get it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2674
translate english c30s006_mad_8492952e:

    # "Sigues a Jamaal hasta la piscina, donde [mad.nick] está esperándote."
    "You follow Jamaal to the pool, where [mad.nick] is waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2688
translate english c30s006_mad_bb140fbb:

    # mad "Estoy nerviosa. Me ha tocado ser la primera..."
    mad "I'm nervous. I have to go first..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2689
translate english c30s006_mad_a49c4ab1:

    # mad "Dicen que fue idea mía..."
    mad "They say it was my idea..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2691
translate english c30s006_mad_51c1f2ff:

    # mad "Estoy nerviosa..."
    mad "I'm nervous..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2692
translate english c30s006_mad_666c7cbc:

    # mc "Aún no sé de qué va esto, con lo que no sé por qué lo estás. Pero yo empiezo a ponerme nervioso si nos vemos y no me das un beso."
    mc "I still don't know what this is all about, so I don't know why you're nervous. But I start getting nervous if we see each other and you don't give me a kiss."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2694
translate english c30s006_mad_80eabb36:

    # "La chica te besa apasionadamente durante unos segundos que se hacen cortos."
    "The girl kisses you passionately for a few seconds that feel too short."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2695
translate english c30s006_mad_56b2c467:

    # "Su cuerpo se va relajando tal como pasa el tiempo."
    "Her body relaxes as time passes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2696
translate english c30s006_mad_e886dc8f:

    # "En algún sitio leíste que un beso debe durar 20 segundos como mínimo para liberar toda la oxitocina. ¿O eso eran los abrazos?"
    "You read somewhere that a kiss should last at least 20 seconds to release all the oxytocin. Or was that hugs?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2698
translate english c30s006_mad_e958c695:

    # mc "¿Menos nerviosa?"
    mc "Less nervous?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2699
translate english c30s006_mad_19664287:

    # mad "Un poco..."
    mad "A little..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2700
translate english c30s006_mad_bceaa42d:

    # mc "Bueno, querías hablar conmigo, ¿no?"
    mc "Well, you wanted to talk to me, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2703
translate english c30s006_mad_106f455a:

    # mad "Bueno, todo empezó cuando le pediste matrimonio a [kia] y después me lo pediste a mí con aquel post-it..."
    mad "Well, it all started when you proposed to [kia] and then you proposed to me with that post-it..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2705
translate english c30s006_mad_b4259883:

    # mad "Bueno, todo empezó cuando me pediste matrimonio con aquel post-it."
    mad "Well, it all started when you proposed to me with that post-it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2706
translate english c30s006_mad_f4770c25:

    # mc "Y descubrimos que tienes un fetiche con el matrimonio. *Risa*"
    mc "And we discovered you have a marriage fetish. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2707
translate english c30s006_mad_eeaae653:

    # mad "Sí..."
    mad "Yeah..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2709
translate english c30s006_mad_1a7bb245:

    # mad "No sé si te has fijado, pero casi nunca llevo anillos."
    mad "I don't know if you've noticed, but I hardly ever wear rings."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2710
translate english c30s006_mad_e5db7433:

    # mc "Me había fijado. Yo tampoco los llevo, pero por un anillo de boda sería capaz de cambiar la costumbre."
    mc "I noticed. I don't wear them either, but for a wedding ring I'd be willing to change that habit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2713
translate english c30s006_mad_b916222b:

    # mad "¿Un anillo por cada chica? ¿El anillo de qué chica va en el dedo anular?"
    mad "A ring for each girl? Which girl's ring goes on the ring finger?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2714
translate english c30s006_mad_c22d41c7:

    # mad "Seríamos incapaces de ponernos de acuerdo en un modelo de anillo para que tú sólo llevaras uno."
    mad "We'd never be able to agree on a ring design, so you'd only have to wear one."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2715
translate english c30s006_mad_a29dd635:

    # mc "Eso podría ser complicado. Cada una querría algo a su gusto."
    mc "That would be complicated. Each of you would want something to fit your own taste."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2717
translate english c30s006_mad_16bcbbaf:

    # mad "Pero tu post-it resolvió ese problema. Me dio una idea."
    mad "But your post-it solved that problem. It gave me an idea."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2719
translate english c30s006_mad_2ad34fa0:

    # mad "Cada una de nosotras podía tener su anillo personalizado a su gusto. Con algo que significara algo para ella."
    mad "Each of us would have our own personalized ring to our liking. With something that meant something to her."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2720
translate english c30s006_mad_7c19a090:

    # mad "No necesitamos un anillo físico para demostrar que estamos juntos."
    mad "We don't need a physical ring to show that we're together."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2721
translate english c30s006_mad_f418ae84:

    # mc "No entiendo a qué te refieres."
    mc "I don't understand what you mean."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2723
translate english c30s006_mad_8f78ca83:

    # mad "[mc] Marks, con este anillo me declaro tu esposa. Si quieres, claro."
    mad "[mc] Marks, with this ring I declare myself your wife. If you want, of course."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2724
translate english c30s006_mad_0acbaeac:

    # mc "¡Por supuesto que quiero!"
    mc "Of course I want to!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2726
translate english c30s006_mad_31428ada:

    # "Tu nueva esposa se gira y te besa más apasionadamente todavía que antes."
    "Your new wife turns around and kisses you even more passionately than before."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2727
translate english c30s006_mad_c0c1886a:

    # "Ya no hay nervios. Solo alegría. Ahora entiendes por qué nadie te ha dicho de qué iba esto."
    "There are no more nerves. Only joy. Now you understand why no one told you what this was about."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2728
translate english c30s006_mad_54f636a8:

    # "El beso es aún más largo que el anterior. Pese a todo se te hace corto."
    "The kiss is even longer than the last one. Despite everything, it feels short to you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2731
translate english c30s006_mad_ca04a8d2:

    # mc "¿Te has tatuado el dibujo que hice en el post-it?"
    mc "Did you get a tattoo of the drawing I made on the post-it?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2733
translate english c30s006_mad_25d1fa23:

    # mad "Al hacer el dibujo del anillo resolviste el tema del anillo personalizado."
    mad "By drawing the ring, you solved the issue of the custom ring."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2734
translate english c30s006_mad_313deb7c:

    # mad "Significó tanto para mí que no quiero ningún otro anillo."
    mad "It meant so much to me that I don't want any other ring."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2735
translate english c30s006_mad_cd43271f:

    # mc "¿Cada una de vosotras se ha tatuado un anillo?"
    mc "Did each of you get a ring tattooed?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2737
translate english c30s006_mad_7e142eda:

    # mad "Eso lo tendrás que descubrir tú solo. La parte mala del harén es que no podemos disfrutar de este momento mucho rato."
    mad "You'll have to find that out for yourself. The bad part about the harem is that we can't enjoy this moment for very long."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2739
translate english c30s006_mad_d4c19048:

    # mad "Hay otra chica esperándote y Jamaal tiene que estar impacientándose."
    mad "There's another girl waiting for you, and Jamaal must be getting impatient."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2741
translate english c30s006_mad_eb4b80b1:

    # mad "Hay otras chicas esperándote y Jamaal tiene que estar impacientándose."
    mad "There are other girls waiting for you, and Jamaal must be getting impatient."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2742
translate english c30s006_mad_7f255f25:

    # mc "*Risa* Odio al buitre carroñero."
    mc "*Laugh* I hate that scavenging vulture."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2744
translate english c30s006_mad_706ade4b:

    # mad "Al hacer el dibujo del anillo resolviste el tema de no llevar anillos que pueda perder."
    mad "By drawing the ring, you solved the issue of not wearing rings that I could lose."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2745
translate english c30s006_mad_313deb7c_1:

    # mad "Significó tanto para mí que no quiero ningún otro anillo."
    mad "It meant so much to me that I don't want any other ring."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2746
translate english c30s006_mad_9156efd3:

    # mc "Los anillos son incómodos y este seguro que no lo puedes perder. Esto es más... definitivo."
    mc "Rings are uncomfortable and you definitely can't lose this one. This is more... permanent."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2748
translate english c30s006_mad_a0bc7a8e:

    # mad "Pero ahora deberíamos ir a ver a [mee] y a Tía [bet]. Estoy segura de que quieren darnos la enhorabuena."
    mad "But now we should go see [mee] and Aunt [bet]. I'm sure they want to congratulate us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2749
translate english c30s006_mad_172e56c7:

    # mc "No vamos a poder tener un momento para nosotros, ¿verdad?"
    mc "We're not going to get a moment to ourselves, are we?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2751
translate english c30s006_mad_a8321211:

    # mad "Por desgracia, no. Pero espero que lo tengamos antes de que te vayas a Aruba."
    mad "Unfortunately, no. But I hope we get one before you leave for Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2752
translate english c30s006_mad_b1472e3a:

    # mc "Por cierto, ¿me voy a tener que tatuar yo también el anillo?"
    mc "By the way, am I going to have to get a ring tattooed also?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2754
translate english c30s006_mad_ac913fac:

    # mad "*Risa* No, cielo. Me gusta tu cuerpo como está, sin tatuajes."
    mad "*Laugh* No, honey. I like your body the way it is, without tattoos."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2757
translate english c30s006_mad_99a57d1d:

    # "Os volvéis a besar, igual de apasionadamente que las dos veces anteriores, pero a la vez más tranquilos."
    "You kiss each other again, just as passionately as the previous two times, but calmer at the same time."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2758
translate english c30s006_mad_e962a17f:

    # "Besar a tu nueva esposa produce un calor en tu interior que te recorre todo el cuerpo."
    "Kissing your new wife produces a warmth inside you that runs through your entire body."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2760
translate english c30s006_mad_66a58f13:

    # "Os separáis reluctantemente."
    "You pull away reluctantly."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2762
translate english c30s006_mad_b51dfd2c:

    # "Hay un buitre carroñero que te está esperando."
    "There's a scavenging vulture waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2764
translate english c30s006_mad_81b6f66c:

    # "[mee] y Tía [bet] nos están esperando."
    "[mee] and Aunt [bet] are waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2770
translate english c30s006_kia_f6ff2923:

    # "La siguiente parada es [kia], después de que Jamaal te haga dar una vuelta a la casa."
    "The next stop is [kia], after Jamaal forces you to walk one lap around the house."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2772
translate english c30s006_kia_9f712fad:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta donde está [kia]."
    "Jamaal accompanies you to where [kia] is."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2784
translate english c30s006_kia_2ac128a1:

    # "Te acercas a [kia] imaginando lo que te espera. ¿Se han tatuado todas un anillo?"
    "You approach [kia] imagining what awaits you. Did they all get a ring tattooed?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2785
translate english c30s006_kia_dfcaa03d:

    # mc "Hola, [kia]. Estás guapísima. Supongo que hay un tatuaje que debo ver."
    mc "Hey, [kia]. You look gorgeous. I guess there's a tattoo I need to see."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2786
translate english c30s006_kia_50fe39a3:

    # kia "*Risa* Supongo que ser la segunda tiene la desventaja de que ya no te sorprende."
    kia "*Laugh* I guess being the second woman has the disadvantage of not surprising you anymore."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2788
translate english c30s006_kia_29efb65e:

    # kia "Y supongo que cuando llegues a la número [relaciones] se te hará todo repetitivo."
    kia "And I guess that, when you get to number [relaciones], it'll all feel repetitive."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2790
translate english c30s006_kia_f9ce47ad:

    # kia "Aunque ser la última tiene algunas ventajas."
    kia "Although being the last one has some advantages."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2792
translate english c30s006_kia_365373a3:

    # kia "Por raro que te parezca, no quiero llevar tu anillo en el dedo."
    kia "As weird as it might seem to you, I don't want to wear your ring on my finger."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2793
translate english c30s006_kia_2b59368c:

    # kia "El que hiciste tiene la mala costumbre de desmontarse y no lo quiero perder."
    kia "The one you made has a bad habit of falling apart and I don't want to lose it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2794
