    mc "I love that you got a tattoo of the ring I made for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2823
translate english c30s006_kia_61a555ca:

    # kia "*Risa* Era eso o tatuarme un corcho. Preferí el anillo."
    kia "*Laugh* It was either that or getting a cork tattooed. I preferred the ring."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2825
translate english c30s006_kia_27efe88d:

    # "Ninguno de los dos necesitáis decir nada más. Vuestros labios se juntan en un beso increíblemente tierno."
    "Neither of you needs to say anything else. Your lips meet in an incredibly tender kiss."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2826
translate english c30s006_kia_a8069392:

    # "Durante la fiesta de cumpleaños te explicó su historia aquí mismo y te quedaste con ganas de besarla..."
    "During the birthday party, she told you her story right here and you were left wanting to kiss her..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2827
translate english c30s006_kia_932216c6:

