    "Today, you share your first kiss as husband and wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2833
translate english c30s006_kia_dc138ab8:

    # kia "Quisiera que te quedaras conmigo toda la tarde y toda la noche, pero..."
    kia "I wish you could stay with me all afternoon and all night, but..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2835
translate english c30s006_kia_e0fdee65:

    # mc "Lo sé, Jamaal me está esperando para llevarme al siguiente tatuaje, ¿verdad?"
    mc "I know, Jamaal is waiting to take me to the next tattoo, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2837
translate english c30s006_kia_958a4665:

    # mc "Lo sé, a mí también me gustaría, pero esto era teóricamente una fiesta para Tía [bet] y Meemaw, ¿verdad?"
    mc "I know, I'd like that too, but this was theoretically a party for Aunt [bet] and Meemaw, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2838
translate english c30s006_kia_61bf2e18:

    # kia "Sí. Tendremos tiempo para nosotros luego. Aunque te tenga que compartir con el resto de las chicas."
    kia "Yeah. We'll have time for ourselves later. Even if I have to share you with the rest of the girls."

