    mc "Shall we?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2848
translate english c30s006_sim_7ab13492:

    # "La siguiente parada es [sim], después de la vuelta obligada a la casa para que la siguiente chica se ponga en la posición que ha elegido."
    "The next stop is [sim], after the mandatory walk around the house so the next girl can get into the position she chose."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2849
translate english c30s006_sim_82895414:

    # "Obviamente, está al lado de la piscina."
    "Obviously, her chosen place is by the pool."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2851
translate english c30s006_sim_fc52c4fd:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta donde está [sim]."
    "Jamaal walks you over to where [sim] is."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2854
translate english c30s006_sim_341a986a:

    # jam "Es mi hermana. Trátala bien, por favor."
    jam "She's my sister. Treat her well, please."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2855
translate english c30s006_sim_7878f5b2:

    # mc "¿Alguna vez la he tratado mal?... Bueno, mejor no contestes. Pero de eso hace muchos años."
    mc "Have I ever treated her badly?... Well, better not answer that. But that was many years ago."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2856
translate english c30s006_sim_56c88dcf:

    # mc "Además, parece que estar con Anthony te está reblandeciendo. *Risa* ¿Ahora te preocupas por [sim]?"
    mc "Besides, it seems being with Anthony is softening you up. *Laugh* You care about [sim] now?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2858
translate english c30s006_sim_3c3cdce9:

