    mc "Although in our case there was no ring, so it's going to be a surprise."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2874
translate english c30s006_sim_c2832089:

    # sim "Cuando surgió la idea de los tatuajes quería algo que nos representara, que fuera solo nuestro."
    sim "When the idea of tattoos came up, I wanted something that represented us, something that was just ours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2875
translate english c30s006_sim_ed88d02a:

    # sim "Pero hemos pasado tantos años juntos que no hay una sola cosa que destaque por encima del resto, con lo que he ido a lo clásico."
    sim "But we've spent so many years together that there isn't just one thing that stands out above the rest, so I went with something classic."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2876
translate english c30s006_sim_433fc9d7:

    # mc "Lo clásico siempre es una buena elección."
    mc "Classic is always a good choice."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2878
translate english c30s006_sim_3bee01b9:

    # sim "También quería algo que durase para siempre. *Risa* No te vas a escapar de mí tan fácilmente. Con lo que el tatuaje era una opción genial."
