    sim "[mc], with this ring I declare myself your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2892
translate english c30s006_sim_4f02c3fe:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Te has tatuado un anillo de boda?"
    mc "What? You got a wedding ring tattooed?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2893
translate english c30s006_sim_7cf64a1f:

    # mc "Es un tatuaje precioso. Muy clásico, como nosotros. El tipo que sale con la hermana de su mejor amigo y..."
    mc "It's a beautiful tattoo. Very classic, just like us. The guy who dates his best friend's sister and..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2894
translate english c30s006_sim_8fe612e9:

    # sim "Y ella se acaba tatuando un anillo. *Risa* En vez del clásico anillo he hecho una cadena; cada eslabón es un paso que nos ha traído hasta aquí."
    sim "And she ends up getting a ring tattooed. *Laugh* Instead of a classic ring, I got a chain; each link is a step that brought us here."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2896
translate english c30s006_sim_2510998a:

    # mc "Veo muchos eslabones... ¿Tantos pasos hemos dado?"
    mc "I see a lot of links... Have we taken that many steps?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2897
translate english c30s006_sim_588a79b1:

    # sim "Así seguro que dura para siempre. Tenemos que darle un significado a cada eslabón."
    sim "This way it's sure to last forever. We have to give a meaning to each link."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2899
translate english c30s006_sim_c3441bd8:

    # "Besas a tu nueva esposa por primera vez. En pocos días ha pasado de amiga a novia, a prometida, y a esposa."
    "You kiss your new wife for the first time. In just a few days she has gone from friend to girlfriend, to fiancée, and to wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2900
translate english c30s006_sim_086ac068:

    # "Una evolución natural y clásica, aunque rápida."
    "A natural and classic evolution, albeit a fast one."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2901
translate english c30s006_sim_075913c6:

    # "Como rápido, demasiado rápido, acaba vuestro beso."
    "Just as fast, too fast, your kiss ends."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2911
translate english c30s006_sim_e70f6d9a:

    # sim "Sabes que odio a mi hermano ahora mismo, ¿verdad?"
    sim "You know I hate my brother right now, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2912
translate english c30s006_sim_1ef099e0:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Ahora mismo? Creo que lo has odiado siempre."
    mc "*Laugh* Right now? I think you've always hated him."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2914
translate english c30s006_sim_21716e15:

    # sim "*Risa* Bueno, sí. Pero ahora lo odio más. Está allí haciéndome señas para que te envíe con él."
    sim "*Laugh* Well, yes. But right now I hate him even more. He's over there signaling me to send you to him."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2915
translate english c30s006_sim_6fd89827:

