    "The next girl is [kat]. She is waiting for you where you had the non-date."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2930
translate english c30s006_kat_8e27dc46:

    # "Jamaal te guía hasta donde [kat] te está esperando, donde tuvisteis la no-cita."
    "Jamaal guides you to where [kat] is waiting for you, where you had your non-date."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2941
translate english c30s006_kat_d8ea17bd:

    # mc "Estás guapísima, [kat]. Tengo ganas de ver qué te has tatuado."
    mc "You look gorgeous, [kat]. I can't wait to see what you got tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2942
translate english c30s006_kat_4bfa0b14:

    # kat "¿Quién te ha dicho que me haya hecho un tatuaje?"
    kat "Who told you I got a tattoo?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2943
translate english c30s006_kat_a0e03345:

    # mc "¿No te lo has hecho? Me sorprendes, pequeña beluga."
    mc "You didn't? You surprise me, Little Beluga."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2945
translate english c30s006_kat_20c9ff1e:

    # kat "*Risa* Sí que me lo he hecho. Pero te aseguro que yo no quería. Me parece ridículo declararme tu esposa después de sólo unos cuantos besos."
    kat "*Laugh* I did get one. But I assure you I didn't want to. It seems ridiculous to declare myself your wife after just a few kisses."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2946
translate english c30s006_kat_f18493d0:

    # mc "No tienes por qué hacerlo si no quieres."
    mc "You don't have to do it if you don't want to."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2948
translate english c30s006_kat_91ac0fe1:

    # kat "He dicho que me parece ridículo, no que no quiera hacerlo. Lo que no quería era hacerme un tatuaje."
    kat "I said it seems ridiculous, not that I don't want to do it. What I didn't want was to get a tattoo."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2949
translate english c30s006_kat_10cfab11:

    # kat "Tú mismo lo has dicho. No sabes qué me he tatuado. No tenemos nada que nos defina, que sea sólo nuestro. Es demasiado pronto."
    kat "You said it yourself. You don't know what I got tattooed. We don't have anything that defines us, that is just ours. It's too soon."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2951
translate english c30s006_kat_6ebec553:

    # mc "Si yo tuviera que elegir, me hubiera tatuado un gofre, te pusiste monísima cuando te di un trozo del mío."
    mc "If I had to choose, I would have tattooed a waffle, you looked so cute when I gave you a piece of mine."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2953
translate english c30s006_kat_8d32c36f:

    # mc "Si yo tuviera que elegir, me hubiera tatuado un gofre, ya sabes, por la no-cita... Amenazaste con robarme un trozo."
    mc "If I had to choose, I would have tattooed a waffle, you know, because of the non-date... You threatened to steal a piece from me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2954
translate english c30s006_kat_8e6575bf:

    # mc "Eso sería solo nuestro."
    mc "That would be just ours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2958
translate english c30s006_kat_ab7588ba:

    # kat "Quiero empezar diciendo que yo no quería hacer esto. Me parece ridículo después de sólo unos cuantos besos."
    kat "I want to start by saying that I didn't want to do this. It seems ridiculous after just a few kisses."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2960
translate english c30s006_kat_32806ade:

    # kat "Pero me han obligado a hacerlo..."
    kat "But they forced me to do it..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2962
translate english c30s006_kat_25e9d74e:

    # kat "Pero no quería que te fueras a Aruba sin hacerlo..."
    kat "But I didn't want you to leave for Aruba without doing it..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2963
translate english c30s006_kat_b0b0ec3d:

    # mc "Sea lo que sea lo que vayas a hacer, no tienes por qué hacerlo si no quieres."
    mc "Whatever you're going to do, you don't have to do it if you don't want to."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2965
translate english c30s006_kat_2492b700:

    # kat "No me refiero al hecho de hacerlo, sino a que todavía no tenemos nada que nos defina... Nada que lo veas y pienses en nosotros como pareja."
    kat "I don't mean the act of doing it, but that we still don't have anything that defines us... Nothing that you look at and think of us as a couple."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2967
translate english c30s006_kat_8ba9850f:

    # mc "Si yo tuviera que elegir, pensaría en un gofre, te pusiste monísima cuando te di un trozo del mío. O en una beluga..."
    mc "If I had to choose, I'd think of a waffle, you looked so cute when I gave you a piece of mine. Or a beluga..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2969
translate english c30s006_kat_d004c2ba:

    # mc "Si yo tuviera que elegir, pensaría en un gofre, ya sabes, por la no-cita... Te pusiste monísima cuando amenazaste con robarme un trozo. O en una beluga..."
    mc "If I had to choose, I'd think of a waffle, you know, because of the non-date... You looked so cute when you threatened to steal a piece of mine. Or a beluga..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2970
translate english c30s006_kat_8e6575bf_1:

    # mc "Eso sería solo nuestro."
    mc "That would be just ours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2972
translate english c30s006_kat_6cd5389d:

    # kat "*Risa* ¡Eres un capullo! Pero me gusta que empieces a conocerme."
    kat "*Laugh* You're an asshole! But I like that you're starting to get to know me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2973
translate english c30s006_kat_2bb99d7b:

    # kat "Y ahora eres mi capullo."
    kat "And now you're my asshole."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2975
translate english c30s006_kat_98ed6bfe:

    # kat "Con este gofre me declaro tu esposa."
    kat "With this waffle, I declare myself your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2976
translate english c30s006_kat_f719922c:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Me estás proponiendo matrimonio con un gofre?"
    mc "*Laugh* Are you proposing to me with a waffle?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2978
translate english c30s006_kat_ed2901cd:

    # kat "No. Te estoy diciendo que, te guste o no, estás casado conmigo. En vez de tarta de bodas podemos tener gofre de bodas."
    kat "No. I'm telling you that, whether you like it or not, you're married to me. Instead of a wedding cake, we can have a wedding waffle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2979
translate english c30s006_kat_01709959:

    # kat "Puedes besar a la novia."
    kat "You may kiss the bride."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2981
translate english c30s006_kat_0368d6c1:

    # kat "Si aceptas... claro..."
    kat "If you accept... of course..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2983
translate english c30s006_kat_6fac804f:

    # "Nunca se te pasaría por la cabeza no aceptar una propuesta así de una mujer tan maravillosa como [kat]."
    "It would never cross your mind to reject such a proposal from a woman as wonderful as [kat]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2984
translate english c30s006_kat_eeefc345:

    # "Selláis vuestro futuro con un beso tan tierno como apasionado."
    "You seal your future with a kiss as tender as it is passionate."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2985
translate english c30s006_kat_bee7b5f0:

    # "Nunca podrías haber imaginado que esto acabaría así cuando aquella chica con el pelo teñido de púrpura apareció en el aeropuerto."
    "You could never have imagined it would end up like this when that girl with purple-dyed hair showed up at the airport."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2987
translate english c30s006_kat_3b333f01:

    # mc "Por supuesto que acepto. Pedirme matrimonio... o declararte mi esposa... con un gofre es... demasiado dulce."
    mc "Of course I accept. Proposing to me... or declaring yourself my wife... with a waffle is... too sweet."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2988
translate english c30s006_kat_5d49cda6:

    # kat "*Risa* ¡Por Dios! Me está entrando hambre sólo de pensarlo. Recuerda que como cuando me pongo nerviosa..."
    kat "*Laugh* My God! I'm getting hungry just thinking about it. Remember that I eat when I get nervous..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2989
translate english c30s006_kat_81d388b2:

    # mc "No tienes que ponerte nerviosa por nada, cielo. Ahora eres mi esposa y eso no va a cambiar nunca."
    mc "You don't have to be nervous about anything, honey. You're my wife now and that's never going to change."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2991
translate english c30s006_kat_9a64b041:

    # kat "Supongo que sería un poco difícil encontrar un juez que nos divorciara tal y como ha sido la boda, ¿no?"
    kat "I guess it would be a bit hard to find a judge to divorce us considering how the wedding went, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:2992
translate english c30s006_kat_5be526a0:

    # mc "No tengo ningún interés en buscar ese juez, con lo que nunca lo sabremos."
    mc "I have no interest in looking for that judge, so we'll never know."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3000
translate english c30s006_kat_3d9abbf4:

    # mc "Ahora solo nos falta tener nuestra noche de bodas, ¿no?"
    mc "Now all we need is to have our wedding night, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3001
translate english c30s006_kat_ef4072c2:

    # kat "Habrá tiempo para eso, aunque no te voy a negar que estoy nerviosa por ello."
    kat "There will be time for that, though I won't deny I'm nervous about it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3002
translate english c30s006_kat_25973b5a:

    # mc "*Risa* No te preocupes, me ocuparé de que haya gofres al lado de la cama."
    mc "*Laugh* Don't worry, I'll make sure there are waffles next to the bed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3004
translate english c30s006_kat_5926bcb6:

    # kat "*Risa* Eres un capullo."
    kat "*Laugh* You're an asshole."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3005
translate english c30s006_kat_6fa4c0db:

    # mc "*Risa* No sé si eso dice algo bueno sobre ti. Te acabas de casar conmigo."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't know if that says anything good about you. You just married me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3009
translate english c30s006_kat_eb3948e7:

    # kat "Pero no soy la última chica que tienes que visitar hoy, con lo que el gofre al lado de la cama tendrá que esperar."
    kat "But I'm not the last girl you have to visit today, so the waffle next to the bed will have to wait."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3010
translate english c30s006_kat_05ebc871:

    # mc "Eso significa que me tengo que ir con Jamaal otra vez, ¿no?"
    mc "That means I have to go with Jamaal again, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3011
translate english c30s006_kat_dc1dc22f:

    # kat "A menos que quieras que la siguiente chica venga a matarme, sí."
    kat "Unless you want the next girl to come and kill me, yes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3013
translate english c30s006_kat_2dbccd69:

    # "Vuelves a besar a [kat] antes de dirigirte hacia donde Jamaal te espera."
    "You kiss [kat] again before heading to where Jamaal is waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3015
translate english c30s006_kat_e7501f51:

    # kat "Pero tenemos que ir a ver a Tía [bet] y a [mee], con lo que el gofre al lado de la cama tendrá que esperar."
    kat "But we have to go see Aunt [bet] and [mee], so the waffle next to the bed will have to wait."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3016
translate english c30s006_kat_5d9f46bf:

    # mc "Eso significa que esto acaba aquí por ahora, ¿no?"
    mc "That means this ends here for now, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3017
translate english c30s006_kat_36a8567e:

    # kat "A menos que quieras que dos ancianas vengan a matarme, sí."
    kat "Unless you want two old ladies to come and kill me, yeah."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3021
translate english c30s006_kat_57bf7dac:

    # "Vuelves a besar a [kat] antes de dirigiros hacia donde está la fiesta."
    "You kiss [kat] again before heading to where the party is."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3022
translate english c30s006_kat_641410ce:

    # "Saber que [kat] ya está pensando en la noche de bodas es casi una sorpresa."
    "Knowing that [kat] is already thinking about the wedding night is almost a surprise."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3023
translate english c30s006_kat_66390b64:

    # "Aunque habiendo descubierto lo que tus besos en su cuello producen, la sorpresa es menor de lo que lo hubiera sido hace unos días."
    "Although having discovered the effect your kisses on her neck have, the surprise is less than it would have been a few days ago."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3028
translate english c30s006_sam_ed654bf6:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta donde está [sam]."
    "Jamaal accompanies you to where [sam] is."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3030
translate english c30s006_sam_a144cab5:

    # jam "Es mi madre, con lo que te atropellaré si haces alguna tontería."
    jam "She's my mother, so I'll run you over if you do anything stupid."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3032
translate english c30s006_sam_c804c698:

    # mc "No te preocupes. No la voy a hacer."
    mc "Don't worry. I won't."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3033
translate english c30s006_sam_ede396d7:

    # mc "Pero tengo una pregunta, ¿Hay algún orden en las chicas a las que me llevas?"
    mc "But I have a question, is there any order to the girls you're taking me to?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3035
translate english c30s006_sam_7351a00f:

    # jam "El orden lo decido yo en base a cuáles de ellas están listas cuando vuelves a mí."
    jam "I decide the order based on which of them are ready when you come back to me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3036
translate english c30s006_sam_d0c0c656:

    # jam "Aunque hay alguna que ha pedido una posición concreta en la lista."
    jam "Though some of them have asked for a specific position on the list."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3039
translate english c30s006_sam_87e8a84c:

    # jam "*Risa* Después de mi madre quizás te deje elegir la siguiente."
    jam "*Laugh* After my mom, maybe I'll let you pick the next one. Maybe."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3040
translate english c30s006_sam_d868b8b4:

    # jam "Te lo prometo. Si hay más de una chica preparada, claro."
    jam "I promise. If there's more than one girl ready, of course."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3041
translate english c30s006_sam_75a96f00:

    # jam "*Risa* Te juro que a mi madre no la podía hacer esperar más."
    jam "*Laugh* I swear I couldn't make my mom wait any longer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3042
translate english c30s006_sam_a99e4942:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. Te castigaría sin pastelillos durante un par de semanas."
    mc "I get it. She'd ground you and not let you have any pastries for a couple of weeks."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3044
translate english c30s006_sam_866fe3e7:

    # mc "No te preocupes. No la voy a hacer, aunque no sepa de qué va esto."
    mc "Don't worry. I won't make her wait, even though I don't know what this is all about."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3055
translate english c30s006_sam_b637596d:

    # mc "Estás guapísima, [sam.nick]."
    mc "You look gorgeous, [sam.nick]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3056
translate english c30s006_sam_88596a41:

    # sam "Gracias, [mc]. La ocasión lo merecía."
    sam "Thanks, [mc]. The occasion called for it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3058
translate english c30s006_sam_5ae625dc:

    # mc "Supongo que tengo que ver un tatuaje, ¿no?"
    mc "I'm guessing I'm supposed to see a tattoo, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3060
translate english c30s006_sam_61922772:

    # sam "Supones bien. Aunque ha sido complicado elegir qué tatuarme. Te conozco de toda la vida."
    sam "You guess right. It was tough to decide what to get tattooed, though. I feel like I've known you forever."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3061
translate english c30s006_sam_226b0425:

    # mc "Yo tampoco sabría qué elegir. Hemos pasado por tantas cosas juntos que..."
    mc "I wouldn't know what to pick either. We've been through so much together that..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3063
translate english c30s006_sam_73c7a7d6:

    # sam "Exacto. *Risa* Y tatuarme un bote de ungüento para tus moretones no me parecía bien."
    sam "Exactly. *Laugh* And getting a tattoo of a tub of ointment for your bruises didn't seem right."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3064
translate english c30s006_sam_ffb0d457:

    # sam "Pese a que todo empezó entonces, tus moretones no son algo que quiera recordar."
    sam "Even though it all started then, your bruises aren't something I want to remember."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3065
translate english c30s006_sam_c77936f6:

    # mc "*Risa* Totalmente comprensible. Sorpréndeme."
    mc "*Laugh* Totally understandable. Surprise me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3068
translate english c30s006_sam_c79ab70b:

    # mc "¿De qué va esto [sam.nick]? ¿De qué quieres hablar conmigo?"
    mc "What's this about, [sam.nick]? What do you want to talk to me about?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3070
translate english c30s006_sam_d2794059:

    # sam "Sabes que te conozco de toda la vida..."
    sam "You know I've known you for what seems like forever..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3071
translate english c30s006_sam_9d40879e:

    # mc "Lo sé..."
    mc "I know..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3073
translate english c30s006_sam_1e07a5a5:

    # sam "*Risa* Vale, no era la forma correcta de empezar."
    sam "*Laugh* Okay, that wasn't the right way to start."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3074
translate english c30s006_sam_dfdae274:

    # sam "Me refiero a que hace muchos años que nos conocemos, pero que en las últimas semanas nuestra relación ha cambiado mucho."
    sam "I mean we've known each other for many years, but in the last few weeks our relationship has changed a lot."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3075
translate english c30s006_sam_d699e29d:

    # mc "Ha cambiado a mejor, diría yo."
    mc "It's changed for the better, I'd say."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3077
translate english c30s006_sam_144d13e1:

    # sam "Sí. Es algo que no me podía haber imaginado, pero has traído una nueva... ilusión... a mi vida."
    sam "Yeah. It's something I couldn't have imagined, but you've brought a new... spark... to my life."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3079
translate english c30s006_sam_cf4c3dba:

    # sam "Quería hacer algo antes de que te fueras a Aruba."
    sam "I wanted to do something before you left for Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3081
translate english c30s006_sam_47a785e2:

    # sam "Las chicas del harén queríamos hacer algo antes de que te fueras a Aruba."
    sam "The girls in the harem wanted to do something before you left for Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3082
translate english c30s006_sam_607dddd4:

    # mc "¿Te das cuenta de que estás dando rodeos sin decirme nada?"
    mc "Do you realize you're beating around the bush without telling me anything?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3084
translate english c30s006_sam_92cf1fe1:

    # sam "*Risa* ¡Eres muy impaciente!"
    sam "*Laugh* You're so impatient!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3085
translate english c30s006_sam_206eb73f:

    # mc "*Risa* No, soy curioso. Me tienes en ascuas con tanto rodeo."
    mc "*Laugh* No, I'm just curious. You've got me on edge with all this beating around the bush."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3087
translate english c30s006_sam_cb939cdd:

    # sam "Con estos anillos me declaro tu prometida y tu esposa."
    sam "With these rings, I declare myself your fiancée and your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3089
translate english c30s006_sam_6800f0ac:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¡Me encanta! Aunque me hubiera gustado habértelo propuesto yo."
    mc "What? I love it! Though I would've liked to be the one to propose."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3091
translate english c30s006_sam_b8126e29:

    # mc "¿Dos anillos en vez de uno? ¡Me encanta! Aunque me hubiera gustado habértelo propuesto yo."
    mc "Two rings instead of one? I love it! Though I would've liked to be the one to propose."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3093
translate english c30s006_sam_8804adcf:

    # sam "Ya que no me pedías que fuera tu prometida, he tenido que dar el paso yo."
    sam "Since you weren't asking me to be your fiancée, I had to take the step myself."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3095
translate english c30s006_sam_13f306ac:

    # sam "Y una vez le dijiste a [mar] que era tu esposa, el siguiente paso estaba claro."
    sam "And once you told [mar] that she was your wife, the next step was clear."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3096
translate english c30s006_sam_39f74a24:

    # mc "Me alegro de que hayas dado el paso. ¿Puedo besar a mi esposa?"
    mc "I'm glad you took the step. Can I kiss my wife?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3098
translate english c30s006_sam_b85eb229:

    # "Los dos sabéis que es una pregunta retórica. Hace mucho que sellasteis vuestro destino."
    "You both know that's a rhetorical question. You sealed your fate a long time ago."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3099
translate english c30s006_sam_ffda13c6:

    # "El beso con [sam] sabe ligeramente diferente esta vez. Es la primera vez que la besas como esposa."
    "The kiss with [sam] tastes slightly different this time. It's the first time you're kissing her as your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3100
translate english c30s006_sam_3c2af9a5:

    # "No solo sabe diferente. También sabe corto cuando vuestros labios empiezan a separarse. Pero eso es normal siempre que besas a [sam]."
    "Not only does it taste different. It also feels too short when your lips start to part. But that's normal whenever you kiss [sam]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3110
translate english c30s006_sam_8bbfd658:

    # sam "Sabes que nunca diré que odio a mi hijo, y por norma no lo hago, pero ahora mismo..."
    sam "You know I'll never say I hate my son, and as a rule I don't, but right now..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3111
translate english c30s006_sam_d9da0db4:

    # mc "*Risa* En este caso sólo es el mensajero."
    mc "*Laugh* In this case he's just the messenger."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3113
translate english c30s006_sam_05dcd112:

    # sam "*Risa* Lo sé. Y ni siquiera ha sido idea suya, con lo que no lo castigaré sin pastelillos."
    sam "*Laugh* I know. And it wasn't even his idea, so I won't punish him with no pastries."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3114
translate english c30s006_sam_5695adb9:

    # mc "Tu venganza puede ser muy dura cuando lleve a Anthony a casa y solo hagas pastelillos para él."
    mc "Your revenge could be really harsh when he brings Anthony home and you only make pastries for him."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3115
translate english c30s006_sam_7e5a1b71:

    # sam "*Risa* ¡Eres cruel con mi hijo! Pero me gusta la idea..."
    sam "*Laugh* You're cruel to my son! But I like the idea..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3116
translate english c30s006_sam_8f902589:

    # mc "Bueno, por mucho que me cueste separarme de ti, creo que es el momento en que me tengo que ir."
    mc "Well, as hard as it is to tear myself away from you, I think it's time for me to go."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3120
translate english c30s006_sam_625c9207:

    # "Os dais un último beso por el momento."
    "You share one last kiss... for now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3122
translate english c30s006_sam_5ca2a104:

    # "Es más corto de lo que cualquiera de vosotros querríais. Ninguno de los dos queréis ver a Jamaal impaciente."
    "It's shorter than either of you would like. Neither of you wants to see Jamaal impatient."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3124
translate english c30s006_sam_e81c45ad:

    # "Es más corto de lo que cualquiera de vosotros querríais. Los dos sabéis que os están esperando para empezar la fiesta."
    "It's shorter than either of you would like. You both know they're waiting for you to start the party."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3129
translate english c30s006_eri_7ff68955:

    # jam "Bueno, la siguiente chica es tu gótica favorita."
    jam "Well, the next girl is your favorite goth."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3131
translate english c30s006_eri_97ce6f11:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta donde está [eri]."
    "Jamaal walks you over to where [eri] is."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3142
translate english c30s006_eri_348e7084:

    # mc "Estás preciosa, [eri]. Y supongo que tengo un tatuaje que ver, ¿no?"
    mc "You look gorgeous, [eri]. And I suppose I have a tattoo to see, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3143
translate english c30s006_eri_9814907f:

    # eri "Me hubiera gustado ser la primera para ver tu cara de sorpresa. Así pierde un poco la gracia."
    eri "I would have liked to be the first to see your surprised face. It loses a bit of fun this way."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3144
translate english c30s006_eri_fecc4def:

    # mc "¿Puedo decir algo antes de que me enseñes el tatuaje?"
    mc "Can I say something before you show me the tattoo?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3147
translate english c30s006_eri_3710895c:

    # mc "¿Puedo decir algo antes de lo que me tengas que contar?"
    mc "Can I say something before whatever you have to tell me?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3148
translate english c30s006_eri_12700803:

    # eri "Por supuesto."
    eri "Of course."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3150
translate english c30s006_eri_276ac219:

    # mc "[eri] Marks, ¿quieres casarte conmigo?"
    mc "[eri] Marks, will you marry me?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3151
translate english c30s006_eri_39447b64:

    # eri "¿Qué? ¿De dónde has sacado ese anillo?"
    eri "What? Where did you get that ring from?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3152
translate english c30s006_eri_40628261:

    # mc "*Risa* Del bolsillo. Pero ¿vas a contestar?"
    mc "*Laugh* From my pocket. But are you going to answer?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3153
translate english c30s006_eri_d1610f3e:

    # eri "¡Por supuesto que sí!"
    eri "Of course I will!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3155
translate english c30s006_eri_4acff324:

    # "Te levantas y os fundís en un beso que transmite todo lo necesario en un momento como ese."
    "You stand up and melt into a kiss that conveys everything needed in a moment like this."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3156
translate english c30s006_eri_287611f5:

    # "No es un beso de los que empiezan en los labios de la boca y acaban en otros labios. No es un beso sexual."
    "It's not one of those kisses that start on the lips of the mouth and end on other lips. It's not a sexual kiss."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3157
translate english c30s006_eri_41303dfa:

    # "Es un beso que transmite todo el amor que os tenéis."
    "It's a kiss that conveys all the love you have for each other."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3159
translate english c30s006_eri_c1271ea3:

    # eri "¿Cuánto hace que tienes este anillo?"
    eri "How long have you had this ring?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3160
translate english c30s006_eri_4ee4a6be:

    # mc "Algo más de una semana. Pero no he encontrado la oportunidad de dártelo."
    mc "A little over a week. But I haven't found the chance to give it to you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3161
translate english c30s006_eri_82338b72:

    # mc "Te lo hubiera dado cuando fui a arreglar el enchufe, pero ese día no lo llevaba encima."
    mc "I would have given it to you when I went to fix the outlet, but I didn't have it on me that day."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3162
translate english c30s006_eri_debe06c5:

    # mc "Desde entonces no ha salido de mi bolsillo, al menos cuando tengo bolsillos."
    mc "It hasn't left my pocket since, at least when I have pockets."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3164
translate english c30s006_eri_c108c3d2:

    # eri "Es precioso. A juego con los pendientes y..."
    eri "It's beautiful. It matches the earrings and..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3166
translate english c30s006_eri_bce4a262:

    # eri "*Risa*"
    eri "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3167
translate english c30s006_eri_d4e260c9:

    # mc "¿De qué te ríes?"
    mc "What are you laughing at?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3169
translate english c30s006_eri_bd98b8fb:

    # mc "¿Te has tatuado los pendientes?"
    mc "Did you get the earrings tattooed?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3171
translate english c30s006_eri_3bada43b:

    # eri "Con este trisquel me declaro tu esposa."
    eri "With this triskelion, I declare myself your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3172
translate english c30s006_eri_b7e025d2:

    # eri "Iba a decir tu prometida y tu esposa, pero tú me has convertido en tu prometida con el anillo."
    eri "I was going to say your fiancée and your wife, but you made me your fiancée with the ring."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3174
translate english c30s006_eri_16485396:

    # mc "Creo que eres casi la única sobre la que podía adivinar qué te ibas a tatuar."
    mc "I think you're almost the only one whose tattoo I could've guessed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3175
translate english c30s006_eri_2c81c059:

    # mc "Aunque no sé cómo sabías que te iba a regalar ese anillo."
    mc "Though I don't know how you knew I was going to give you that ring."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3177
translate english c30s006_eri_ca8405a1:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Habías visto el anillo antes de hoy? ¡Me encanta!"
    mc "What? Had you seen the ring before today? I love it!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3179
translate english c30s006_eri_7625aac1:

    # eri "No es exactamente igual. El trisquel es más pequeño en el tatuaje que en el anillo."
    eri "It's not exactly the same. The triskelion is smaller on the tattoo than on the ring."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3180
translate english c30s006_eri_1959a8b0:

    # eri "Pero cuando tuve que elegir un motivo para el tatuaje lo tuve claro. El trisquel representa la evolución y el cambio."
    eri "But when I had to choose a design for the tattoo, I knew exactly what I wanted. The triskelion represents evolution and change."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3181
translate english c30s006_eri_84f950af:

    # eri "Tú me has cambiado. Y espero que de ahora en adelante evolucionemos juntos."
    eri "You've changed me. And I hope that, from now on, we evolve together."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3182
translate english c30s006_eri_61aeb00b:

    # mc "Es un tatuaje con mucho sentido. Algo con significado, como todos tus tatuajes."
    mc "It's a tattoo that makes a lot of sense. Something with meaning, like all your tattoos."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3184
translate english c30s006_eri_59bc3fd1:

    # eri "Ese tatuaje es el único que sé que no me quitaré nunca. Quería que significara algo nuestro."
    eri "That tattoo is the only one I know I'll never get removed. I wanted it to mean something that's special to us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3185
translate english c30s006_eri_87d13489:

    # eri "No solo es que sea igual que los pendientes. Es que nos representa a nosotros."
    eri "It's not just that it matches the earrings. It's that it represents us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3186
translate english c30s006_eri_954cd86e:

    # mc "¿Puedo besar a mi esposa? He besado a mi prometida, pero no a mi esposa."
    mc "Can I kiss my wife? I've kissed my fiancée, but not my wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3188
translate english c30s006_eri_5374ecdc:

    # "La chica se da cuenta de que está divagando sobre el tatuaje y decide acallar su boca presionando sus labios contra los tuyos."
    "The girl realizes she's rambling about the tattoo and decides to shut her mouth by pressing her lips against yours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3189
translate english c30s006_eri_ded55c2b:

    # "Los dos sabíais que estabais destinados a esto desde aquel primer beso del que parece que hace tanto tiempo."
    "You both knew you were destined for this since that first kiss that seems so long ago."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3190
translate english c30s006_eri_bb5e0d25:

    # "Este es vuestro primer beso como marido y mujer. Obviamente, no será el último."
    "This is your first kiss as husband and wife. Obviously, it won't be the last."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3192
translate english c30s006_eri_746022c3:

    # eri "No sé a ti, pero a mí este beso me ha sabido... diferente."
    eri "I don't know about you, but to me this kiss tasted... different."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3193
translate english c30s006_eri_fb6a6b99:

    # mc "No he notado ninguna diferencia. Sabes que 'novia', 'prometida' o 'esposa' no dejan de ser etiquetas."
    mc "I didn't notice any difference. You know that 'girlfriend', 'fiancée', or 'wife' are just labels."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3194
translate english c30s006_eri_91585782:

    # mc "No ha cambiado en nada lo que siento por ti. Dudo que alguna vez cambie, excepto por quererte más cada día."
    mc "It hasn't changed how I feel about you at all. I doubt it ever will, except for loving you more every day."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3196
translate english c30s006_eri_4a8a836f:

    # mc "Por cierto..."
    mc "By the way..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3199
translate english c30s006_eri_c2113220:

    # mc "No tengo ninguna queja sobre que te hayas hecho el tatuaje, pero... ¿qué hubiera pasado si no hubiera querido que te hicieras más?"
    mc "I have no complaints about you getting the tattoo, but... what would have happened if I hadn't wanted you to get any more?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3200
translate english c30s006_eri_13f079c0:

    # eri "Mi piel, mi decisión. Me aceptaste con tatuajes y uno más no iba a cambiar nada."
    eri "My skin, my choice. You accepted me with tattoos and one more wasn't going to change anything."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3201
translate english c30s006_eri_6e5a167b:

    # eri "Siempre y cuando no me tatuara el cuerpo entero, no creía que te importara."
    eri "As long as I didn't tattoo my entire body, I didn't think you'd mind."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3202
translate english c30s006_eri_cae86b26:

    # mc "No me importa. Al menos ese es nuestro. No tiene que ver con un pasado en que necesitabas que los tatuajes te apoyaran."
    mc "I don't mind. At least that one is ours. It has nothing to do with a past where you needed tattoos to support you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3203
translate english c30s006_eri_d07838cf:

    # mc "Ahora estoy yo aquí para apoyarte en lo que necesites."
    mc "Now I'm here to support you with whatever you need."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3209
translate english c30s006_eri_bf3975b8:

    # eri "Y ahora te vas a tener que ir. La siguiente chica te está esperando y no la quieres hacer esperar, ¿verdad?"
    eri "And now you're going to have to leave. The next girl is waiting for you, and you don't want to keep her waiting, do you?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3210
translate english c30s006_eri_316092bf:

    # mc "Por muy ansioso que esté por verla, me fastidia que nuestro tiempo acabe aquí."
    mc "As eager as I am to see her, it sucks that our time ends here."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3211
translate english c30s006_eri_3cfa4dd7:

    # eri "Solo de momento, cielo. Venga, vete antes de que te tenga que volver a besar y tenga que venir Jamaal a buscarte."
    eri "Only for now, honey. Come on, go before I have to kiss you again and Jamaal has to come looking for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3218
translate english c30s006_emmText_377a1788:

    # emm "Sabemos que no nos podremos casar nunca oficialmente."
    emm "We know we'll never be able to get officially married."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3220
translate english c30s006_emmText_781ac321:

    # emm "Incluso aunque legalizaran la poligamia, no creo que nunca legalicen el incesto..."
    emm "Even if they legalized polygamy, I don't think they'll ever legalize incest..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3222
translate english c30s006_emmText_0d903297:

    # emm "No creo que legalicen nunca el incesto..."
    emm "I don't think they'll ever legalize incest..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3225
translate english c30s006_emmText_32797891:

    # emm "Sabemos que no nos podremos casar nunca oficialmente. Dudo que alguna vez legalicen la poligamia."
    emm "We know we'll never be able to get officially married. I doubt they'll ever legalize polygamy."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3227
translate english c30s006_emmText_71ceec68:

    # emm "Quería hacer esto antes de que te fueras a Aruba..."
    emm "I wanted to do this before you left for Aruba..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3232
translate english c30s006_emmMenu_5601e40c:

    # mc "Supongo que sería adecuado para la situación..."
    mc "I guess that would be fitting for the situation..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3234
translate english c30s006_emmMenu_5f61cbc4:

    # mc "Es la flor que te define, y como eres tan original, es posible que no te hayas tatuado un anillo."
    mc "It's the flower that defines you, and since you're so original, it's possible you didn't get a ring tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3236
translate english c30s006_emmMenu_08192691:

    # mc "Sería un recordatorio de nuestra noche en el bosque y del Ferrarini."
    mc "It would be a reminder of our night in the woods and the Ferrarini."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3237
translate english c30s006_emmMenu_dae423d3:

    # mc "Como eres tan original, es posible que no te hayas tatuado un anillo."
    mc "Since you're so original, it's possible you didn't get a ring tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3239
translate english c30s006_emmMenu_b587d201:

    # emm "¡Te odio!"
    emm "I hate you!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3240
translate english c30s006_emmMenu_bb08687f:

    # mc "¿He acertado?"
    mc "Did I guess it right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3241
translate english c30s006_emmMenu_c9b71be5:

    # emm "No, pero ahora que lo has dicho, tu opción me gusta más que la que elegí yo."
    emm "No, but now that you mention it, I like your option better than the one I chose."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3245
translate english c30s006_emm_5fcbf3e4:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta donde está [emm]. Obviamente vestida de rosa."
    "Jamaal walks you to where [emm] is. Obviously dressed in pink."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3257
translate english c30s006_emm_df7f0364:

    # mc "Me podía imaginar que tu vestido sería rosa."
    mc "I figured your dress would be pink."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3258
translate english c30s006_emm_88fc036c:

    # emm "¿Acaso hay otro color que valga la pena vestir?"
    emm "Is there even any other color worth wearing?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3259
translate english c30s006_emm_fbb239dc:

    # mc "Estarías guapísima con cualquier otro color, [emm]."
    mc "You'd look gorgeous in any other color, [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3261
translate english c30s006_emm_afa516d0:

    # emm "Ahora te toca adivinar qué me he tatuado."
    emm "Now it's your turn to guess what I got tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3262
translate english c30s006_emm_6913bd87:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡Eso es nuevo!"
    mc "*Laugh* That's new!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3263
translate english c30s006_emm_7975406e:

    # emm "Soy una chica original."
    emm "I'm an original girl."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3265
translate english c30s006_emm_73a5b89f:

    # mc "*Risa* Bueno, estoy seguro de que tienes otro hombro en el que poder tatuártelo."
    mc "*Laugh* Well, I'm sure you have another shoulder you can get it tattooed on."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3267
translate english c30s006_emm_32055dc1:

    # emm "*Risa* ¿Y volver a pasar por el dolor del tatuaje? ¡Nunca!"
    emm "*Laugh* And go through the pain of a tattoo again? Never!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3268
translate english c30s006_emm_e5cb737b:

    # emm "Además, cuando acabemos aquí ya estaremos casados, con lo que no necesitaré más tatuajes."
    emm "Besides, when we're done here, we'll already be married, so I won't need any more tattoos."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3269
translate english c30s006_emm_935b6143:

    # mc "¿Dolió mucho?"
    mc "Did it hurt a lot?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3272
translate english c30s006_emm_b477d829:

    # emm "Con lo que sí. Dolió. Pero me parece un precio barato para sentirme casada contigo."
    emm "So yeah. It hurt. But it seems like a low price to pay to feel married to you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3273
translate english c30s006_emm_85e20b9e:

    # mc "Eso es muy tierno, [emm]. Me encantaría ver ese tatuaje."
    mc "That's very sweet, [emm]. I'd love to see that tattoo."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3276
translate english c30s006_emm_de5d3fad:

    # mc "¿Qué es lo que pasa?"
    mc "What's wrong?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3279
translate english c30s006_emm_d24ecc0f:

    # emm "Imagínate que me he hecho un tatuaje para demostrar que estamos casados, ¿qué crees que me tatuaría?"
    emm "Imagine I got a tattoo to show that we're married, what do you think I'd get tattooed?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3281
translate english c30s006_emm_fcbe504e:

    # mc "Pero si lo hicieras, me encantaría ver ese tatuaje."
    mc "But if you did, I'd love to see that tattoo."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3283
translate english c30s006_emm_f509264f:

    # emm "Con este tatuaje me declaro casada contigo."
    emm "With this tattoo, I declare myself married to you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3284
translate english c30s006_emm_a1eb2303:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Te has tatuado un corazón como si fuera el diamante de un anillo?"
    mc "What? You got a heart tattooed like it's the diamond of a ring?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3285
translate english c30s006_emm_4459fb43:

    # mc "¡Me encanta! Y, obviamente, el corazón es rosa."
    mc "I love it! And, obviously, the heart is pink."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3287
translate english c30s006_emm_496d5279:

    # emm "Por eso te he dicho que tu opción me gustaba más que la mía. Ahora parece soso."
    emm "That's why I told you I liked your choice better than mine. Now it looks bland."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3288
translate english c30s006_emm_10c98173:

    # mc "A mí me parece precioso, [emm]."
    mc "I think it's beautiful, [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3290
translate english c30s006_emm_60f4fb12:

    # emm "Le pedí al tatuador si podía dibujar un grano de pimienta rosa en el medio del corazón..."
    emm "I asked the tattoo artist if he could draw a pink peppercorn in the middle of the heart..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3291
translate english c30s006_emm_66b49d98:

    # emm "Ya sabes, para mostrar que en nuestra relación hay mucho amor, pero también una parte picante..."
    emm "You know, to show that there's a lot of love in our relationship, but also a spicy part..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3292
translate english c30s006_emm_89e5b26c:

    # mc "*Risa* Sólo a ti se te podía haber ocurrido una idea como esa. Pero no hay ningún grano de pimienta."
    mc "*Laugh* Only you could've come up with an idea like that. But there's no peppercorn."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3294
translate english c30s006_emm_b050023f:

    # emm "*Risa* Le pedí que lo dibujara en papel primero y... parecía una mierda de oveja... Una mierda rosa."
    emm "*Laugh* I asked him to draw it on paper first and... it looked like sheep shit... Pink sheep shit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3295
translate english c30s006_emm_9e4711ae:

    # mc "*Risa* Entonces es mejor que no te lo hayas tatuado. En vez de 'amor y picante', se podría malinterpretar como 'el amor es una mierda'."
    mc "*Laugh* Then it's a good thing you didn't get it tattooed. Instead of 'love and spice', it could be misinterpreted as 'love is shit'."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3296
translate english c30s006_emm_71524f27:

    # emm "*Risa* Algo parecido pensé yo."
    emm "*Laugh* I thought something similar."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3297
translate english c30s006_emm_83679c40:

    # mc "¿Puedo besar a mi esposa?"
    mc "Can I kiss my wife?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3300
translate english c30s006_emm_53d21348:

    # "Besas a tu hermana, a tu prometida, a tu esposa."
    "You kiss your sister, your fiancée, your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3302
translate english c30s006_emm_51df8f57:

    # "Besas a tu prometida, a tu esposa, a la mujer a la que has considerado como una hermana durante años."
    "You kiss your fiancée, your wife, the woman you've considered a sister for years."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3304
translate english c30s006_emm_ad3a16f3:

    # "No te sorprendería que el plan para hacer esto hubiera sido parcialmente suyo. Por una vez sus planes funcionan."
    "It wouldn't surprise you if the plan to do this had been partially hers. For once her plans work."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3306
translate english c30s006_emm_c18b349f:

    # "Te sorprende que el plan para hacer esto haya salido de su cabeza. Ha funcionado. No te sorprendería que el resto de las chicas le hayan ayudado."
    "It surprises you that the plan to do this came from her head. It worked. It wouldn't surprise you if the rest of the girls had helped her."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3308
translate english c30s006_emm_ee716099:

    # emm "¡Wow!"
    emm "Wow!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3309
translate english c30s006_emm_37d0bf81:

    # mc "¿Qué tal tu primer beso de casada?"
    mc "How's your first kiss as a married woman?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3310
translate english c30s006_emm_d132386a:

    # emm "Me deja sin aliento igual que cualquier otro."
    emm "It leaves me breathless just like any other."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3311
translate english c30s006_emm_c8cce799:

    # emm "Creo que soy como tú y que las etiquetas no significan demasiado para mí. Aunque estoy contenta de ser tu esposa."
    emm "I think I'm like you and labels don't mean too much to me. Though I'm happy to be your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3312
translate english c30s006_emm_9ddded5a:

    # mc "Yo también estoy contento de que lo seas, [emm]."
    mc "I'm happy you are too, [emm]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3313
translate english c30s006_emm_165d54b7:

    # mc "Pero tengo una pregunta. Lo de ayer con la lavadora... ¿tiene algo que ver con esto?"
    mc "But I have a question. Yesterday with the washing machine... did it have anything to do with this?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3315
translate english c30s006_emm_1815d358:

    # emm "*Risita* Quería mi último polvo de soltera. Y no podía quitarme la camiseta o verías el tatuaje, con lo que se me ocurrió lo de la lavadora."
    emm "*Giggles* I wanted my last fuck as a single woman. And I couldn't take off my shirt or you'd see the tattoo, so I came up with the washing machine idea."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3316
translate english c30s006_emm_422eef10:

    # mc "*Risa* Por suerte ya tenías el tatuaje hecho, o corríamos el riesgo de que te tatuaras una lavadora."
    mc "*Laugh* Luckily you already had the tattoo done, or we ran the risk of you getting a washing machine tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3317
translate english c30s006_emm_95168b72:

    # emm "*Risa* Sería complicado de explicarles a nuestros nietos por qué tengo una lavadora tatuada en el hombro."
    emm "*Laugh* It would be complicated to explain to our grandchildren why I have a washing machine tattooed on my shoulder."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3327
translate english c30s006_emm_6c5c4c01:

    # emm "Y, por mucho que me duela, te tengo que mandar con Jamaal otra vez."
    emm "And, as much as it hurts me, I have to send you to Jamaal again."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3328
translate english c30s006_emm_ea80115c:

    # emm "Si te vuelvo a besar, creo que te llevaré a la sala de la colada."
    emm "If I kiss you again, I think I'll take you to the laundry room."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3329
translate english c30s006_emm_a4604756:

    # mc "Y no estaría bien hacer esperar a la siguiente chica, ¿no?"
    mc "And it wouldn't be right to make the next girl wait, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3330
translate english c30s006_emm_d9cc3fff:

    # emm "No, no estaría bien hacer esperar a mi futura cuñada."
    emm "No, it wouldn't be right to make my future sister-in-law wait."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3333
translate english c30s006_emm_759063c0:

    # emm "*Risa* No me gustaría hacer esperar a [eva] y que después viniera a torturarme por la noche."
    emm "*Laugh* I wouldn't want to make [eva] wait and then have her come torture me at night."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3335
translate english c30s006_emm_5e8d7c38:

    # mc "*Risa* No te preocupes. Ya he hablado con ella."
    mc "*Laugh* Don't worry. I've already talked to her."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3336
translate english c30s006_emm_622cd095:

    # mc "Además, no te torturaría. Seguro que os poníais a contaros cómo ha ido vuestra 'boda'."
    mc "Besides, she wouldn't torture you. I'm sure you two would start telling each other how your 'wedding' went."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3338
translate english c30s006_emm_b867c15d:

    # mc "*Risa* Seguramente no te torturaría. Os pondríais a contaros cómo ha ido vuestra 'boda'."
    mc "*Laugh* She probably wouldn't torture you. You two would start telling each other how your 'wedding' went."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3339
translate english c30s006_emm_69bb1267:

    # emm "*Risita* Lo sé."
    emm "*Giggles* I know."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3341
translate english c30s006_emm_f57d995f:

    # "Le das un beso a tu preciosa esposa antes de dirigirte a donde te espera Jamaal."
    "You give your beautiful wife a kiss before heading to where Jamaal is waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3346
translate english c30s006_emm_35d8811d:

    # emm "*Risa* Por cierto, te odio."
    emm "*Laugh* By the way, I hate you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3347
translate english c30s006_emm_8ccd89ae:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Por qué? ¿Qué he hecho yo ahora?"
    mc "What? Why? What did I do now?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3348
translate english c30s006_emm_8f6f6e4d:

    # emm "*Risa* Dejarme para la última."
    emm "*Laugh* Leaving me for last."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3349
translate english c30s006_emm_8df1fa70:

    # mc "Sabes que las comidas acaban con el postre, ¿no?"
    mc "You know meals end with dessert, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3350
translate english c30s006_emm_50230f88:

    # emm "*Risa* Vale. Ahora te odio un poco menos."
    emm "*Laugh* Okay. Now I hate you a little less."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3352
translate english c30s006_emm_96f0d000:

    # "Le das un beso a tu preciosa esposa antes de dirigiros hacia la fiesta de bienvenida."
    "You give your beautiful wife a kiss before heading towards the welcome party."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3356
translate english c30s006_debKiss_75b219fb:

    # "La preciosa nadadora te da un tierno beso de agradecimiento."
    "The beautiful swimmer gives you a tender kiss of gratitude."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3357
translate english c30s006_debKiss_6ee22a34:

    # "Sabes que ya no necesita que la reafirmen en lo preciosa que es, pero sigue encantándole que lo hagas."
    "You know she no longer needs to be reassured of how beautiful she is, but she still loves it when you do."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3358
translate english c30s006_debKiss_531863b1:

    # "Y, con premios como este, dudas que alguna vez dejes de hacerlo."
    "And, with rewards like this, you doubt you'll ever stop doing it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3362
translate english c30s006_deb_fc22ed67:

    # "Jamaal te guía hacia dónde te está esperando la sirena residente."
    "Jamaal guides you to where the resident mermaid is waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3374
translate english c30s006_deb_db2b081c:

    # mc "[deb.nick], creo que no podría estar con una mujer más preciosa ahora mismo."
    mc "[deb.nick], I don't think I could be with a more gorgeous woman right now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3376
translate english c30s006_deb_5f6e16fa:

    # deb "*Risita* ¿Le has dicho lo mismo a la chica anterior?"
    deb "*Giggles* Did you say the same thing to the previous girl?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3378
translate english c30s006_deb_c1846696:

    # deb "*Risita* ¿Les has dicho lo mismo a las chicas anteriores?"
    deb "*Giggles* Did you say the same thing to the previous girls?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3379
translate english c30s006_deb_041e8569:

    # mc "No, eres la primera a quién se lo digo."
    mc "No, you're the first one I've said it to."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3382
translate english c30s006_deb_7cac2c67:

    # deb "Supongo que sabes lo que viene ahora, ¿no?"
    deb "I guess you know what comes next, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3383
translate english c30s006_deb_0ba1da14:

    # mc "Me vas a enseñar el tatuaje y vas a decir la frase que habéis pactado."
    mc "You're going to show me the tattoo and say the line you all agreed on."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3384
translate english c30s006_deb_490bcdf2:

    # deb "Y supongo que sabes lo que me he tatuado..."
    deb "And I guess you know what I got tattooed..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3386
translate english c30s006_deb_0846aaad:

    # deb "*Risa* Si no lo sabes di que lo sabes. Me sentiría un poco tonta por ponerte en un apuro si no lo adivinas."
    deb "*Laugh* If you don't know, just say you do. I'd feel a bit silly putting you on the spot if you can't guess it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3387
translate english c30s006_deb_8a6717bf:

    # mc "Podría dudar entre la piedra corazón y la flor del remolino. Pero me inclino por la piedra corazón."
    mc "I might hesitate between the heart stone and the swirl flower. But I'm leaning towards the heart stone."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3388
translate english c30s006_deb_838b8452:

    # mc "Tiene un montón de simbolismo para nosotros y creo que refleja mejor el concepto de duradero."
    mc "It has a lot of symbolism for us, and I think it better reflects the concept of lasting."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3390
translate english c30s006_deb_192cce28:

    # deb "Las flores se marchitan o se secan, quedando aplastadas entre las páginas de un libro."
    deb "Flowers wither or dry up, ending up crushed between the pages of a book."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3391
translate english c30s006_deb_2dae0f89:

    # deb "No es eso lo que quiero para lo nuestro."
    deb "That's not what I want for us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3394
translate english c30s006_deb_3b0424dd:

    # mc "No sé de qué va esto, pero estás preciosa."
    mc "I don't know what this is about, but you look gorgeous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3398
translate english c30s006_deb_02d43eba:

    # deb "Tus novias hemos decidido hacer esto antes de que te vayas a Aruba."
    deb "Your girlfriends and I decided to do this before you left for Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3400
translate english c30s006_deb_7040b289:

    # deb "He querido hacer esto antes de que te vayas a Aruba."
    deb "I wanted to do this before you left for Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3401
translate english c30s006_deb_4906edf9:

    # mc "¿Qué es 'esto', [deb.nick]? Me tienes en ascuas."
    mc "What is 'this', [deb.nick]? You're keeping me in suspense."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3403
translate english c30s006_deb_d0acaa2f:

    # deb "Con esta piedra corazón, que tú encontraste para mí, me declaro tu esposa."
    deb "With this heart stone, which you found for me, I declare myself your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3404
translate english c30s006_deb_4c1d7ed7:

    # deb "Sé que no es un anillo o algo por el estilo, pero representa mucho más para mí."
    deb "I know it's not a ring or anything like that, but it means so much more to me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3406
translate english c30s006_deb_1e00f5b6:

    # mc "Me encanta. Ciertamente es un 'para siempre', o al menos lo espero."
    mc "I love it. It certainly is a declaration of 'forever', or at least I hope so."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3408
translate english c30s006_deb_dd5d27f1:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¡Me encanta!"
    mc "What? I love it!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3410
translate english c30s006_deb_2f490d44:

    # deb "Por un momento dudé entre la piedra corazón y la flor del remolino, pero la piedra me pareció más idónea."
    deb "For a moment I hesitated between the heart stone and the whirlpool flower, but the stone seemed more fitting."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3411
translate english c30s006_deb_192cce28_1:

    # deb "Las flores se marchitan o se secan, quedando aplastadas entre las páginas de un libro."
    deb "Flowers wither or dry up, ending up crushed between the pages of a book."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3412
translate english c30s006_deb_2dae0f89_1:

    # deb "No es eso lo que quiero para lo nuestro."
    deb "That's not what I want for us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3413
translate english c30s006_deb_a8b19e90:

    # mc "Creo que la piedra tiene mucho más simbolismo para nosotros y que refleja mejor el concepto de 'para siempre'."
    mc "I think the stone has a lot more symbolism for us and better reflects the concept of 'forever'."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3415
translate english c30s006_deb_47a0ea06:

    # "Esta vez el beso es igual de tierno, pero refleja más seguridad."
    "This time the kiss is just as tender, but it reflects more confidence."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3416
translate english c30s006_deb_cf5af8c8:

    # "Estás seguro de que [deb.nick] ha estado dudando sobre si la rechazarías en el último momento."
    "You're sure that [deb.nick] had been doubting whether you'd reject her at the last moment."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3417
translate english c30s006_deb_6d086e15:

    # "Su inseguridad, aunque innecesaria, forma parte de su encanto."
    "Her insecurity, although unnecessary, is part of her charm."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3419
translate english c30s006_deb_1287a13c:

    # deb "Tengo que pedirte disculpas..."
    deb "I have to apologize to you..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3420
translate english c30s006_deb_9e445bce:

    # mc "¿Por qué? Ha sido muy bonito."
    mc "Why? It was really beautiful."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3421
translate english c30s006_deb_6846fa25:

    # deb "No por esto sino... ¿te acuerdas del otro día en la piscina?"
    deb "Not for this, but... do you remember the other day at the pool?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3422
translate english c30s006_deb_71b6e6cc:

    # mc "¿Cuando dijiste que no podías bañarte porque tenías un sangrado?"
    mc "When you said you couldn't swim because you were bleeding?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3424
translate english c30s006_deb_5855f050:

    # deb "Sí... Entre [dap] y [sca] te hicieron pensar que era... otro tipo de sangrado. Y yo no hice nada por evitarlo."
    deb "Yeah... Between [dap] and [sca], they made you think it was... another type of bleeding. And I didn't do anything to stop it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3425
translate english c30s006_deb_219d551b:

    # mc "No hay como hablar del periodo para que los hombres nos callemos."
    mc "There's nothing like talking about periods to make us guys shut up."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3426
translate english c30s006_deb_345c88b4:

    # mc "Era por el tatuaje, ¿no?"
    mc "It was because of the tattoo, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3428
translate english c30s006_deb_951c72a8:

    # deb "Sí. Se me infectó un poco y saltó la costra. No mentimos, pero te hicimos pensar que..."
    deb "Yeah. It got a little infected and the scab fell off. We didn't lie, but we made you think that..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3429
translate english c30s006_deb_d38ceb6d:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. Si me hubierais dicho la verdad se habría fastidiado la sorpresa."
    mc "I get it. If you guys had told me the truth, it would've ruined the surprise."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3430
translate english c30s006_deb_9a610033:

    # mc "Pero no importa, yo he jugado a ese juego, a hacer creer algo sin decirlo, demasiadas veces como para ofenderme."
    mc "But it doesn't matter, I've played that game, making someone believe something without saying it, way too many times to be offended."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3434
translate english c30s006_deb_573b867d:

    # "[deb.nick] se inclina sobre ti, poniendo los labios a la altura de tu oído."
    "[deb.nick] leans over you, putting her lips right next to your ear."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3435
translate english c30s006_deb_79d8a6f8:

    # deb "Además, durante nueve meses no voy a tener ese... otro tipo de sangrado."
    deb "Besides, for nine months I won't be having that... other kind of bleeding."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3436
translate english c30s006_deb_901e993c:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Estás embarazada? ¿Cómo? ¿Cuándo?"
    mc "What? You're pregnant? How? When?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3438
translate english c30s006_deb_7171009f:

    # deb "¡Sí! El 'como' ya lo sabes. Pero si te refieres a cuándo lo he descubierto, fue cuando [ama] se llevó los tests."
    deb "Yes! You already know the 'how'. But if you mean when I found out, it was when [ama] took the tests."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3439
translate english c30s006_deb_85be953c:

    # deb "No podíamos decirte que lo íbamos a hacer. ¿Estás decepcionado porque no lo hemos mirado juntos?"
    deb "We couldn't tell you we were going to do it. Are you disappointed we didn't look at it together?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3440
translate english c30s006_deb_0dda1c77:

    # mc "¿Decepcionado? ¡Contentísimo con el resultado! ¿Y tú? ¿Estás contenta? Tu carrera como nadadora..."
    mc "Disappointed? I'm thrilled with the result! What about you? Are you happy? Your swimming career..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3441
translate english c30s006_deb_32757cfd:

    # "Las palabras se atropellan al salir de tu boca. Quieres hacer demasiadas preguntas a la vez."
    "The words stumble out of your mouth. You want to ask too many questions at once."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3443
translate english c30s006_deb_b827ed6e:

    # deb "No te preocupes por mi carrera ahora. Sí. Estoy contenta. Mucho."
    deb "Don't worry about my career right now. Yes. I'm happy. Very much so."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3444
translate english c30s006_deb_c16cf036:

    # deb "No sabía que sentiría si salía positivo o negativo. Mientras esperaba que el test pitara, descubrí que quería ver el positivo."
    deb "I didn't know how I'd feel if it came back positive or negative. While I was waiting for the test to beep, I realized I wanted to see a positive."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3445
translate english c30s006_deb_9c2cf527:

    # mc "¿Puedo besar a mi esposa y a la madre de mis hijos?"
    mc "Can I kiss my wife and the mother of my children?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3447
translate english c30s006_deb_2badb92d:

    # "No hace falta que conteste. Al menos no con palabras."
    "She doesn't need to answer. At least not with words."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3448
translate english c30s006_deb_473bd0aa:

    # "El beso transmite felicidad, alivio, y una seguridad que [deb.nick] nunca antes había tenido."
    "The kiss conveys happiness, relief, and a security that [deb.nick] has never had before."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3449
translate english c30s006_deb_8d402a86:

    # "Crees que va a ser una gran madre. Ya es una gran esposa."
    "You think she's going to be a great mother. She's already a great wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3451
translate english c30s006_deb_9340ffca:

    # mc "No vamos a tener luna de miel..."
    mc "We're not going to have a honeymoon..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3453
translate english c30s006_deb_b53925ce:

    # mc "Ni vamos a poder celebrar lo del bebé como es debido..."
    mc "And we won't be able to celebrate the baby properly..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3454
translate english c30s006_deb_4f34cd82:

    # deb "Habrá tiempo para eso y para todas las celebraciones que queramos. Recuerda, una piedra es para siempre."
    deb "There will be time for that and for all the celebrations we want. Remember, a stone is forever."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3455
translate english c30s006_deb_6e1f720f:

    # deb "Y espero ser una piedra para ti el resto de tu vida. Aunque eso suene fatal."
    deb "And I hope to be a stone for you for the rest of your life. Even if that sounds awful."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3456
translate english c30s006_deb_602c387f:

    # mc "*Risa* Sabes que un diamante es un piedra, ¿verdad?"
    mc "*Laugh* You know a diamond is a stone, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3459
translate english c30s006_deb_4a8a836f:

    # mc "Por cierto..."
    mc "By the way..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3467
translate english c30s006_deb_5ada139a:

    # deb "Ahora deberías volver con Jam. Hay otra chica esperándote."
    deb "You should go back to Jam now. There's another girl waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3468
translate english c30s006_deb_1c9e7866:

    # mc "No me vais a dejar tiempo para disfrutar de esto, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You're not going to leave me any time to enjoy this, are you?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3470
translate english c30s006_deb_0099bef5:

    # deb "*Risa* La culpa es tuya por tener un harén."
    deb "*Laugh* It's your fault for having a harem."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3471
translate english c30s006_deb_fba7313c:

    # mc "*Risa* Visto así..."
    mc "*Laugh* If you put it that way..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3472
translate english c30s006_deb_2dba3b62:

    # deb "Y estoy muy feliz de pertenecer a ese harén. *Risita* Pese a que tenga algunas desventajas."
    deb "And I'm very happy to belong to that harem. *Giggles* Even if it has a few downsides."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3473
translate english c30s006_deb_2a6778d6:

    # mc "Te veo luego, preciosa."
    mc "See you later, gorgeous."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3475
translate english c30s006_deb_a8cffeed:

    # "Os dais un último beso de despedida momentánea. Como ha dicho [deb.nick], hay otra chica esperándote."
    "You share one last kiss as a temporary goodbye. Like [deb.nick] said, there's another girl waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3479
translate english c30s006_deb_e7cf6289:

    # "Os dais un último beso de despedida momentánea. Tenéis que uniros a la fiesta de bienvenida."
    "You share one last kiss as a temporary goodbye. You have to join the welcome party."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3483
translate english c30s006_oma_ed664fb5:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta las escaleras del jacuzzi de [nor]."
    "Jamaal walks you to the stairs of [nor]'s jacuzzi."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3484
translate english c30s006_oma_0cef4413:

    # "[oma] te está esperando arriba, haciéndote señas para que la sigas."
    "[oma] is waiting for you upstairs, motioning for you to follow her."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3498
translate english c30s006_oma_a8f8a0e4:

    # mc "Hola, Agente. Vengo a poner una denuncia. Estar tan guapa debe ser un delito."
    mc "Hello, Officer. I'm here to file a report. Looking that beautiful must be a crime."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3500
translate english c30s006_oma_2b0d6442:

    # mc "¿Puedo denunciarte? Estar tan guapa debe ser un delito."
    mc "Can I report you? Looking that beautiful must be a crime."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3502
translate english c30s006_oma_ca40571d:

    # oma "*Risa* Eres idiota. Lo sabes, ¿verdad?"
    oma "*Laugh* You're an idiot. You know that, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3503
translate english c30s006_oma_fdc7cf93:

    # mc "*Risa* Lo que sé es que pasáis demasiado tiempo con [kia] y [eil]. Al final os olvidaréis de mi nombre y todas me llamaréis 'idiota'."
    mc "*Laugh* What I know is that you girls spend too much time with [kia] and [eil]. Eventually you'll forget my name and all call me 'idiot'."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3505
translate english c30s006_oma_aed7e532:

    # oma "No estaría mal. Le podría preguntar a [emm], '¿has visto al idiota de mi marido?'"
    oma "That wouldn't be bad. I could ask [emm], 'have you seen my idiot husband?'"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3507
translate english c30s006_oma_f1cd029d:

    # mc "Lo cual nos lleva al tatuaje, ¿no? Tengo ganas de ver qué te has tatuado."
    mc "Which brings us to the tattoo, right? I can't wait to see what you got tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3510
translate english c30s006_oma_8f2c865f:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Tu marido? ¿Cuándo nos hemos casado?"
    mc "*Laugh* Your husband? When did we get married?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3512
translate english c30s006_oma_c95c2f7c:

    # oma "Ahora."
    oma "Now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3513
translate english c30s006_oma_740c7447:

    # oma "Con este anillo me declaro tu esposa. Ahora y siempre."
    oma "With this ring I declare myself your wife. Now and forever."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3514
translate english c30s006_oma_c6d7744c:

    # oma "Además, en español la palabra 'esposa' es la misma para esposas con las que te casas y esposas con las que te arrestan."
    oma "Besides, in Spanish the word 'esposa', wife, is the same for the wife you marry and the handcuffs you get arrested with."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3516
translate english c30s006_oma_d29f9324:

    # mc "¡Me encanta! Pero... ¿un cangrejo?"
    mc "I love it! But... a crab?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3518
translate english c30s006_oma_8c2e880e:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Me estás pidiendo que me case contigo?"
    mc "What? Are you asking me to marry you?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3519
translate english c30s006_oma_96d567c2:

    # oma "No. Te estoy informando de que estás casado conmigo."
    oma "No. I'm informing you that you're married to me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3520
translate english c30s006_oma_5045b71d:

    # mc "Pero ¿nos casamos con un cangrejo?"
    mc "But are we marrying with a crab as a ring?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3522
translate english c30s006_oma_e6383646:

    # oma "¿No te acuerdas?"
    oma "Don't you remember?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3523
translate english c30s006_oma_ac2c3dba:

    # mc "¿De que confundí Krav Maga con un cangrejo por como lo pronunciaste? Claro que sí."
    mc "That I confused Krav Maga with a crab because of how you pronounced it? Of course I do."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3525
translate english c30s006_oma_e94144fd:

    # oma "Aquel día empezó todo entre nosotros. Es un día que no quiero olvidar nunca y creo que es una cosa única."
    oma "That day, everything started between us. It's a day I never want to forget, and I think it's something unique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3527
translate english c30s006_oma_4ed9aef1:

    # oma "Cuando empezamos a hablar del tatuaje, es en lo primero que pensé, con lo que seguí mi instinto. No se me ocurría nada mejor."
    oma "When we started talking about the tattoo, it was the first thing I thought of, so I followed my instinct."
    oma "I couldn't think of anything that represented us better."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3529
translate english c30s006_oma_d0074087:

    # oma "Cuando pensé en qué tatuaje quería hacerme, es lo primero que me vino a la cabeza, con lo que seguí mi instinto."
    oma "When I thought about what tattoo I wanted to get, it was the first thing that came to mind, so I followed my instinct."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3530
translate english c30s006_oma_37774ef0:

    # mc "Me encanta el tatuaje y me encanta el simbolismo, pero ¿puedo besar a mi esposa ya?"
    mc "I love the tattoo, and I love the symbolism, but... Can I kiss my wife now?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3532
translate english c30s006_oma_1f798cf0:

    # "Os lanzáis el uno en los brazos del otro mientras vuestros labios se buscan y se encuentran."
    "You throw yourselves into each other's arms as your lips seek and find one another."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3533
translate english c30s006_oma_672f1759:

    # "Los dos queríais que este momento llegara algún día. Tú no podías imaginarte que llegaría así."
    "You both wanted this moment to come someday. You couldn't have imagined it would happen like this."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3534
translate english c30s006_oma_4919b0ce:

    # "De alguna forma, los dos habíais elegido al otro para el resto de la vida, con lo que esto solo significa cambiar la etiqueta."
    "In a way, you two had chosen each other for the rest of your lives, so this just means changing the label."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3535
translate english c30s006_oma_a5040191:

    # "A veces no odias las etiquetas... demasiado."
    "Sometimes you don't hate labels... too much."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3544
translate english c30s006_oma_ab1693cf:

    # mc "Sobre lo que has dicho del significado de 'esposa' en español..."
    mc "About what you said regarding the meaning of 'esposa' in Spanish..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3545
translate english c30s006_oma_eb72d3f0:

    # oma "Sí..."
    oma "Yeah..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3546
translate english c30s006_oma_223fd1c0:

    # mc "Creo que tiene mucho sentido. Voy a estar atado a ti de por vida..."
    mc "I think it makes a lot of sense. I'm going to be tied to you for life..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3548
translate english c30s006_oma_8f2369eb:

    # oma "*Risa* Mas te vale. Soy católica y no nos divorciamos."
    oma "*Laugh* You better be. I'm Catholic and we don't get divorced."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3549
translate english c30s006_oma_30731ee9:

    # oma "*Risa* Y si alguna vez intentas que rompamos, como haciendo comentarios tontos sobre estar atados, buscaré hasta la última multa de tráfico que tengas."
    oma "*Laugh* And if you ever try to break us up, like by making dumb comments about being tied down, I'll dig up every last traffic ticket you have."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3550
translate english c30s006_oma_bc101338:

    # mc "*Risa* No te preocupes. No lo intentaré."
    mc "*Laugh* Don't worry. I won't try."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3553
translate english c30s006_oma_d1b3625d:

    # oma "Pero ahora deberías irte. Hay otro tatuaje esperando a ser descubierto."
    oma "But you should go now. There's another tattoo waiting to be discovered."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3556
translate english c30s006_oma_c97008e2:

    # mc "¿Puedo tener un último beso para el camino?"
    mc "Can I get one last kiss for the road?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3558
translate english c30s006_oma_8873526b:

    # "Os besáis de una forma que sabe a despedida."
    "You kiss in a way that tastes like a goodbye."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3560
translate english c30s006_oma_a696cd8c:

    # "Ninguno de los dos queréis que la siguiente chica te espere demasiado."
    "Neither of you wants the next girl to wait too long for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3562
translate english c30s006_oma_e55373af:

    # "Los dos sabéis que en cuanto os unáis a la fiesta, no vais a poder estar a solas."
    "You both know that as soon as you join the party, you won't be able to be alone."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3566
translate english c30s006_eva_6321557e:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta el rincón de estar solo, donde [eva] te está esperando."
    "Jamaal walks you to the thinking corner, where [eva] is waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3580
translate english c30s006_eva_68a81cc2:

    # mc "Ayer estábamos aquí mismo, pero las circunstancias parecen haber cambiado, ¿no?"
    mc "We were right here yesterday, but the circumstances seem to have changed, haven't they?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3581
translate english c30s006_eva_717ffe5c:

    # eva "Un poco..."
    eva "A little..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3582
translate english c30s006_eva_02000dc2:

    # mc "¿Pasa algo, [eva]?"
    mc "Is something wrong, [eva]?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3584
translate english c30s006_eva_12be9cc0:

    # mc "Ayer estabas triste y hoy pareces enfadada."
    mc "Yesterday you were sad, and today you seem angry."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3585
translate english c30s006_eva_74430733:

    # eva "Es lógico que esté enfadada."
    eva "It makes sense that I'm angry."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3586
translate english c30s006_eva_609901a4:

    # mc "Explícame por qué. No entiendo nada..."
    mc "Explain to me why. I don't understand anything..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3588
translate english c30s006_eva_5fbe73c5:

    # mc "¿No querías hacerte el tatuaje?"
    mc "Didn't you want to get the tattoo?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3590
translate english c30s006_eva_4f644e19:

    # eva "Mira. Con este estúpido tatuaje me declaro tu esposa."
    eva "Look. With this stupid tattoo I declare myself your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3592
translate english c30s006_eva_1ac3f3b1:

    # mc "¿Qué? No lo entiendo. Ni por qué estás enfadada."
    mc "What? I don't get it. Or why you're mad."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3594
translate english c30s006_eva_f0bef838:

    # mc "No entiendo por qué estás enfadada."
    mc "I don't understand why you're mad."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3595
translate english c30s006_eva_30365316:

    # mc "Y no entiendo por qué el tatuaje es estúpido. A mí me parece muy chulo."
    mc "And I don't get why the tattoo is stupid. I think it looks really cool."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3597
translate english c30s006_eva_b508e859:

    # eva "Porque el tatuaje no tiene ningún sentido. Sólo lo tiene para mí."
    eva "Because the tattoo doesn't make any sense. It only makes sense to me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3598
translate english c30s006_eva_48efdd15:

    # mc "Bueno... ¿tú eres la bala desgastada? Y... Yo soy el anillo que te... ¿abraza?... ¿No?"
    mc "Well... you're the worn-out bullet? And... I'm the ring that... hugs you?... Right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3600
translate english c30s006_eva_e13cd98d:

    # eva "¡Lo has deducido! Más o menos... Y no es una bala. Es un cartucho. Voy a tener que seguir enseñándote."
    eva "You figured it out! More or less... And it's not a bullet. It's a cartridge. I'm going to have to keep teaching you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3601
translate english c30s006_eva_06294409:

    # mc "Me da lo mismo como se llame... Bala o cartucho. Para mí se llama [eva] y no me voy a cansar de abrazarte."
    mc "I don't care what it's called... Bullet or cartridge. To me it's called [eva] and I'm never going to get tired of hugging you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3602
translate english c30s006_eva_fbfd66ad:

    # mc "¿Y estabas enfadada por eso? ¿Por si no pillaba el significado de un tatuaje?"
    mc "And you were mad about that? Because I might not get the meaning of a tattoo?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3604
translate english c30s006_eva_8f54f3e4:

    # eva "No. Estoy enfadada porque me han dicho que solo tengo unos minutos para hacer esto contigo. Me hubiera gustado tener más tiempo, pero..."
    eva "No. I'm mad because they told me I only have a few minutes to do this with you. I would've liked to have had more time, but..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3607
translate english c30s006_eva_fe2c5e10:

    # eva "La siguiente chica ya está preparada y no la puedes hacer esperar."
    eva "The next girl is already waiting, and you can't keep her waiting."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3609
translate english c30s006_eva_97aa1882:

    # eva "Tía [bet] y Meemaw ya nos estarán esperando."
    eva "Aunt [bet] and [mee] are probably waiting for us already."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3611
translate english c30s006_eva_4868bb8c:

    # eva "Y me has dejado para la última. Aunque si hubiera sido la primera, sería otra chica la que estaría esperando en vez de ellas."
    eva "And you left me for last. Although if I had been the first, it would be another girl waiting instead of them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3612
translate english c30s006_eva_5ba675cd:

    # mc "Pues saquemos el máximo provecho de esos minutos que tenemos."
    mc "Then let's make the most of those minutes we have."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3614
translate english c30s006_eva_88f174c9:

    # "Ya tienes a [eva] entre tus brazos, con lo que besas dulcemente a tu esposa."
    "You already have [eva] in your arms, so you kiss your wife sweetly."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3615
translate english c30s006_eva_c28e304c:

    # "Puedes notar con tus labios como una sonrisa va apareciendo en su boca, reemplazando definitivamente a la expresión enfadada."
    "You can feel with your lips how a smile appears on her mouth, definitely replacing her angry expression."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3616
translate english c30s006_eva_77141af4:

    # "Sí, [eva] es una mujer de muchos talentos y puede sonreír mientras besa."
    "Yes, [eva] is a woman of many talents and she can smile while kissing."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3618
translate english c30s006_eva_a7edb271:

    # mc "¿Te parece una buena forma de aprovechar estos minutos?"
    mc "Do you think this is a good way to make the most of these minutes?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3619
translate english c30s006_eva_8231dd21:

    # eva "*Risita* La mejor. O casi..."
    eva "*Giggles* The best. Or almost..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3620
translate english c30s006_eva_f3b977fb:

    # mc "Supongo que ahora ya tengo la respuesta a por qué ibas con un traje de neopreno ayer."
    mc "I guess now I have the answer to why you were wearing a wetsuit yesterday."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3622
translate english c30s006_eva_cccee3f7:

    # eva "Si hubiera llevado un bikini hubieras podido ver el tatuaje."
    eva "If I had worn a bikini you would have been able to see the tattoo."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3624
translate english c30s006_eva_9db06e3b:

    # eva "Menos a [dap] y a [sca], creo que no nos has visto los hombros a ninguna de nosotras desde el sábado. Algunas desde antes."
    eva "Except for [dap] and [sca], I don't think you've seen any of our shoulders since Saturday. Some even before that."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3626
translate english c30s006_eva_c0a75ff7:

    # eva "Creo que no nos has visto los hombros a ninguna de nosotras desde el sábado. Algunas desde antes."
    eva "I don't think you've seen any of our shoulders since Saturday. Some even before that."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3628
translate english c30s006_eva_fe84cbc3:

    # eva "Ni siquiera a las que no se han tatuado nada. Para que no sospecharas de las que lo hemos hecho."
    eva "Not even the ones who didn't get any tattoos. So, you wouldn't suspect the ones of anyone who did."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3629
translate english c30s006_eva_a67e4ca8:

    # mc "¿Me vas a hacer daño si te digo que no me había dado cuenta? Bueno, excepto en tu caso, claro."
    mc "Are you going to hurt me if I tell you I didn't notice? Well, except in your case, of course."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3631
translate english c30s006_eva_92976fa2:

    # eva "*Risa* No te voy a hacer daño porque te diste cuenta conmigo. Pero mejor no se lo digas al resto."
    eva "*Laugh* I won't hurt you because you noticed it on me. But you'd better not tell the others."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3632
translate english c30s006_eva_be6cc02d:

    # mc "*Risa* Bueno, ahora tengo una esposa que me puede defender."
    mc "*Laugh* Well, now I have a wife who can defend me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3634
translate english c30s006_eva_6e664e3e:

    # "Os volvéis a besar. Esta vez no hay cambio de expresión en sus labios. La sonrisa va a estar permanentemente en su boca por mucho tiempo."
    "You kiss again. This time there's no change of expression on her lips. That smile is going to be permanently on her mouth for a long time."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3635
translate english c30s006_eva_d9be54a8:

    # "La alegría os recorre al mismo tiempo que vuestras lenguas recorren vuestras bocas."
    "Joy runs through you both as your tongues explore each other's mouths."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3637
translate english c30s006_eva_e4fa82e5:

    # eva "Sigue siendo un buen modo de aprovechar los minutos que nos han dado."
    eva "It's still a good way to make the most of the minutes we've been given."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3639
translate english c30s006_eva_941685a7:

    # eva "Pero deberías ir yéndote o no voy a poder defenderte de la siguiente chica."
    eva "But you should get going, or I won't be able to defend you from the next girl."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3641
translate english c30s006_eva_67847f41:

    # eva "Pero deberíamos ir a la fiesta antes de que Tía [bet] y [mee] se enfaden."
    eva "But we should head to the party before Aunt [bet] and [mee] get mad."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3642
translate english c30s006_eva_9d201223:

    # mc "Antes de irnos quiero decirte una cosa."
    mc "Before we go, I want to tell you something."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3643
translate english c30s006_eva_1e373d1a:

    # mc "Te prometo que tendremos más de cinco minutos para la renovación de votos."
    mc "I promise you we'll have more than five minutes for our vow renewal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3645
translate english c30s006_eva_c01ce725:

    # eva "¡Pero eso es dentro de 10 años!"
    eva "But that's in 10 years!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3646
translate english c30s006_eva_1f06ddb3:

    # mc "Podemos renovarlos cuando vengas a Aruba. Se me va a hacer muy largo no verte durante un mes. Casi como si pasaran 10 años."
    mc "We can renew them when you come to Aruba. It's going to feel like a long time not seeing you for a month. Almost like 10 years passing."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3648
translate english c30s006_eva_4a8a836f:

    # mc "Por cierto..."
    mc "By the way..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3656
translate english c30s006_eva_3b65869d:

    # eva "Deberías irte ya o te voy a besar hasta que Jamaal venga a buscarte."
    eva "You should go now or I'm going to kiss you until Jamaal comes looking for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3658
translate english c30s006_eva_f8f725b0:

    # eva "Deberíamos irnos ya o te voy a besar hasta que vengan a buscarnos."
    eva "We should go now or I'm going to kiss you until they come looking for us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3659
translate english c30s006_eva_8659eac3:

    # eva "Y no sé si podría controlarme para que sólo fuera un beso..."
    eva "And I don't know if I could control myself to keep it just a kiss..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3660
translate english c30s006_eva_7586ba68:

    # mc "Entonces creo que será lo mejor."
    mc "Then I guess it's for the best."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3662
translate english c30s006_eva_b067daa5:

    # "En el momento en que te separas de [eva], tus brazos se sienten vacíos."
    "The moment you pull away from [eva], your arms feel empty."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3663
translate english c30s006_eva_d1ca1244:

    # "Has estado abrazándola desde que has deducido el significado del tatuaje y ahora te falta algo entre las manos."
    "You've been holding her since you figured out the meaning of the tattoo, and now you're missing something in your hands."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3667
translate english c30s006_kim_e72b83cb:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta la piscina, donde [kim] está radiante."
    "Jamaal walks you to the pool, where [kim] is glowing."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3681
translate english c30s006_kim_e6874455:

    # mc "¿Es importante? Jamaal ha sido muy misterioso."
    mc "Is it important? Jamaal has been very mysterious."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3682
translate english c30s006_kim_187719a7:

    # mc "Por cierto... Estás guapísima, [kim], pero supongo que no hace falta que te lo diga."
    mc "By the way... You look gorgeous, [kim], but I guess I don't need to tell you that."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3684
translate english c30s006_kim_4aff8088:

    # mc "Estás guapísima, [kim], pero supongo que no hace falta que te lo diga."
    mc "You look gorgeous, [kim], but I guess I don't need to tell you that."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3685
translate english c30s006_kim_413926de:

    # kim "Me gusta que me lo digas. Creo que no me cansaré nunca de oírtelo decir."
    kim "I like it when you tell me. I don't think I'll ever get tired of hearing you say it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3687
translate english c30s006_kim_be4c5371:

    # kim "Y sí. Es importante, al menos para mí. Pero nada de lo que te tengas que preocupar demasiado..."
    kim "And yes. It's important, at least to me. But nothing you need to worry too much about..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3688
translate english c30s006_kim_f717eada:

    # mc "*Risa* Le estás poniendo aún más misterio."
    mc "*Laugh* You're making it even more mysterious."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3691
translate english c30s006_kim_d417033d:

    # kim "A ver cómo te lo explico... Las chicas hemos hablado y todas queremos que nuestras relaciones sigan adelante."
    kim "Let's see how I explain this... Us girls have talked and we all want our relationships to move forward."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3692
translate english c30s006_kim_4d408b09:

    # kim "Tanto las individuales como el harén."
    kim "Both the individual ones and the harem."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3693
translate english c30s006_kim_36d46fc7:

    # kim "Y he decidido que no quiero seguir siendo tu novia."
    kim "And I've decided I don't want to be your girlfriend anymore."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3694
translate english c30s006_kim_38df1f4c:

    # "No tiene demasiado sentido, pero la notas nerviosa por algo."
    "It doesn't make much sense, but you notice she's nervous about something."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3696
translate english c30s006_kim_7eaa9a62:

    # kim "A ver cómo te lo explico... No quiero ser tu novia cuando te vayas a Aruba."
    kim "Let's see how I explain this... I don't want to be your girlfriend when you go to Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3697
translate english c30s006_kim_ff8d1273:

    # mc "¿Estás rompiendo conmigo?"
    mc "Are you breaking up with me?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3699
translate english c30s006_kim_91b901e5:

    # kim "*Risa* ¿Qué? ¡No! Sólo quiero decir que quiero ser algo más que tu novia."
    kim "*Laugh* What? No! I just mean that I want to be something more than your girlfriend."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3702
translate english c30s006_kim_5789a106:

    # kim "Se pierde un poco la sorpresa no siendo la primera, ¿verdad?"
    kim "It ruins the surprise a bit not being the first, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3703
translate english c30s006_kim_0d394afe:

    # mc "Bueno, depende de qué te hayas tatuado puede ser una sorpresa."
    mc "Well, depending on what you got tattooed, it could be a surprise."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3705
translate english c30s006_kim_03ab7395:

    # kim "*Risa* ¡Tienes razón! ¿Qué crees que me he tatuado?"
    kim "*Laugh* You're right! What do you think I got tattooed?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3707
translate english c30s006_kim_5180b267:

    # mc "La verdad es que no sé qué tipo de anillo podría reflejarnos a nosotros."
    mc "To be honest, I don't know what kind of ring could reflect us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3708
translate english c30s006_kim_55a2a7a5:

    # mc "Si no fuera un anillo, supongo que algo referido a un mapa."
    mc "If it wasn't a ring, I guess something related to a map."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3710
translate english c30s006_kim_21ab5668:

    # mc "Si no fuera porque [deb.nick] ha roto la tendencia del anillo..."
    mc "If it wasn't for [deb.nick] breaking the ring trend..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3712
translate english c30s006_kim_127cba17:

    # mc "Si no fuera porque [emm] y [kat] han roto la tendencia del anillo..."
    mc "If it wasn't for [emm] and [kat] breaking the ring trend..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3714
translate english c30s006_kim_085ebe35:

    # mc "Si no fuera porque [kat] ha roto la tendencia del anillo..."
    mc "If it wasn't for [kat] breaking the ring trend..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3716
translate english c30s006_kim_56150f1e:

    # mc "Si no fuera porque [emm] ha roto la tendencia del anillo..."
    mc "If it wasn't for [emm] breaking the ring trend..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3717
translate english c30s006_kim_44609472:

    # mc "No tendría ni idea de qué podrías haberte tatuado."
    mc "I'd have no idea what you could have gotten tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3718
translate english c30s006_kim_18a8460d:

    # mc "Una vez rota... supongo que algo referido a un mapa."
    mc "Once broken... I guess something related to a map."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3719
translate english c30s006_kim_8e3b602a:

    # mc "Un barco no. Eso seguro que nos traería recuerdos desagradables."
    mc "Not a boat. That would surely bring back unpleasant memories."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3721
translate english c30s006_kim_80d61114:

    # kim "Con esta brújula me declaro tu esposa. De esta forma no te perderás en el mapa de mi piel."
    kim "With this compass, I declare myself your wife. This way you won't get lost on the map of my skin."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3723
translate english c30s006_kim_9381ad11:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Mi esposa? ¡Me encanta! Y el tatuaje es... tan nuestro..."
    mc "What? My wife? I love it! And the tattoo is... so us..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3725
translate english c30s006_kim_3e056b5b:

    # mc "¡Me encanta! Es... tan nuestro..."
    mc "I love it! It's... so us..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3727
translate english c30s006_kim_e26b13b6:

    # kim "*Hablando rápido* Querría haber dicho que, con la brújula, siempre encontrarías el camino de vuelta a mí, especialmente ahora que te vas..."
    kim "*Speaking fast* I wanted to say that, with the compass, you'd always find your way back to me, especially now that you're leaving..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3728
translate english c30s006_kim_b9f62b35:

    # kim "*Hablando rápido* Pero entonces la brújula la tendrías que tener tú y no tenerla yo tatuada en la piel, y..."
    kim "*Speaking fast* But then you'd have to have the compass and not me having it tattooed on my skin, and..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3729
translate english c30s006_kim_f60cf86f:

    # mc "Siempre soy yo a quién acusáis de hablar demasiado, [kim]."
    mc "I'm always the one you guys accuse of talking too much, [kim]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3731
translate english c30s006_kim_8866c810:

    # "Besas a tu esposa por primera vez. O por primera vez desde que es tu esposa."
    "You kiss your wife for the first time. Or for the first time since she became your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3732
translate english c30s006_kim_90715d39:

    # "La chica torpe e insegura que bajó de aquel avión ha desaparecido, pero su encanto sigue intacto."
    "The clumsy and insecure girl who got off that plane is gone, but her charm remains intact."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3733
translate english c30s006_kim_7901b650:

    # "Y sus labios saben tan bien como siempre. A veces te preguntas por qué no la besaste antes."
    "And her lips taste as good as ever. Sometimes you wonder why you didn't kiss her sooner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3735
translate english c30s006_kim_55a6e169:

    # kim "*Jadeo* Creo que voy a necesitar un momento para recuperar mi respiración..."
    kim "*Pant* I think I'm going to need a moment to catch my breath..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3736
translate english c30s006_kim_111299b5:

    # mc "Todo el tiempo que necesites."
    mc "Take all the time you need."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3737
translate english c30s006_kim_a9795fff:

    # kim "*Jadeo* Si pudiera tener todo el tiempo que necesito..."
    kim "*Pant* If only I could have all the time I need..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3750
translate english c30s006_kim_5bfbe0d8:

    # kim "Y ahora, aunque no quiera, deberías irte. Hay alguien más esperándote."
    kim "And now, even though I don't want you to, you should go. There's someone else waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3751
translate english c30s006_kim_b936daa1:

    # mc "Lo sé. Yo tampoco quiero dejarte aquí sola. Me fastidia que algo tan importante como esto lo tengamos que hacer tan rápido."
    mc "I know. I don't want to leave you here alone either. It pisses me off that we have to rush something as important as this."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3753
translate english c30s006_kim_7f1cb870:

    # kim "*Risa* Si no fueras coleccionando novias..."
    kim "*Laugh* If you weren't collecting girlfriends..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3754
translate english c30s006_kim_5d82ffbb:

    # mc "*Risa* Ahora parece que colecciono esposas."
    mc "*Laugh* Now it seems like I'm collecting wives."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3758
translate english c30s006_kim_598b853e:

    # "Vuelves a besar a la preciosa [kim]. Esta vez es un beso más calmado que el anterior, pero no menos tierno."
    "You kiss the beautiful [kim] again. This time it's a calmer kiss than the last one, but no less tender."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3760
translate english c30s006_kim_53d812de:

    # "Por un lado, no quieres volver con Jamaal. Por otro, quieres ver a la siguiente chica."
    "On one hand, you don't want to go back to Jamaal. On the other hand, you want to see the next girl."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3762
translate english c30s006_kim_f68740fc:

    # "Por un lado, no quieres ir a la fiesta de bienvenida. Por otro, tienes ganas de ver a [mee] y a Tía [bet]."
    "On one hand, you don't want to go to the welcome party. On the other hand, you're looking forward to seeing [mee] and Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3763
translate english c30s006_kim_73105b40:

    # "El beso dura menos de lo que quisieras, antes de que os tengáis que separar."
    "The kiss lasts less than you'd like, before you have to pull apart."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3770
translate english c30s006_meg_c2a8a2bf:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta la parte trasera de la casa de [nor], donde te está esperando [meg]."
    "Jamaal walks you to the back of [nor]'s house, where [meg] is waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3782
translate english c30s006_meg_82a2c0a8:

    # mc "Estás guapísima, [meg]."
    mc "You look gorgeous, [meg]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3783
translate english c30s006_meg_d9d1234d:

    # meg "Tú también. Me encanta cómo te queda ese traje."
    meg "You too. I love how that suit looks on you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3784
translate english c30s006_meg_c8c103a1:

    # mc "Y supongo que ahora me toca ver un tatuaje, ¿no?"
    mc "And I guess it's my turn to see a tattoo now, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3786
translate english c30s006_meg_2e8f76ce:

    # meg "Esto se me hace muy raro. Nunca pensé que llegaríamos a esto."
    meg "This feels really weird. I never thought we'd get to this point."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3788
translate english c30s006_meg_9b0c92cd:

    # mc "Sigo sin saber qué es 'esto'."
    mc "I still don't know what 'this' is."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3790
translate english c30s006_meg_5f8a0527:

    # mc "A mí me parece de lo más natural. ¿O es que sólo querías algo casual conmigo?"
    mc "It feels completely natural to me. Or did you just want something casual with me?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3792
translate english c30s006_meg_a99946ba:

    # meg "Cuando saliste de mi apartamento aquel día en Westport creí que esto sería algo casual. No pensé que estuvieras interesado en algo serio conmigo."
    meg "When you left my apartment that day in Westport, I thought this would be something casual. I didn't think you were interested in anything serious with me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3793
translate english c30s006_meg_8aa83788:

    # mc "Pero..."
    mc "But..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3795
translate english c30s006_meg_ec77b3ba:

    # meg "¡Hush! ¡Déjame hablar! He ensayado esto delante del espejo."
    meg "Hush! Let me speak! I rehearsed this in front of the mirror."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3796
translate english c30s006_meg_b16a0d6b:

    # mc "Vale. Mantendré la boca cerrada."
    mc "Okay. I'll keep my mouth shut."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3798
translate english c30s006_meg_cffe318c:

    # meg "Nunca demostraste ningún interés por mí en Portland. Sí, ya sé que estabas con [sai]..."
    meg "You never showed any interest in me in Portland. Yeah, I know you were with [sai]..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3799
translate english c30s006_meg_57a23de3:

    # meg "Pero, pese a vuestra relación abierta, nunca te fijaste en mí..."
    meg "But, despite your open relationship, you never noticed me..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3801
translate english c30s006_meg_925c581a:

    # meg "Pero aquel día me tiraste el café encima y... después mi mundo se hizo pedazos."
    meg "But that day you spilled coffee on me and... then my world shattered into pieces."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3802
translate english c30s006_meg_75e4aa8b:

    # meg "Nunca había sido tan feliz como desde que estoy contigo."
    meg "I've never been as happy as I am since I've been with you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3803
translate english c30s006_meg_68347c93:

    # meg "Me paso los días deseando que llegue el fin de semana para venir a Newport."
    meg "I spend my days wishing for the weekend to arrive so I can come to Newport."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3805
translate english c30s006_meg_2a4f9b3b:

    # meg "Y, por si fuera poco, me has dado una familia donde no esperaba encontrarla."
    meg "And, as if that weren't enough, you've given me a family where I didn't expect to find one."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3806
translate english c30s006_meg_516bb13a:

    # meg "Por todo eso..."
    meg "For all of that..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3808
translate english c30s006_meg_380da4b7:

    # meg "Con este anillo y esta taza, tan rota como mi mundo, me declaro tu esposa."
    meg "With this ring and this mug, as shattered as my world, I declare myself your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3810
translate english c30s006_meg_6799f278:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¡Estoy muy sorprendido! No sabía de qué iba esto..."
    mc "What? I'm so surprised! I had no idea what this was about..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3811
translate english c30s006_meg_77d25111:

    # mc "¡Me encanta! Estoy muy contento de ser tu marido."
    mc "I love it! I'm so happy to be your husband."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3813
translate english c30s006_meg_289973d4:

    # meg "¿No te parece una estupidez?"
    meg "You don't think it's stupid?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3815
translate english c30s006_meg_27cb444a:

    # meg "¿O que me estoy imponiendo sin darte la oportunidad de rechazarme?"
    meg "Or that I'm imposing myself without giving you the chance to reject me?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3817
translate english c30s006_meg_f98558de:

    # meg "¿O que nos estamos imponiendo sin darte la oportunidad de rechazarnos?"
    meg "Or that we're imposing ourselves without giving you the chance to reject us?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3818
translate english c30s006_meg_8858cf8c:

    # mc "[meg], me conoces bien. Sabes lo que haría si creyera que se me está imponiendo una decisión que no quiero tomar."
    mc "[meg], you know me well. You know what I would do if I believed a decision I didn't want to make was being imposed on me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3819
translate english c30s006_meg_e9cf8b47:

    # mc "Y no sería esto."
    mc "And it wouldn't be this."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3821
translate english c30s006_meg_b27a67ee:

    # "La coges entre tus brazos y la besas con pasión, demostrándole que la decisión ya está tomada."
    "You take her in your arms and kiss her passionately, showing her that the decision is already made."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3822
translate english c30s006_meg_2324307d:

    # "Y es la decisión correcta."
    "And it's the right decision."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3823
translate english c30s006_meg_88fd5c3c:

    # "Le has demostrado cien veces que estás loco por ella y, pese a todo, su inseguridad muestra su fea cara de vez en cuando."
    "You've shown her a hundred times that you're crazy about her, and despite everything, her insecurity rears its ugly head from time to time."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3824
translate english c30s006_meg_5b5df66f:

    # "Tendrás que demostrárselo aún más veces. Mil veces. Un millón de veces. Mil besos o un millón. Nunca serán suficientes."
    "You'll have to show her even more times. A thousand times. A million times. A thousand kisses or a million. It will never be enough."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3826
translate english c30s006_meg_4be9b312:

    # meg "Vale. Me ha quedado claro."
    meg "Okay. I get it now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3827
translate english c30s006_meg_bdd1bac9:

    # meg "*Risa* Bueno. No. No lo tengo claro del todo. ¿Puedo tener otro beso para acabar de quitarme las dudas?"
    meg "*Laugh* Well. No. I'm not completely sure. Can I have another kiss just to clear up my doubts?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3828
translate english c30s006_meg_84c33e1e:

    # mc "*Risa* Puedes tener todos los besos que quieras, [meg]. Hay muchos esperando que vengas a buscarlos."
    mc "*Laugh* You can have all the kisses you want, [meg]. There are many waiting for you to come and get them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3830
translate english c30s006_meg_355a60d7:

    # "Ahora es ella la que busca tu boca con la suya."
    "She is the one seeking your mouth with hers, now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3831
translate english c30s006_meg_7755c500:

    # "Obviamente, las dudas ya no existen. Ahora tan solo sois dos adictos a la boca del otro disfrutando vuestra dosis."
    "Obviously, the doubts no longer exist. Now you're just addicted to each other's mouths, enjoying your fix."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3832
translate english c30s006_meg_b6058bee:

    # "Es una adicción tan grande, que el síndrome de abstinencia empezará en el momento en que separéis vuestros labios."
    "It's such a huge addiction that the withdrawals will start the moment you part your lips."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3845
translate english c30s006_meg_49ad0d1d:

    # meg "Me podría pasar horas besándote, pero entonces me convertiría en la chica más odiada de la casa."
    meg "I could spend hours kissing you, but then I'd become the most hated girl in the house."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3846
translate english c30s006_meg_8fd2964d:

    # mc "Y no queremos eso, ¿verdad?"
    mc "And we don't want that, do we?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3847
translate english c30s006_meg_adc28b59:

    # meg "Ni eso ni que Jamaal venga a decirnos que la cena se va a retrasar por nuestra culpa."
    meg "Neither that nor Jamaal coming to tell us that dinner will be delayed because of us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3848
translate english c30s006_meg_df2106c7:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡Puñetero comilón!"
    mc "*Laugh* Fucking glutton!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3850
translate english c30s006_meg_97395f2e:

    # meg "Ve con él. Seguro que se está impacientando por llevarte con la siguiente chica."
    meg "Go with him. I'm sure he's getting impatient to take you to the next girl."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3851
translate english c30s006_meg_bd196d56:

    # mc "Te veo en un rato, cielo."
    mc "See you in a bit, honey."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3857
translate english c30s006_lis_67a47a1f:

    # "Vas con Jamaal hasta un lateral de la casa de [nor], donde [lis] te está esperando."
    "You go with Jamaal to the side of [nor]'s house, where [lis] is waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3858
translate english c30s006_lis_8937708c:

    # "Nunca habías visto a [lis] en esta zona del jardín. Tú tampoco vienes mucho."
    "You've never seen [lis] in this part of the garden. You don't come here much either."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3870
translate english c30s006_lis_e8fcf484:

    # mc "Estás preciosa, [lis]. Aunque eso no es ninguna novedad."
    mc "You look gorgeous, [lis]. Although that's nothing new."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3871
translate english c30s006_lis_08d23236:

    # lis "Gracias, [mc]. Eso le sube la autoestima a cualquier chica."
    lis "Thank you, [mc]. That boosts any girl's self-esteem."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3872
translate english c30s006_lis_767edbdd:

    # mc "Tengo ganas de ver qué te has tatuado. No creía que fueras una chica dada a hacerte tatuajes."
    mc "I can't wait to see what you got tattooed. I didn't think you were the kind of girl to get tattoos."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3874
translate english c30s006_lis_1ce434e3:

    # lis "No me han gustado nunca, pero, cuando hablamos de ello entre nosotras, creí que, si alguna vez me hacía un tatuaje, esta sería la mejor razón."
    lis "I've never liked them, but when we talked about it amongst ourselves, I thought that, if I ever got a tattoo, this would be the best reason."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3875
translate english c30s006_lis_12269735:

    # lis "Hoy es un día para cosas nuevas. Por eso he elegido esta parte del jardín. Nunca había venido aquí."
    lis "Today is a day for new things. That's why I chose this part of the garden. I'd never been here before."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3880
translate english c30s006_lis_78b91a1c:

    # lis "Me ha tocado ser la primera, con lo que te lo voy a tener que explicar desde el principio."
    lis "It's my turn to be the first, so I'm going to have to explain it to you from the beginning."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3881
translate english c30s006_lis_b4f612bf:

    # lis "Sabemos que no podremos casarnos contigo nunca, pero queremos hacerlo de alguna forma, aunque no sea oficial."
    lis "We know we'll never be able to marry you, but we want to do it somehow, even if it's not official."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3883
translate english c30s006_lis_a14ebcf0:

    # lis "Tal como hiciste con [mar]."
    lis "Just like you did with [mar]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3884
translate english c30s006_lis_d1d97b50:

    # lis "Mi vida cambió el día que me besaste en mi habitación, y quiero que continúe cambiando."
    lis "My life changed the day you kissed me in my room, and I want it to keep changing."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3886
translate english c30s006_lis_ddad0172:

    # lis "Sé que es muy pronto para hablar de casarnos, pero sé que quiero pasar el resto de mi vida contigo."
    lis "I know it's too early to talk about marriage, but I know I want to spend the rest of my life with you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3887
translate english c30s006_lis_eec975c5:

    # lis "El resto de mi vida empezó el día que me besaste en mi habitación, y quiero que continúe así."
    lis "The rest of my life started the day you kissed me in my room, and I want it to continue like this."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3888
translate english c30s006_lis_58677631:

    # mc "Me parece una idea estupenda. Y estabas monísima con aquel pijama de vaca."
    mc "I think that's a great idea. And you looked so cute in those cow pajamas."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3890
translate english c30s006_lis_12269735_1:

    # lis "Hoy es un día para cosas nuevas. Por eso he elegido esta parte del jardín. Nunca había venido aquí."
    lis "Today is a day for new things. That's why I chose this part of the garden. I've never been here before."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3891
translate english c30s006_lis_c0edf315:

    # lis "Si vamos a crear recuerdos nuevos juntos, este es un lugar perfecto, donde no se entremezclarán con otros recuerdos."
    lis "If we're going to make new memories together, this is a perfect place, where they won't get mixed up with other memories."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3892
translate english c30s006_lis_0c682f5e:

    # mc "Siempre me ha parecido la parte más anodina del jardín de [nor], pero creo que hoy cambiará eso."
    mc "It's always seemed like the most boring part of [nor]'s garden to me, but I think that'll change today."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3894
translate english c30s006_lis_3e9388f5:

    # lis "Con este anillo me declaro tu esposa. *Risa* Más te vale no rechazarme. Como te dije en la fiesta, tengo amigas que saben cómo enterrar un cadáver."
    lis "With this ring, I declare myself your wife. *Laugh* You better not reject me. Like I told you at the party, I have friends who know how to bury a body."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3895
translate english c30s006_lis_722b5ed0:

    # lis "*Risa* Y supongo que la amenaza de pasar la eternidad en una bolsa rosa con un lazo es suficiente para no hacerlo."
    lis "*Laugh* And I guess the threat of spending eternity in a pink bag with a bow is enough to stop you from doing it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3897
translate english c30s006_lis_8c2e880e:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Me estás pidiendo que me case contigo?"
    mc "What? Are you asking me to marry you?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3898
translate english c30s006_lis_d572a052:

    # lis "*Risa* No, te estoy informando de que estás casado."
    lis "*Laugh* No, I'm informing you that you are now married."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3899
translate english c30s006_lis_412e10d6:

    # mc "No te rechazaría aunque no me hubieras amenazado. Puede que esté loco, pero eso sería demasiada locura incluso para mí."
    mc "I wouldn't reject you even if you hadn't threatened me. I might be crazy, but that would be too crazy even for me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3901
translate english c30s006_lis_b2c57ae5:

    # lis "Sabes que ahora tienes una cuñada y unos suegros, ¿no? Yo también vengo con una familia en la mochila."
    lis "You know you have a sister-in-law and in-laws now, right? I come with family baggage too."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3903
translate english c30s006_lis_475f1dc4:

    # mc "*Risa* Hasta hace un momento mi cuñada eras tú."
    mc "*Laugh* Until a moment ago, you were my sister-in-law."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3905
translate english c30s006_lis_e321ed0a:

    # mc "*Risa* Supongo que [deb.nick] estará esperando que vayas a decirle cómo ha ido esto."
    mc "*Laugh* I guess [deb.nick] is waiting for you to go tell her how this went."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3906
translate english c30s006_lis_80297e41:

    # mc "Y sobre mis suegros... Me impone un poco conocerlos por lo que me habéis explicado."
    mc "And about my in-laws... I'm a bit intimidated to meet them after what you told me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3908
translate english c30s006_lis_3d2ca2d1:

    # lis "No te preocupes por eso. Al menos hasta que vuelvas de Aruba. Habrá tiempo cuando vuelvas..."
    lis "Don't worry about that. At least until you get back from Aruba. There'll be time when you return..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3910
translate english c30s006_lis_7b7818ac:

    # lis "Estaré embarazada de seis meses por entonces, con lo que se lo tendré que decir antes..."
    lis "I'll be six months pregnant by then, so I'll have to tell them before that..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3911
translate english c30s006_lis_7a110d79:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Estás embarazada?"
    mc "What? You're pregnant?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3914
translate english c30s006_lis_20691ece:

    # "Rodeas a tu nueva esposa entre tus brazos y la besas con pasión."
    "You wrap your arms around your new wife and kiss her passionately."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3916
translate english c30s006_lis_7c5b405c:

    # "No te importa demasiado cómo son sus padres ni cómo te recibirán. Lo importante es que vuestro bebé está creciendo dentro de ella."
    "You don't care too much about what her parents are like or how they'll receive you. The important thing is that your baby is growing inside her."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3918
translate english c30s006_lis_a7e1bcdd:

    # "No te importa demasiado cómo son sus padres ni cómo te recibirán. Lo importante es que [lis] sea feliz."
    "You don't care too much about what her parents are like or how they'll receive you. The important thing is that [lis] is happy."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3919
translate english c30s006_lis_89bdec89:

    # "El beso dura demasiado poco, pero transmite lo que los dos sentís. Que este es un nuevo inicio para los dos."
    "The kiss doesn't last long enough, but it conveys what you both feel. That this is a new beginning for both of you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3921
translate english c30s006_lis_a281df25:

    # mc "Te quiero, por cierto."
    mc "I love you, by the way."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3922
translate english c30s006_lis_c21ccbfc:

    # lis "*Risa* Yo también, pero ese 'por cierto' al final de la frase..."
    lis "*Laugh* I love you too, but that 'by the way' at the end of the sentence..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3923
translate english c30s006_lis_9b809284:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿No te ha gustado?"
    mc "*Laugh* Didn't you like it?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3925
translate english c30s006_lis_ce5bbdeb:

    # lis "Me ha encantado. Es tan... tú..."
    lis "I loved it. It's so... you..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3926
translate english c30s006_lis_a1b2b08c:

    # mc "Como supongo que el tatuaje es parte de ti. Sólo he visto un anillo, pero no sé si tiene algún significado extra."
    mc "Just like I guess the tattoo is part of you. I only saw a ring, but I don't know if it has any extra meaning."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3928
translate english c30s006_lis_a1c74d5d:

    # lis "Esperaba que no me lo preguntaras... Lo elegí en un impulso y..."
    lis "I was hoping you wouldn't ask... I chose it on an impulse and..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3929
translate english c30s006_lis_1bb76413:

    # mc "No tienes por qué explicármelo si no quieres."
    mc "You don't have to explain it to me if you don't want to."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3930
translate english c30s006_lis_6725231f:

    # lis "No quiero tener secretos con mi marido, con lo que allá va. Espero que no pienses que soy demasiado... tonta."
    lis "I don't want to keep secrets from my husband, so here goes. I hope you don't think I'm too... silly."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3932
translate english c30s006_lis_8a5bad29:

    # lis "Quería un anillo de boda, pero no el típico anillo de boda, liso."
    lis "I wanted a wedding ring, but not the typical, smooth wedding ring."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3933
translate english c30s006_lis_f8fdc4f3:

    # lis "Sabes que puedo ser... rugosa... a veces. Y sé que algún día me pondré borde y diré algo que no debo..."
    lis "You know I can be... rough... sometimes. And I know that someday I'll get bitchy and say something I shouldn't..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3934
translate english c30s006_lis_696c1878:

    # lis "Con el anillo, rugoso por fuera y liso por dentro, quería representar que nuestra relación va a tener baches, pero que por dentro va a ser maravillosa."
    lis "With the ring, rough on the outside and smooth on the inside, I wanted to represent that our relationship is going to have rough patches, but on the inside it's going to be wonderful."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3935
translate english c30s006_lis_185270a9:

    # mc "¿Y por eso tenía que pensar que eres tonta?"
    mc "And because of that I was supposed to think you're silly?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3936
translate english c30s006_lis_ea81299b:

    # mc "Me parece que has pensado mucho el significado de ese tatuaje. Eso es lo contrario de ser tonta para mí."
    mc "It seems to me you've put a lot of thought into the meaning of that tattoo. That's the exact opposite of being silly to me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3938
translate english c30s006_lis_8db5d2dc:

    # mc "Y hablando de joyería... Se me hace raro verte vestida así, pero sin pendientes o algún collar."
    mc "And speaking of jewelry... It's weird seeing you dressed like that, but without earrings or a necklace."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3939
translate english c30s006_lis_b9fa4c66:

    # lis "*Risa* La joya que quería llevar, la llevo tatuada en la espalda."
    lis "*Laugh* The jewel I wanted to wear is tattooed on my back."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3940
translate english c30s006_lis_bf5a70d7:

    # lis "Y no quería que nada le quitara protagonismo ni al tatuaje ni a este maravilloso vestido."
    lis "And I didn't want anything to take the spotlight away from the tattoo or this wonderful dress."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3941
translate english c30s006_lis_2dfb680b:

    # mc "Pero los brazaletes..."
    mc "But the bracelets..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3943
translate english c30s006_lis_c0d01515:

    # lis "Los brazaletes venían con el vestido... Si el diseñador los ha hecho para que vayan juntos..."
    lis "The bracelets came with the dress... If the designer made them to go together..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3944
translate english c30s006_lis_6ced6da7:

    # mc "*Risa* Y no podías resistirte a usarlos, ¿verdad?"
    mc "*Laugh* And you couldn't resist wearing them, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3946
translate english c30s006_lis_169e68d0:

    # lis "*Risa* Por supuesto que no."
    lis "*Laugh* Of course not."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3959
translate english c30s006_lis_03f7f4f6:

    # lis "No se lo digas a Jamaal, pero ahora mismo lo odio un poquito."
    lis "Don't tell Jamaal, but right now I hate him a little bit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3960
translate english c30s006_lis_22edcca7:

    # mc "*Risa* Bueno, estás en tu derecho a hacerlo. Ahora es realmente tu cuñado."
    mc "*Laugh* Well, you have the right to. He's actually your brother-in-law now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3961
translate english c30s006_lis_5ad69b49:

    # mc "Pero sé a lo que te refieres. No queremos que se inmiscuya en nuestros nuevos recuerdos apareciendo para venir a buscarme."
    mc "But I know what you mean. We don't want him intruding on our new memories by showing up to come get me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3965
translate english c30s006_lis_1195807f:

    # "Vuelves a rodear entre tus brazos a tu esposa y le das un tierno beso."
    "You wrap your arms around your wife again and give her a tender kiss."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3967
translate english c30s006_lis_a2a55821:

    # "Es una despedida momentánea, hasta que os podáis reunir de nuevo en la fiesta."
    "It's a brief goodbye, until you can meet again at the party."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3969
translate english c30s006_lis_ba496539:

    # "Es una despedida momentánea. No habrá más besos hasta que lleguéis a la fiesta. Si os paráis cada dos metros a besaros, no llegaréis nunca."
    "It's a brief goodbye. No more kisses until you reach the party. If you stop every two meters to kiss, you'll never get there."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3972
translate english c30s006_scaSpa_172a335e:

    # mc "No sé por qué deberías sorprenderte. Sabes que es lo que pienso."
    mc "I don't know why you'd be surprised. You know that's what I think."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3974
translate english c30s006_scaSpa_384715d2:

    # sca "Lo sé, pero después de tantos años esperando a que te fijaras en mí... Parece raro que ahora estemos aquí."
    sca "I know, but after so many years waiting for you to notice me... It feels weird that we're here now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3975
translate english c30s006_scaSpa_985f0df6:

    # mc "Bueno, muchas cosas han cambiado desde entonces. Ahora vives aquí y estamos juntos."
    mc "Well, a lot has changed since then. Now you live here and we're together."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3976
translate english c30s006_scaSpa_816ba868:

    # mc "Aún me acuerdo del día que viniste a esta casa para quedarte definitivamente."
    mc "I still remember the day you came to this house to stay for good."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3978
translate english c30s006_scaSpa_c4dd432b:

    # sca "Por eso he elegido este lugar. Fue donde todas las chicas me dieron la bienvenida... Bueno, más bien delante del garaje..."
    sca "That's why I chose this place. It's where all the girls welcomed me... Well, more like in front of the garage..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3979
translate english c30s006_scaSpa_db3615dd:

    # sca "Es un lugar que evoca recuerdos felices, y quiero añadir uno más a la colección de recuerdos."
    sca "It's a place that brings back happy memories, and I want to add one more to the collection."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3983
translate english c30s006_sca_8c4594b1:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta la valla de la casa de [nor], donde [sca] te está esperando."
    "Jamaal walks you to the fence of [nor]'s house, where [sca] is waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3995
translate english c30s006_sca_1d1f8c41:

    # mc "Estás guapísima, [sca]."
    mc "You look gorgeous, [sca]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3997
translate english c30s006_sca_61175f57:

    # sca "¿Sabes que aún me sorprendo cuando me lo dices?"
    sca "You know I still get surprised when you tell me that?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:3999
translate english c30s006_sca_867ec9d8:

    # mc "*Risa* Ahora solo falta que me digas que te has tatuado un plato de espaguetis."
    mc "*Laugh* Now all you have to tell me is that you got a plate of spaghetti tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4001
translate english c30s006_sca_37fe1f45:

    # sca "Lo pensé, pero... sigo considerando aquellos espaguetis un fracaso."
    sca "I thought about it, but... I still consider that plate of spaghetti a failure."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4002
translate english c30s006_sca_7625bc4d:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Como comida o como material de construcción?"
    mc "*Laugh* As food or as building material?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4004
translate english c30s006_sca_4ad5434a:

    # sca "Pero es el momento de crear más recuerdos felices."
    sca "But it's time to make more happy memories."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4008
translate english c30s006_sca_64eb58d0:

    # sca "¿Sabes que aún me sorprendo cuando me dices que estoy guapa?"
    sca "Do you know I still get surprised when you tell me I'm pretty?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4010
translate english c30s006_sca_e81aca87:

    # mc "*Risa* Y puedes usar el recuerdo de los espaguetis para cimentarlo todo."
    mc "*Laugh* And you can use the memory of the spaghetti to cement it all together."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4012
translate english c30s006_sca_40d51db3:

    # sca "Sigo considerando aquellos espaguetis un fracaso..."
    sca "I still consider that plate of spaghetti a failure..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4013
translate english c30s006_sca_ccdecebc:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Como comida o como material de construcción? Mejor no contestes."
    mc "*Laugh* As food or as building material? Better not answer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4014
translate english c30s006_sca_473bd89c:

    # mc "Pero aún no me has dicho qué hacemos aquí."
    mc "But you still haven't told me what we're doing here."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4016
translate english c30s006_sca_182d2a20:

    # sca "Crear más recuerdos felices."
    sca "Creating more happy memories."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4018
translate english c30s006_sca_72a55296:

    # sca "Con este anillo me declaro tu esposa. Siempre lo he querido ser y..."
    sca "With this ring, I declare myself your wife. I've always wanted to be, and..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4020
translate english c30s006_sca_b2238db1:

    # sca "Sabemos que no nos vamos a poder casar nunca por ser medio-hermanos..."
    sca "We know we'll never be able to get married because we're half-siblings..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4022
translate english c30s006_sca_e1ad1235:

    # sca "Sabemos que no nos vamos a poder casar nunca porque no quiero ser la única con la que te cases..."
    sca "We know we'll never be able to get married because I don't want to be the only one you marry..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4024
translate english c30s006_sca_05cc603f:

    # sca "Nunca te he preguntado si quieres casarte oficialmente en el futuro..."
    sca "I've never asked you if you want to officially get married in the future..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4026
translate english c30s006_sca_c1617417:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¡Me parece una idea increíble!"
    mc "What? I think it's an incredible idea!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4028
translate english c30s006_sca_a950cff0:

    # "No tienes nada que añadir. Sabes que, después de tanto tiempo enamorada de ti, dar este paso es muy importante para [sca]."
    "You have nothing to add. You know that, after being in love with you for so long, taking this step is very important for [sca]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4029
translate english c30s006_sca_9dbbf15d:

    # "Vuestro primer beso como marido y mujer es espectacular. Atrás quedaron las lecciones sobre besos."
    "Your first kiss as husband and wife is spectacular. The kissing lessons are a thing of the past."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4030
translate english c30s006_sca_dc57ba56:

    # "Hoy no eres un maestro orgulloso, sino un marido feliz."
    "Today you're not a proud teacher, but a happy husband."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4032
translate english c30s006_sca_e5794297:

    # sca "Espero que nunca pares de dejarme sin respiración con cada beso."
    sca "I hope you never stop taking my breath away with every kiss."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4033
translate english c30s006_sca_1b74192a:

    # mc "Yo también lo espero. Pero ahora eres una gran besadora. Tú también me dejas sin respiración a mí."
    mc "I hope so too. But you're a great kisser now. You take my breath away too."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4034
translate english c30s006_sca_18ea3d61:

    # mc "El anillo es precioso. ¿De dónde sacaste la idea?"
    mc "The ring is beautiful. Where did you get the idea?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4036
translate english c30s006_sca_8ae54c5e:

    # sca "Es una mezcla de los dibujos de Escher, de mis múltiples planes para acabar aquí, y... de los espaguetis. *Risita*"
    sca "It's a mix of Escher's drawings, my multiple plans to end up here, and... spaghetti. *Giggles*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4037
translate english c30s006_sca_e2d24fc1:

    # mc "*Risa* Sabía que esos espaguetis estarían con nosotros para siempre."
    mc "*Laugh* I knew the spaghetti would be with us forever."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4039
translate english c30s006_sca_fb25f0a2:

    # sca "Aquel día hablaste sobre nietos por primera vez."
    sca "That day you talked about grandkids for the first time."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4040
translate english c30s006_sca_88c86085:

    # sca "No voy a llevar un plato de espaguetis tatuado en el hombro, pero esto me recordará las partes bonitas de aquella noche."
    sca "I'm not going to get a plate of spaghetti tattooed on my shoulder, but this will remind me of the beautiful parts of that night."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4042
translate english c30s006_sca_5b7436fc:

    # "Dices 'Te quiero' en lengua de signos. Sabes perfectamente a qué se refiere con lo de las partes bonitas."
    "You say 'I love you' in sign language. You know exactly what she means by the beautiful parts."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4043
translate english c30s006_sca_c6f30c60:

    # "Has aprendido a decir más cosas en lengua de signos desde entonces, pero guardas la sorpresa para otro momento."
    "You've learned to say more things in sign language since then, but you're saving the surprise for another time."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4045
translate english c30s006_sca_5ca28aa9:

    # sca "Yo también te quiero, [mc]."
    sca "I love you too, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4046
translate english c30s006_sca_ddbfc8ed:

    # "No hay lágrimas como la primera vez. Tan solo una sonrisa radiante que adoras."
    "There are no tears like the first time. Just a radiant smile that you adore."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4048
translate english c30s006_sca_55e28dec:

    # "Os volvéis a besar. Es un beso que se repetirá el resto de vuestras vidas."
    "You kiss each other again. It's a kiss that will repeat for the rest of your lives."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4049
translate english c30s006_sca_97082a8c:

    # "Tierno y lleno de amor. No necesitáis nada más."
    "Tender and full of love. You don't need anything else."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4062
translate english c30s006_sca_dffd77c8:

    # mc "Creo que odio a Jamaal. Seguro que ha sido idea suya organizar esto y que sólo tengamos unos minutos juntos."
    mc "I think I hate Jamaal. I bet it was his idea to set this up, so we'd only have a few minutes together."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4063
translate english c30s006_sca_7f027a43:

    # sca "Bueno, más o menos. Nosotras propusimos más tiempo, pero Jamaal dijo que se haría muy tarde para la fiesta."
    sca "Well, sort of. We proposed more time, but Jamaal said it would get too late for the party."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4064
translate english c30s006_sca_626d82f4:

    # sca "[meg] y [sam.nick] tienen que ir a trabajar y..."
    sca "[meg] and [sam.nick] have to go to work, and..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4065
translate english c30s006_sca_e861bc6f:

    # mc "Y será mejor que me empiece a ir, ¿no?"
    mc "And I better get going, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4066
translate english c30s006_sca_23db0430:

    # sca "*Risa* Y será mejor que yo no conteste a eso."
    sca "*Laugh* And I better not answer that."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4072
translate english c30s006_dap_1d48deec:

    # "Acompañas a Jamaal por el jardín. Dais una vuelta a la casa de [nor], como si estuviera haciendo tiempo."
    "You accompany Jamaal through the garden. You walk around [nor]'s house, as if he were killing time."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4073
translate english c30s006_dap_be7e0b1b:

    # "Una sonrisa pícara se dibuja en su cara durante todo el recorrido."
    "A mischievous smile plays on his face the entire walk."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4075
translate english c30s006_dap_02ab889e:

    # "Finalmente te acompaña hasta donde está [dap]."
    "Finally, he walks you to where [dap] is."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4087
translate english c30s006_dap_b629431d:

    # mc "No sé si es más espectacular el vestido o tu sonrisa, [dap]"
    mc "I don't know what's more spectacular, the dress or your smile, [dap]"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4090
translate english c30s006_dap_08765051:

    # mc "Lo digo en serio. No sé si es más espectacular el vestido o tu sonrisa, [dap]"
    mc "I mean it. I don't know what's more spectacular, the dress or your smile, [dap]"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4092
translate english c30s006_dap_8826a7e5:

    # dap "Bueno, esto creo que se me va a dar muy mal..."
    dap "Well, I think I'm going to be really bad at this..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4093
translate english c30s006_dap_ba0734c2:

    # mc "No sé de nada que se te dé especialmente mal, si exceptuamos las habilidades sociales, y has mejorado mucho en eso."
    mc "I don't know of anything you're particularly bad at, if we exclude social skills, and you've improved a lot at that."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4094
translate english c30s006_dap_f1aa8275:

    # dap "Esto forma parte de las habilidades sociales. Y esta en particular no la he entrenado."
    dap "This is part of social skills. And I haven't trained this one in particular."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4096
translate english c30s006_dap_72538b9d:

    # dap "Sabes que la noche en el hotel medieval fue la mejor noche de mi vida, ¿no?"
    dap "You know the night at the medieval hotel was the best night of my life, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4097
translate english c30s006_dap_fa08f7a3:

    # mc "Fue una noche fantástica."
    mc "It was a fantastic night."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4098
translate english c30s006_dap_153f3889:

    # dap "Y sé que no la podré olvidar nunca. Por eso he querido hacer esto de esta forma."
    dap "And I know I'll never be able to forget it. That's why I wanted to do it this way."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4099
translate english c30s006_dap_f9397d13:

    # mc "No lo entiendo. No veo nada de medieval en el vestido."
    mc "I don't get it. I don't see anything medieval about the dress."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4101
translate english c30s006_dap_64e13c9d:

    # dap "No es el vestido sino el anillo. Con este anillo me declaro tu esposa. Si aceptas, claro."
    dap "It's not the dress, but the ring. With this ring, I declare myself your wife. If you accept, of course."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4103
translate english c30s006_dap_bec28955:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Mi esposa?"
    mc "What? My wife?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4104
translate english c30s006_dap_4e09a2ca:

    # mc "Por supuesto que acepto. Tan solo espero que no haya un noble cerca que quiera tener su derecho a Prima Nocta."
    mc "Of course I accept. I just hope there isn't a noble nearby who wants to claim his right to Prima Nocta."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4106
translate english c30s006_dap_f3a5418c:

    # dap "Bueno, eso realmente no existía... o solo en raras ocasiones. Los historiadores todavía no se han encontrado pruebas sobre..."
    dap "Well, that didn't really exist... or only on rare occasions. Historians still haven't found proof about..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4108
translate english c30s006_dap_8379288d:

    # "No quieres una clase de historia. Quieres besar a tu esposa."
    "You don't want a history lesson. You want to kiss your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4109
translate english c30s006_dap_10f1cd87:

    # "Pobre del noble, real o ficticio, que quiera arrancártela de tus brazos."
    "Woe to the noble, real or fictional, who wants to tear her from your arms."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4110
translate english c30s006_dap_241218f0:

    # "El beso es tan alucinante como la mujer cuya boca recorre tu lengua."
    "The kiss is as mind-blowing as the woman whose mouth your tongue explores."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4112
translate english c30s006_dap_e550d4ac:

    # dap "... si eso pasaba, o solo son leyendas o malas interpretaciones de documentos históricos."
    dap "... if that happened, it's either just legends or misinterpretations of historical documents."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4113
translate english c30s006_dap_d60cb9e5:

    # mc "*Risa* Tenías que acabar la frase, ¿verdad?"
    mc "*Laugh* You had to finish the sentence, didn't you?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4114
translate english c30s006_dap_8ed1ec15:

    # dap "Por supuesto. *Risa* Sabes que no me gusta que me interrumpan cuando estoy hablando de algo que me apasiona."
    dap "Of course. *Laugh* You know I don't like being interrupted when I'm talking about something I'm passionate about."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4115
translate english c30s006_dap_36b8ab70:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Ni siquiera con un beso?"
    mc "*Laugh* Not even with a kiss?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4117
translate english c30s006_dap_1e8ab5d7:

    # dap "Bueno... siempre pueden haber excepciones."
    dap "Well... there can always be exceptions."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4118
translate english c30s006_dap_660341a8:

    # mc "Hablando de cosas que te apasionan. ¿Lo del anillo es un trenzado celta?"
    mc "Speaking of things you're passionate about. Is that a Celtic braid on the ring?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4120
translate english c30s006_dap_482089d3:

    # dap "No necesitas darme más razones para que me case contigo."
    dap "You don't need to give me more reasons to marry you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4121
translate english c30s006_dap_d6d8d4d9:

    # dap "Que hayas reconocido el trenzado no me va a convertir más en tu esposa de lo que ya lo soy."
    dap "The fact that you recognized the braid isn't going to make me any more your wife than I already am."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4122
translate english c30s006_dap_15b480a6:

    # mc "*Risa* Pues para vivir la experiencia medieval completa... Creo que te compraré un cinturón de castidad para cuando me vaya a Aruba."
    mc "*Laugh* Well, to live the full medieval experience... I think I'll buy you a chastity belt for when I go to Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4124
translate english c30s006_dap_5a05aca0:

    # dap "*Risa* Eres un idiota."
    dap "*Laugh* You're an idiot."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4125
translate english c30s006_dap_ad11834c:

    # mc "*Risa* Más idiota eres tú, que te has casado conmigo."
    mc "*Laugh* You're a bigger idiot, since you're the one who married me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4138
translate english c30s006_dap_360843a5:

    # dap "Ve con Jamaal antes de que te secuestre."
    dap "Go with Jamaal before I kidnap you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4139
translate english c30s006_dap_208eb672:

    # mc "*Risa* Jamaal o ser secuestrado por una preciosa pelirroja. Creo que lo has planteado mal."
    mc "*Laugh* Jamaal or being kidnapped by a gorgeous redhead. I think you framed that wrong."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4144
translate english c30s006_dap_e7a7260d:

    # "Le das un beso de despedida antes de volver con tu mejor amigo. Un amigo al que odias ahora mismo."
    "You give her a goodbye kiss before going back to your best friend. A friend you hate right now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4146
translate english c30s006_dap_7bf98d36:

    # "Os besáis antes de dirigiros hacia donde se va a desarrollar la fiesta de bienvenida."
    "You kiss before heading to where the welcome party is going to be held."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4149
translate english c30s006_waiting_b212a456:

    # sai "Y ahora deberías irte. [personaje] te está esperando y se empieza a hacer tarde."
    sai "And now you should go. [personaje] is waiting for you and it's getting late."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4151
translate english c30s006_waiting_fe61f00d:

    # sai "*Risa* Tengo ganas de saber qué tiene preparado la bruja pelirroja. Nos ha ocultado su tatuaje a todas."
    sai "*Laugh* I'm dying to know what the redheaded witch has prepared. She's hidden her tattoo from all of us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4155
translate english c30s006_sai_67c52d8f:

    # "Jamaal te guía hacia la piscina. Por el camino más largo"
    "Jamaal guides you to the pool. Taking the long way around."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4167
translate english c30s006_sai_61cda3b0:

    # mc "Estás preciosa, [sai]. Nunca te había visto con este vestido"
    mc "You look gorgeous, [sai]. I've never seen you in this dress."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4170
translate english c30s006_sai_e4884a3d:

    # mc "Nunca te había visto con ese vestido."
    mc "I've never seen you in that dress."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4173
translate english c30s006_sai_e395a783:

    # sai "La mayoría de nosotras nos hemos comprado vestidos nuevos para lo de hoy."
    sai "Most of us bought new dresses for today."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4175
translate english c30s006_sai_b09607c8:

    # sai "Me lo he comprado para lo de hoy."
    sai "I bought it for today."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4176
translate english c30s006_sai_c1702079:

    # sai "También he ido a la peluquería a cortarme un poco las puntas. Pero esperar que te des cuenta de eso es una utopía."
    sai "I also went to the hair salon to get my ends trimmed. But expecting you to notice that is wishful thinking."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4178
translate english c30s006_sai_b46fd0e4:

    # mc "¿Para lo de hoy? ¿La fiesta de bienvenida?"
    mc "For today? The welcome party?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4180
translate english c30s006_sai_d1698e30:

    # mc "Supongo que necesitabas un vestido con los hombros al descubierto. No tienes demasiados así."
    mc "I guess you needed an off-the-shoulder dress. You don't have too many of those."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4181
translate english c30s006_sai_6a61e338:

    # mc "Puedes ver que he ignorado a propósito la falacia sobre que no me doy cuenta de tus cambios de peinado."
    mc "You can see I purposely ignored the fallacy about me not noticing your hairstyle changes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4183
translate english c30s006_sai_6221e6e5:

    # sai "Antes de empezar, déjame explicarte algo."
    sai "Before we start, let me explain something to you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4184
translate english c30s006_sai_cff3b865:

    # mc "Adelante..."
    mc "Go ahead..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4186
translate english c30s006_sai_f09f8e1b:

    # mc "Aunque no sé a qué te refieres con 'empezar'."
    mc "Although I don't know what you mean by 'start'."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4188
translate english c30s006_sai_91112266:

    # sai "En Portland tú querías formalizar la relación y yo no estaba preparada."
    sai "In Portland, you wanted to make the relationship official and I wasn't ready."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4189
translate english c30s006_sai_bdc1e0a9:

    # sai "Me comporté como una idiota, pero sé que, si no lo hubiera hecho, posiblemente no estaríamos aquí hoy, en estas circunstancias."
    sai "I acted like an idiot, but I know that if I hadn't, we probably wouldn't be here today, under these circumstances."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4190
translate english c30s006_sai_f27d9acf:

    # mc "Lo más probable."
    mc "It would be unlikely..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4192
translate english c30s006_sai_a9f86b0c:

    # sai "Con este anillo me declaro tu esposa. Espero que no seas tú el que se comporte como un idiota ahora."
    sai "With this ring I declare myself your wife. I hope you're not the one acting like an idiot now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4194
translate english c30s006_sai_c24a8cc6:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Quieres casarte conmigo?"
    mc "What? You want to marry me?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4195
translate english c30s006_sai_a234826d:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Has pasado de no querer ser mi novia a querer ser mi esposa?"
    mc "*Laugh* You went from not wanting to be my girlfriend to wanting to be my wife?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4197
translate english c30s006_sai_3286805c:

    # sai "No lo has entendido. No quiero ser tu esposa. {b}SOY{/b} tu esposa. Si no me rechazas..."
    sai "You don't get it. I don't want to be your wife. I {b}AM{/b} your wife. If you don't reject me..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4199
translate english c30s006_sai_da2f211f:

    # "Ni por todo el oro del mundo rechazarías una propuesta como esa."
    "You wouldn't reject a proposal like that for all the gold in the world."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4200
translate english c30s006_sai_f5802446:

    # "Vuestros labios se juntan en un beso mil veces besado. Y cada una de esas veces ha sido diferente de la anterior."
    "Your lips meet in a kiss you've shared a thousand times. And each of those times has been different from the last."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4201
translate english c30s006_sai_7ca822a0:

    # "Esta vez no es diferente. O sí. No se parece a ningún beso que os hayáis dado nunca, pero es igual que todos los anteriores."
    "This time is not different. Or maybe it is. It's unlike any kiss you've ever had, yet it's just like all the ones before."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4203
translate english c30s006_sai_d354d4b0:

    # sai "Me lo tomaré como que voy a seguir siendo la única idiota de esta relación."
    sai "I'll take that to mean I'm going to keep being the only idiot in this relationship."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4204
translate english c30s006_sai_ae8c2294:

    # mc "*Risa* Bueno, el resto de la familia discreparía. Ya no sé si me llamo [mc] o me llamo 'Idiota'."
    mc "*Laugh* Well, the rest of the family would disagree. I don't even know if my name is [mc] or 'Idiot' anymore."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4206
translate english c30s006_sai_baebe3a3:

    # sai "*Risa* Bueno, no se equivocan demasiado."
    sai "*Laugh* Well, they're not too far off."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4207
translate english c30s006_sai_d8bedc16:

    # mc "Por cierto, me encanta el anillo. Es muy original."
    mc "By the way, I love the ring. It's very original."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4209
translate english c30s006_sai_5a77b5e2:

    # sai "Busqué por internet modelos de anillos y cuando vi uno parecido a este, un círculo sin cerrar, me recordó a nuestra relación abierta."
    sai "I looked up ring designs online, and when I saw one like this, an unclosed circle, it reminded me of our open relationship."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4211
translate english c30s006_sai_de0a23ab:

    # sai "Añadí las barras como una representación del harén. Como si cada chica que añades ayudara a cerrar el círculo."
    sai "I added the bars as a representation of the harem. Like every girl you add helps close the circle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4212
translate english c30s006_sai_32fa8174:

    # sai "Y cada barra es diferente para reflejar que cada una de nosotras somos diferentes también."
    sai "And each bar is different to reflect that each of us is different too."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4214
translate english c30s006_sai_e9f060d9:

    # sai "El anillo era un poco soso, con lo que añadí las barras, como si cada paso que diéramos cerrara un poco el círculo."
    sai "The ring was a bit plain, so I added the bars, as if every step we took closed the circle a little bit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4215
translate english c30s006_sai_bc853c29:

    # sai "Unos pasos son más grandes que otros, y por eso las barras son diferentes."
    sai "Some steps are bigger than others, and that's why the bars are different."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4216
translate english c30s006_sai_fb777412:

    # mc "Es una explicación muy bonita, [sai]. Y un diseño muy original."
    mc "That's a very beautiful explanation, [sai]. And a very original design."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4217
translate english c30s006_sai_07bc7ef5:

    # mc "Pero ¿por qué ahora?"
    mc "But why now?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4219
translate english c30s006_sai_a7980798:

    # mc "Sé que el resto del harén te ha impulsado a ello, pero ¿por qué {b}tú{/b} quieres hacer esto ahora?"
    mc "I know the rest of the harem pushed you to do it, but why do {b}you{/b} want to do this now?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4221
translate english c30s006_sai_c28b53dc:

    # sai "Porque ahora te vuelves a ir."
    sai "Because now you're leaving again."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4222
translate english c30s006_sai_44be9ac9:

    # sai "La última vez que te fuiste, tuve que recorrer medio mundo... dos veces... para volver a encontrarte."
    sai "The last time you left, I had to travel halfway across the world... twice... to find you again."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4223
translate english c30s006_sai_2ab0e5fd:

    # sai "Cuando te fuiste de Portland, habíamos decidido dejarlo. Ésta es mi forma de decirte que seguiré aquí cuando vuelvas."
    sai "When you left Portland, we had decided to call it quits. This is my way of telling you that I'll still be here when you get back."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4225
translate english c30s006_sai_f807fac9:

    # "No tienes palabras para expresar lo que sus palabras significan para ti, porque sabes lo mucho que significan para ella también."
    "You have no words to express what her words mean to you, because you know how much they mean to her too."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4226
translate english c30s006_sai_655f22ce:

    # "Sí, incluso tú te quedas sin palabras... a veces."
    "Yeah, even you are left speechless... sometimes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4227
translate english c30s006_sai_67090958:

    # "Por suerte, tus labios hablan mejor que tú en esas ocasiones."
    "Luckily, your lips speak better than you do on those occasions."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4255
translate english c30s006_sai_e9977e23:

    # "Tras un rápido beso, te despides de [sai] y vuelves con Jamaal."
    "After a quick kiss, you say goodbye to [sai] and return to Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4260
translate english c30s006_eil_ca34ac36:

    # "Jamaal te hace dar una vuelta a la casa hasta que llegáis al lugar donde espera la siguiente chica."
    "Jamaal makes you walk around the house until you reach the place where the next girl is waiting."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4261
translate english c30s006_eil_a4b7ded6:

    # "Esta vez es [eil] quien te espera."
    "This time it's [eil] who's waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4263
translate english c30s006_eil_5ae7a3b9:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta donde [eil] te está esperando."
    "Jamaal accompanies you to where [eil] is waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4275
translate english c30s006_eil_ea0676ab:

    # mc "Hola, cielo. Estás preciosa."
    mc "Hey, honey. You look beautiful."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4276
translate english c30s006_eil_ae1edf16:

    # eil "Gracias, cariño. A ti te queda genial ese traje."
    eil "Thanks, sweetie. You look great in that suit."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4280
translate english c30s006_eil_282317b0:

    # eil "Aquí estamos para cerrar el círculo, ¿no?"
    eil "Here we are coming full circle, aren't we?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4281
translate english c30s006_eil_11fd5fe5:

    # mc "No sé a qué círculo te refieres, [eil.nick]."
    mc "I don't know what circle you're talking about, [eil.nick]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4283
translate english c30s006_eil_66ad5ba8:

    # eil "Empezamos a salir en el instituto, intentamos tener una relación a distancia, rompimos, y hemos vuelto a estar juntos."
    eil "We started dating in high school, tried a long-distance relationship, broke up, and now we're back together."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4284
translate english c30s006_eil_76917942:

    # eil "¿No te parece un círculo incompleto? El primer beso que nos dimos aquí, en tu casa, fue justo aquí. En las tumbonas que suele haber aquí."
    eil "Doesn't it feel like an incomplete circle? The first kiss we had here, at your house, was right here. On the lounge chairs that are usually here."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4285
translate english c30s006_eil_2f020688:

    # mc "Lo recuerdo. No querías subir a mi habitación por si quería ir demasiado deprisa."
    mc "I couldn't forget it. You didn't want to go up to my room in case I wanted to move too fast."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4286
translate english c30s006_eil_26abd808:

    # mc "No querías besarme con mi familia alrededor y estuvimos leyendo Romeo y Julieta justo aquí, bajo el sol."
    mc "You didn't want to kiss me with my family around, and we were reading Romeo and Juliet right here, under the sun."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4288
translate english c30s006_eil_149a7ec2:

    # eil "Y yo no me estaba enterando de nada de lo que leíamos. Tan solo tenía ganas de besarte mientras recitabas a Shakespeare."
    eil "And I wasn't paying attention to anything we were reading. I just wanted to kiss you while you recited Shakespeare."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4289
translate english c30s006_eil_284b092e:

    # mc "A mí me temblaban las piernas. Por suerte estábamos sentados y no se notaba..."
    mc "My legs were shaking. Luckily we were sitting down and you couldn't notice..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4291
translate english c30s006_eil_21be6e06:

    # eil "*Risa* Nunca lo hemos hablado, pero lo noté. No hacías más que mover la pierna, como cuando estás concentrado, pero más rápido."
    eil "*Laugh* We've never talked about it, but I noticed. You kept bouncing your leg, like when you're concentrating, but faster."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4292
translate english c30s006_eil_8a6cfb64:

    # mc "Y, pese a todo, me besaste."
    mc "And, despite everything, you kissed me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4294
translate english c30s006_eil_77a344d9:

    # eil "No pude aguantar más y me daba lo mismo que tu familia estuviera en casa."
    eil "I couldn't hold back anymore, and I didn't care that your family was home."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4295
translate english c30s006_eil_c9849209:

    # eil "Eras irresistible entonces y lo sigues siendo ahora, cielo."
    eil "You were irresistible then, and you still are now, honey."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4296
translate english c30s006_eil_41238e83:

    # eil "*Risa* Te prohíbo que le leas Shakespeare a ninguna chica en Aruba. Bueno, se lo puedes leer a [ama], [eva], o Tía [bet]..."
    eil "*Laugh* I forbid you from reading Shakespeare to any girl in Aruba. Well, you can read it to [ama], [eva], or Aunt [bet]..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4298
translate english c30s006_eil_66bfdd0e:

    # mc "Pero no sé qué tiene que ver eso con cerrar el círculo."
    mc "But I don't know what that has to do with closing the circle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4300
translate english c30s006_eil_6908eb69:

    # mc "Y ahora quieres cerrar el círculo aquí mismo."
    mc "And now you want to close the circle right here."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4302
translate english c30s006_eil_630f2f6c:

    # eil "Con este anillo me declaro tu esposa. Quería que fuera a la vez un círculo y un anillo..."
    eil "With this ring I declare myself your wife. I wanted it to be both a circle and a ring..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4305
translate english c30s006_eil_2df82cab:

    # eil "Aunque después de ver los otros tatuajes... parece soso."
    eil "Although after seeing the other tattoos... it looks plain."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4307
translate english c30s006_eil_85d2e4a1:

    # eil "Sé que parece un poco soso..."
    eil "I know it looks a bit plain..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4308
translate english c30s006_eil_6d556fde:

    # mc "A mí me parece perfecto. Y no sólo como círculo que cerramos hoy, sino por todo lo que significa."
    mc "It looks perfect to me. And not just as a circle we're closing today, but for everything it means."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4309
translate english c30s006_eil_60010b50:

    # mc "Un círculo es una línea. Una línea es un conjunto de puntos. Y los hemos recorrido todos tú y yo juntos."
    mc "A circle is a line. A line is a set of points. And we've traveled them all, you and I, together."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4312
translate english c30s006_eil_d4129b88:

    # eil "No pareces sorprendido de que me haya declarado tu esposa en vez de pedirte que te casaras conmigo."
    eil "You don't seem surprised that I declared myself your wife instead of asking you to marry me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4314
translate english c30s006_eil_8713ae2f:

    # eil "Espero que no estés decepcionado porque te lo haya dicho así... En vez de pedirte que te casaras conmigo."
    eil "I hope you're not disappointed that I told you like this... Instead of asking you to marry me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4315
translate english c30s006_eil_aca3df8a:

    # eil "Sé que no soy la primera, pero..."
    eil "I know I'm not the first, but..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4316
translate english c30s006_eil_18220fc4:

    # mc "No lo estoy. En el momento en que has hablado de cerrar el círculo..."
    mc "I'm not. The moment you talked about closing the circle..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4317
translate english c30s006_eil_07eb4f19:

    # mc "Pedirme que me casara contigo sería tan solo otro punto del círculo. Lo tendríamos que cerrar en la boda."
    mc "Asking me to marry you would just be another point on the circle. We'd have to close it at the wedding."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4319
translate english c30s006_eil_707f665d:

    # eil "Siempre supe que algún día me lo pedirías. O al menos lo esperaba..."
    eil "I always knew you'd ask me someday. Or at least I hoped you would..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4320
translate english c30s006_eil_dc12fcaf:

    # mc "Yo ya lo hice, [eil.nick]. Muchas veces. Y siempre dijiste que sí."
    mc "I already did, [eil.nick]. Many times. And you always said yes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4322
translate english c30s006_eil_ef24bf69:

    # eil "¿Qué? ¿Cuándo?"
    eil "What? When?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4323
translate english c30s006_eil_7af9a0c4:

    # mc "Cada vez que te quedabas a dormir en mi habitación durante el último año de instituto."
    mc "Every time you slept over in my room during our senior year of high school."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4324
translate english c30s006_eil_9eb44d41:

    # mc "¿Quién se dormía primero siempre?"
    mc "Who always fell asleep first?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4326
translate english c30s006_eil_e502bffb:

    # eil "Yo. *Risa* Caía dormida en el momento en que mi cabeza tocaba tu pecho. Eras tan cómodo..."
    eil "Me. *Laugh* I'd fall asleep the moment my head touched your chest. You were so comfortable..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4327
translate english c30s006_eil_184e3723:

    # mc "Cuando llevabas unos minutos durmiendo y se me dormía el brazo, siempre decía lo mismo."
    mc "When you had been sleeping for a few minutes and my arm went numb, I always said the same thing."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4328
translate english c30s006_eil_60183f2e:

    # mc "'Te quiero. Un día me casaré contigo. ¿Quieres casarte conmigo, [eil.nick]?'"
    mc "'I love you. One day I'll marry you. Will you marry me, [eil.nick]?'"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4330
translate english c30s006_eil_df31f998:

    # eil "*Risa* ¿Y yo contestaba?"
    eil "*Laugh* And did I answer?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4331
translate english c30s006_eil_bad375a1:

    # mc "Siempre decías lo mismo. 'Sí. Mañana.'"
    mc "You always said the same thing. 'Yes. Tomorrow.'"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4332
translate english c30s006_eil_9a0c29ba:

    # mc "Y 'mañana' es hoy."
    mc "And 'tomorrow' is today."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4334
translate english c30s006_eil_24e05be0:

    # "Coges a tu esposa entre tus brazos por primera vez como recién casados."
    "You take your wife in your arms for the first time as newlyweds."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4335
translate english c30s006_eil_e01ac0ed:

    # "Os besáis como si llevarais 25 años casados. Como si vuestra relación acabara de empezar. Como si... Como si estuvierais hechos el uno para el otro."
    "You kiss as if you've been married for 25 years. As if your relationship had just begun. As if... As if you were made for each other."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4336
translate english c30s006_eil_3e06dcba:

    # "Tu vida con ella pasa por delante de tus ojos cerrados mientras rememoras cada beso, cada abrazo, cada..."
    "Your life with her flashes before your closed eyes as you remember every kiss, every embrace, every..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4338
translate english c30s006_eil_c1dbc1d6:

    # eil "Yo también te quiero."
    eil "I love you too."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4339
translate english c30s006_eil_0bdbade6:

    # mc "*Risa* Hace un rato me he acordado de una cosa. No sé si puedo querer a una mentirosa."
    mc "*Laugh* I just remembered something a little while ago. I don't know if I can love a liar."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4341
translate english c30s006_eil_994ddd17:

    # eil "¿Qué ha recordado esa mente retorcida tuya?"
    eil "What did that twisted mind of yours remember?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4342
translate english c30s006_eil_1b970c90:

    # mc "¿Te acuerdas de la primera vez que hablamos de que un día nos casaríamos? Estando tú despierta, claro."
    mc "Do you remember the first time we talked about getting married one day? While you were awake, of course."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4344
translate english c30s006_eil_ad3fb2a5:

    # eil "*Risa* Dije que le pagaríamos a Jamaal un título de esos que se pueden sacar online para que nos pudiera casar."
    eil "*Laugh* I said we'd pay for Jamaal to get one of those online ordinations, so he could marry us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4345
translate english c30s006_eil_57d59f5f:

    # mc "*Risa* Llevo un rato esperando que aparezca Jamaal con una túnica o que se ponga un alzacuellos."
    mc "*Laugh* I've been waiting for a while for Jamaal to show up in a robe or put on a clerical collar."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4346
translate english c30s006_eil_9868d037:

    # eil "*Risa* Aún está en la puerta del garaje. Y sigue vestido... normal."
    eil "*Laugh* He's still by the garage door. And he's still dressed... normally."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4347
translate english c30s006_eil_f3749152:

    # mc "*Risa* Me alegra que faltaras a tu palabra."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm glad you broke your promise."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4349
translate english c30s006_eil_d2f68ef5:

    # eil "Yo también. Esto es sólo nuestro. Es nuestro momento, aunque tenga que durar muy poco."
    eil "Me too. This is just ours. It's our moment, even if it has to be very short."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4351
translate english c30s006_eil_c555b884:

    # eil "Y aunque lo tengamos que compartir con otra de tus chicas."
    eil "And even if we have to share it with another of your girls."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4353
translate english c30s006_eil_d4d18733:

    # eil "Y aunque lo tengamos que compartir con tus otras chicas."
    eil "And even if we have to share it with your other girls."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4355
translate english c30s006_eil_12a75e24:

    # mc "Por cierto, ¿sabes que llevas el mismo vestido que [sai]?"
    mc "By the way, do you know you're wearing the same dress as [sai]?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4357
translate english c30s006_eil_bf119dfd:

    # eil "*Risa* Lo hemos descubierto hace un rato. Por suerte el color es diferente."
    eil "*Laugh* We discovered that a little while ago. Luckily the color is different."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4358
translate english c30s006_eil_a8338645:

    # eil "Hasta cierto punto tiene lógica. Compartimos gustos por nuestro marido y por los vestidos... Bueno, compartimos marido."
    eil "It makes sense to a certain extent. We share a taste in our husband and in dresses... Well, we share a husband."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4360
translate english c30s006_eil_e511e78f:

    # mc "Lo sé. Pero..."
    mc "I know. But..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4362
translate english c30s006_eil_50d8828a:

    # mc "Lo sé."
    mc "I know."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4375
translate english c30s006_eil_3d7ee003:

    # eil "Y ahora deberías irte con nuestro maestro de ceremonias."
    eil "And now you should go with our master of ceremonies."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4376
translate english c30s006_eil_1f51a10d:

    # eil "Hay otra chica esperándote y, como Primera Concubina, tengo que cuidar de ella y no robarle más tiempo del necesario."
    eil "There's another girl waiting for you and, as First Concubine, I have to take care of her and not steal more time from her than necessary."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4379
translate english c30s006_eil_32d399b7:

    # eil "No deberíamos robarles más tiempo."
    eil "We shouldn't steal any more time from them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4381
translate english c30s006_eil_e663a11e:

    # "Robáis un poco de tiempo para alargar el beso lo máximo posible antes de tener que separaros."
    "You steal a little time to prolong the kiss as much as possible before having to separate."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4382
translate english c30s006_eil_27e396cb:

    # "Tu boda con [eil] se te ha hecho demasiado corta. Tan corta como parece cada uno de vuestros besos, independientemente de cuánto duren."
    "Your wedding with [eil] felt too short. As short as every one of your kisses seems, regardless of how long they last."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4386
translate english c30s006_bet_d701c163:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta donde [bet] te está esperando."
    "Jamaal accompanies you to where [bet] is waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4398
translate english c30s006_bet_1eaec4a7:

    # mc "Estás guapísima, [bet]."
    mc "You look gorgeous, [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4401
translate english c30s006_bet_f4523fc7:

    # mc "Bienvenida de vuelta a casa."
    mc "Welcome back home."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4402
translate english c30s006_bet_a63ecc15:

    # mc "Se me hace raro verte vestida así y... maquillada."
    mc "It feels weird seeing you dressed like this and... wearing makeup."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4404
translate english c30s006_bet_d55f5189:

    # "Tras varios días de separación vuestros labios se buscan antes de que la exmonja conteste."
    "After several days apart, your lips seek each other out before the ex-nun can answer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4405
translate english c30s006_bet_ac130ccf:

    # "Es un beso breve, pero es suficiente para calmar el hambre del otro que habéis tenido estos últimos días. Al menos de momento."
    "It's a brief kiss, but it's enough to satisfy the hunger for each other you've had these past few days. At least for now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4407
translate english c30s006_bet_bf07ec13:

    # bet "Una mujer tiene que ponerse guapa para lo que vamos a hacer, ¿no?"
    bet "A woman has to make herself look pretty for what we're about to do, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4408
translate english c30s006_bet_57a619cd:

    # mc "No hacía falta que lo hicieras. Sé que no te gusta llevar maquillaje. Y estás guapa sin maquillaje también."
    mc "You didn't have to do it. I know you don't like wearing makeup. And you're beautiful without it, too."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4410
translate english c30s006_bet_41b9b8af:

    # mc "Pero aún no sé qué vamos a hacer..."
    mc "But I still don't know what we're going to do..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4412
translate english c30s006_bet_b57a0e2f:

    # bet "Algunas chicas me comentaron una idea muy loca por videoconferencia hace unos días..."
    bet "Some girls told me about a crazy idea over a video call a few days ago..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4414
translate english c30s006_bet_428b3337:

    # bet "Y al harén le pareció bien... A mí al principio no me lo pareció, pero..."
    bet "And the harem thought it was fine... I didn't think so at first, but..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4418
translate english c30s006_bet_d5fc6ccc:

    # bet "Cuando [mad.nick] propuso lo del tatuaje, el día que nos íbamos, justo después del post-it, me pareció una locura."
    bet "When [mad.nick] suggested the tattoo thing, the day we were leaving, right after the post-it, I thought it was crazy."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4420
translate english c30s006_bet_981c554d:

    # bet "Cuando propusieron lo del tatuaje, en una videoconferencia, me pareció una locura."
    bet "When they suggested the tattoo thing, during a video call, I thought it was crazy."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4421
translate english c30s006_bet_eac4f0c6:

    # bet "Tal como le iba dando vueltas, cada vez me parecía mejor."
    bet "The more I thought about it, the better it looked."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4422
translate english c30s006_bet_15b4725f:

    # mc "A veces dais miedo cuando os ponéis a planear cosas."
    mc "Sometimes you girls are scary when you start planning things."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4424
translate english c30s006_bet_3244ad36:

    # bet "El maquillaje ha sido el toque final. Sin él me sentía un poco... sosa."
    bet "The makeup was the final touch. Without it I felt a bit... plain."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4425
translate english c30s006_bet_11f72a8d:

    # mc "¿Sosa? ¿Con ese vestido? ¡Estás increíble!"
    mc "Plain? In that dress? You look incredible!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4427
translate english c30s006_bet_e5bf5c27:

    # bet "No me refiero al vestido. Con este anillo me declaro tu esposa. Sé que es un anillo muy sencillo, pero..."
    bet "I'm not talking about the dress. With this ring I declare myself your wife. I know it's a very simple ring, but..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4429
translate english c30s006_bet_c24a8cc6:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Quieres casarte conmigo?"
    mc "What? You want to marry me?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4430
translate english c30s006_bet_57392c9f:

    # bet "No, tan solo te informo de que estamos casados."
    bet "No, I'm just informing you that we are married."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4432
translate english c30s006_bet_93e02c5a:

    # mc "¡Es super chulo!"
    mc "It's super cool!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4434
translate english c30s006_bet_8501b711:

    # bet "*Risa* Si cuando me casé con Dios no le pedí permiso, tampoco te lo pido a ti. Aunque espero que lo nuestro acabe mejor."
    bet "*Laugh* If I didn't ask God for permission when I married Him, I'm not asking you either. Though I hope our marriage ends up better."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4435
translate english c30s006_bet_0adc99db:

    # mc "*Risa* Te dio su permiso implícito, si existe. Si no hubiera querido, te hubiera mandado un rayo vengador o algo así."
    mc "*Laugh* He gave you his implicit permission, if he exists. If he hadn't wanted it, he would've struck you with a vengeful lightning bolt or something."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4436
translate english c30s006_bet_4450d272:

    # bet "*Risa* Sí, sería muy de su estilo."
    bet "*Laugh* Yeah, that'd be very much his style."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4438
translate english c30s006_bet_bf94198a:

    # bet "¿Y tú? ¿Me aceptas como tu esposa?"
    bet "What about you? Do you take me as your wife?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4439
translate english c30s006_bet_350d51ec:

    # mc "*Risa* Bueno, yo no puedo lanzar rayos vengadores... Lo de Mjolnir solo es un apodo."
    mc "*Laugh* Well, I can't shoot vengeful lightning bolts... The Mjolnir thing is just a nickname."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4440
translate english c30s006_bet_3fa46961:

    # mc "Pero puedo hacer esto."
    mc "But I can do this."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4442
translate english c30s006_bet_7841d839:

    # "Coges a la exmonja entre tus brazos y le das un apasionado beso."
    "You take the ex-nun in your arms and give her a passionate kiss."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4443
translate english c30s006_bet_e182ed99:

    # "No necesita maquillarse o cambiar para ser una mujer maravillosa. Aunque tienes que reconocer que le sienta bien."
    "She doesn't need to wear makeup or change anything to be a wonderful woman. Though you have to admit it suits her well."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4444
translate english c30s006_bet_60fcf5a9:

    # "Una parte de tu cerebro espera la llegada de un rayo vengador durante todo el beso."
    "A part of your brain expects a vengeful lightning bolt to strike during the whole kiss."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4445
translate english c30s006_bet_6bbb53e4:

    # "Esa parte de tu cerebro piensa que lo de robarle la mujer a Dios podría tener consecuencias inesperadas. ¿Le has hecho netori a Dios?"
    "That part of your brain thinks that stealing God's wife might have unexpected consequences. Did you just netoried God?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4447
translate english c30s006_bet_b2b1ee82:

    # "Para cuando el beso acaba, el resto de tu mente ha acallado a la que se preocupaba demasiado."
    "By the time the kiss ends, the rest of your mind has silenced the part that worried too much."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4448
translate english c30s006_bet_da3416b3:

    # bet "*Risa* No lanzas rayos, pero una corriente me ha recorrido de los pies a la cabeza con ese beso."
    bet "*Laugh* You don't shoot lightning bolts, but a current ran from head to toe with that kiss."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4449
translate english c30s006_bet_16f104b7:

    # mc "*Risa* Al final va a resultar que sí que soy un dios."
    mc "*Laugh* It might just turn out that I really am a god after all."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4451
translate english c30s006_bet_8b717354:

    # bet "*Risa* Que no se te suba a la cabeza."
    bet "*Laugh* Don't let it go to your head."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4453
translate english c30s006_bet_efb16b55:

    # bet "*Risa* Al final he cambiado el harén de un dios por el de un marido divino."
    bet "*Laugh* In the end, I traded a god's harem for a divine husband's."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4455
translate english c30s006_bet_a6f37f25:

    # bet "*Risa* Al final he cambiado un marido divino por otro."
    bet "*Laugh* In the end, I traded one divine husband for another."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4456
translate english c30s006_bet_2cb3ebe0:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que, si sigues diciendo cosas así, se me va a acabar subiendo a la cabeza."
    mc "*Laugh* I think if you keep saying things like that, it really is going to go to my head."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4458
translate english c30s006_bet_865ef142:

    # bet "*Risita* Bueno, creo que las togas y las túnicas le quedan mejor a él, si eso ayuda a bajarte los humos."
    bet "*Giggles* Well, I think togas and tunics look better on him, if that helps bring you down a peg."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4459
translate english c30s006_bet_94427f9b:

    # mc "*Risa* Ahí, dando donde más duele. Todas os ponéis de acuerdo en que la ropa me queda mal. Incluso Jamaal."
    mc "*Laugh* Right where it hurts. You all agree that clothes look bad on me. Even Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4460
translate english c30s006_bet_6d5f71b1:

    # bet "*Risa* Es que, excepto este traje, casi todo te queda mal."
    bet "*Laugh* It's just that, except for this suit, almost everything looks bad on you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4461
translate english c30s006_bet_60b586be:

    # mc "*Risa* A veces os odio..."
    mc "*Laugh* Sometimes I hate you all..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4462
translate english c30s006_bet_c2af87c6:

    # mc "Cambiando de tema, me gusta que hayas elegido un anillo sencillo a la par que bonito."
    mc "Changing the subject, I like that you chose a ring that's simple yet beautiful."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4464
translate english c30s006_bet_ade5eaa7:

    # bet "Creo que nos define bastante. Nuestra relación es... más bonita que pasional..."
    bet "I think it defines us quite well. Our relationship is... more beautiful than passionate..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4465
translate english c30s006_bet_26527847:

    # bet "No me entiendas mal. No me estoy quejando... Dudo que muchas mujeres tengan una noche como la que tuvimos en Monterey."
    bet "Don't get me wrong. I'm not complaining... I doubt many women could have a night like the one we had in Monterey."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4466
translate english c30s006_bet_1da42911:

    # mc "No hemos tenido demasiado tiempo para estar juntos desde que volvimos de Monterey... Al menos espero poder pasar tiempo contigo en Aruba."
    mc "We haven't had much time to be together since we got back from Monterey... At least I hope to spend time with you in Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4468
translate english c30s006_bet_dc116e3f:

    # mc "Pero tengo una duda..."
    mc "But I have a question..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4480
translate english c30s006_bet_89ae90ed:

    # bet "Y ahora creo que deberías irte. Hay otra chica esperándote."
    bet "And now I think you should go. There's another girl waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4481
translate english c30s006_bet_754d4ffd:

    # mc "Y después está la fiesta para daros la bienvenida a ti y a Meemaw."
    mc "And then there's the party to welcome you and Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4483
translate english c30s006_bet_352265c1:

    # bet "Y ahora creo que deberíamos irnos. [mee] se debe estar impacientando."
    bet "And now I think we should get going. [mee] must be getting impatient."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4484
translate english c30s006_bet_64468151:

    # mc "Vamos antes de que deje de impacientarse y empiece a enfadarse."
    mc "Let's go before she stops being impatient and starts getting angry."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4486
translate english c30s006_bet_44ec7625:

    # bet "*Risa* Además, [nor] me ha prometido que pedirá pizza."
    bet "*Laugh* Besides, [nor] promised me she'd order pizza."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4488
translate english c30s006_bet_50d08048:

    # "Le das un rápido beso mientras piensas en si hay algo que [bet] prefiera a la pizza."
    "You give her a quick kiss while thinking if there's anything [bet] prefers over pizza."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4489
translate english c30s006_bet_16e7c5e5:

    # "Aparte de besos, abrazos y sexo."
    "Other than kisses, hugs, and sex."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4490
translate english c30s006_bet_c909a0a9:

    # "Tampoco llega el rayo vengador esta vez."
    "The avenging lightning bolt doesn't strike this time either."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4494
translate english c30s006_mee_0454fc12:

    # "Vas con Jamaal hasta la parte delantera de la casa de [nor], donde [mee] te está esperando."
    "You walk with Jamaal to the front of [nor]'s house, where [mee] is waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4495
translate english c30s006_mee_d9538034:

    # "Está en el mismo lugar donde se quedó esperándote, empapada, el día de vuestra cita."
    "She's in the same spot where she waited for you, soaking wet, on the day of your date."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4507
translate english c30s006_mee_3d5a0eea:

    # mc "Estás guapísima, Meemaw."
    mc "You look gorgeous, Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4511
translate english c30s006_mee_77cd268a:

    # "Besas a la preciosa anciana dándole la bienvenida de vuelta a la casa de la locura."
    "You kiss the beautiful old lady, welcoming her back to the madhouse."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4513
translate english c30s006_mee_6207dd43:

    # mc "Bienvenida de vuelta a casa, por cierto."
    mc "Welcome back home, by the way."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4514
translate english c30s006_mee_f39ccf73:

    # mee "¿Alguna vez vas a dejar de llamarme Meemaw? Estamos juntos y..."
    mee "Are you ever going to stop calling me Meemaw? We're together and..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4515
translate english c30s006_mee_128ba819:

    # mc "No lo creo, si a ti no te molesta. Para mí siempre serás Meemaw. No puedo pensar en ti como [mee]."
    mc "I don't think so, if it doesn't bother you. To me you'll always be Meemaw. I can't think of you as [mee]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4516
translate english c30s006_mee_63b3a05b:

    # mc "Sé que ahora salimos juntos, pero eso no evita que sigas siendo mi Meemaw."
    mc "I know we're dating now, but that doesn't stop you from being my Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4517
translate english c30s006_mee_f995842d:

    # mc "Aunque, si te molesta, podría intentarlo."
    mc "Though, if it bothers you, I could try."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4519
translate english c30s006_mee_6b355fbb:

    # mee "No me molesta. Tan solo creía que, quizás, quisieras empezar a llamarme por mi nombre."
    mee "It doesn't bother me. I just thought that, maybe, you'd want to start calling me by my name."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4521
translate english c30s006_mee_21adc95b:

    # mee "Y dejar de pensar en mí como en tu abuela."
    mee "And stop thinking of me as your grandmother."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4523
translate english c30s006_mee_306d2530:

    # mee "Y dejar de pensar en mí como en tu pseudo-abuela."
    mee "And stop thinking of me as your pseudo-grandmother."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4524
translate english c30s006_mee_8c778ea0:

    # mc "Nunca dejaré de pensar en ti de esa forma. Que estemos juntos no significa que dejemos de ser quienes somos."
    mc "I'll never stop thinking of you that way. Just because we're together doesn't mean we should stop being who we are."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4525
translate english c30s006_mee_f65cda30:

    # mc "Aunque no entiendo por qué quieres que deje de llamarte Meemaw de repente."
    mc "Though I don't understand why you want me to stop calling you Meemaw all of a sudden."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4527
translate english c30s006_mee_10b3834d:

    # mee "No quiero, pero si tú quisieras, este tatuaje perdería un poco de sentido."
    mee "I don't, but if you wanted to, this tattoo would lose a bit of its meaning."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4528
translate english c30s006_mee_22038707:

    # mee "Con estos anillos me declaro tu esposa. Uno por abuela, otro por amante, y el tercero por esposa."
    mee "With these rings, I declare myself your wife. One for grandmother, one for lover, and the third for wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4530
translate english c30s006_mee_8c2e880e:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Me estás pidiendo que me case contigo?"
    mc "What? Are you asking me to marry you?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4531
translate english c30s006_mee_cbc28dda:

    # mee "*Risa* No, te estoy informando de que estamos casados."
    mee "*Laugh* No, I'm informing you that we're married."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4532
translate english c30s006_mee_61e0bbc6:

    # mc "Me encanta. Le has buscado un bonito significado al tatuaje."
    mc "I love it. You've found a beautiful meaning for the tattoo."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4534
translate english c30s006_mee_117f96c3:

    # mee "No le busques mucho significado a los colores de los anillos..."
    mee "Don't look too much into the colors of the rings..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4535
translate english c30s006_mee_88334ecb:

    # mc "Antes de decir qué significaba cada anillo, he pensado en tu pelo. De negro a blanco pasando por plateado."
    mc "Before saying what each ring meant, I thought about your hair. From black to white, passing through silver."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4536
translate english c30s006_mee_bbe1de8d:

    # mc "Resume toda nuestra historia, aunque no te recuerdo con el pelo negro aparte de en las fotos que he visto."
    mc "It sums up our whole history, although I don't remember you with black hair other than in the photos I've seen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4538
translate english c30s006_mee_425df98e:

    # mee "*Risa* Creo que ya tenía algunas canas cuando naciste. Tenía la edad de [nor]."
    mee "*Laugh* I think I already had some gray hair when you were born. I was [nor]'s age."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4539
translate english c30s006_mee_90e57846:

    # mc "Algún día nos tenemos que sentar a mirar fotos tuyas de joven para saber lo que me he perdido."
    mc "Someday we'll have to sit down and look at photos of you when you were young to see what I missed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4540
translate english c30s006_mee_d95acac8:

    # mc "No me malinterpretes, no cambiaría esta versión de ti por ninguna otra, pero nunca he mirado tus fotos antiguas viéndote como mujer."
    mc "Don't get me wrong, I wouldn't trade this version of you for any other, but I've never looked at your old photos seeing you as a woman."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4541
translate english c30s006_mee_f1b98564:

    # mc "Siempre has sido Meemaw. Y lo seguirás siendo."
    mc "You've always been Meemaw. And you always will be."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4543
translate english c30s006_mee_71cd67eb:

    # mee "Te sorprenderás con algunas de esas fotos viejas... Hay algunas un poco atrevidas."
    mee "You'll be surprised by some of those old photos... Some of them are a bit risqué. Although those aren't in the family photo album."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4544
translate english c30s006_mee_75be8823:

    # mc "Estoy deseando verlas. Pero creo que, ahora, tengo que besar a mi esposa."
    mc "I'm looking forward to seeing those. But I think, right now, I need to kiss my wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4546
translate english c30s006_mee_3ce60a68:

    # "Rodeas a la mujer entre tus brazos y la besas con pasión."
    "You wrap your arms around the woman and kiss her passionately."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4547
translate english c30s006_mee_c7d3002a:

    # "Recuerdas lo frágil que parecía cuando llego a casa, aún recuperándose de la quimioterapia."
    "You remember how fragile she seemed when she came home, still recovering from chemotherapy."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4548
translate english c30s006_mee_ca2dd766:

    # "Esa fragilidad ha desaparecido para ser sustituida por fuerza y alegría por vivir."
    "That fragility has disappeared, replaced by strength and a joy for life."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4550
translate english c30s006_mee_1cb7d108:

    # mee "No sigas o voy a manchar el vestido con leche..."
    mee "Stop, or I'm going to stain my dress with milk..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4551
translate english c30s006_mee_1d6ce081:

    # mc "¿Ya te has excitado?"
    mc "Are you turned on already?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4553
translate english c30s006_mee_a86509f1:

    # mee "*Risa* Llevo excitada desde que te he visto aparecer con Jamaal."
    mee "*Laugh* I've been turned on since I saw you show up with Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4554
translate english c30s006_mee_f25ca35d:

    # mc "*Risa* No dejas de sorprenderme."
    mc "*Laugh* You never cease to amaze me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4567
translate english c30s006_mee_b2798f60:

    # mee "Ahora deberías irte. No quiero entretenerte más tiempo del debido."
    mee "You should go now. I don't want to keep you longer than necessary."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4569
translate english c30s006_mee_b92cd66f:

    # mee "Mi hija te está esperando. Es la siguiente."
    mee "My daughter is waiting for you. She's next."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4571
translate english c30s006_mee_afddf2ae:

    # mee "[mar] te está esperando. Es la siguiente."
    mee "[mar] is waiting for you. She's next."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4573
translate english c30s006_mee_5c41aefb:

    # mee "[ama] te está esperando. Es la siguiente."
    mee "[ama] is waiting for you. She's next."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4574
translate english c30s006_mee_72d90bd7:

    # mc "Odio tener que hacer esto de forma tan rápida, pero tengo ganas de verla y saber qué tiene preparado. O tatuado."
    mc "I hate having to do this so quickly, but I can't wait to see her and find out what she has prepared. Or tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4576
translate english c30s006_mee_0b698cef:

    # mee "Ahora deberíamos ir a la fiesta de bienvenida. No van a empezar sin mí."
    mee "We should go to the welcome party now. They won't start without me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4577
translate english c30s006_mee_7ee3de1e:

    # mee "Y si se enfría la comida, [bet] va a enfadarse."
    mee "And if the food gets cold, [bet] is going to get mad."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4578
translate english c30s006_mee_c669c20f:

    # mc "*Risa* No creo que se enfadara hoy aunque la dejáramos sin comer."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't think she'd get mad today even if we left her without food."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4581
translate english c30s006_mee_f2a7f40c:

    # "Le das un rápido beso a la preciosa mujer antes de volver con Jamaal."
    "You give the beautiful woman a quick kiss before going back to Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4583
translate english c30s006_mee_44ed7f0a:

    # "Le das un rápido beso a la preciosa mujer antes de dirigiros a la fiesta de bienvenida de la que ella es protagonista."
    "You give the beautiful woman a quick kiss before heading to the welcome party where she is one of the guests of honor."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4587
translate english c30s006_nor_f6c839fd:

    # "Jamaal te guía hasta el lugar donde comisteis el primer domingo después de tu retorno."
    "Jamaal guides you to the place where you ate on the first Sunday after your return."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4588
translate english c30s006_nor_6feaeb46:

    # "Lo de vestirse elegante para comer cayó en desuso una vez [mar] salió de la depresión."
    "Dressing up for lunch fell out of practice once [mar] got out of her depression."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4589
translate english c30s006_nor_370ee0c2:

    # "[nor] te está esperando justo donde os besasteis aquel día."
    "[nor] is waiting for you right where you kissed that day."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4602
translate english c30s006_nor_6ba9a7bd:

    # mc "Me encanta ese vestido, [nor]. Y aún más lo que hay dentro."
    mc "I love that dress, [nor]. And even more so, what's inside it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4604
translate english c30s006_nor_334d5ddf:

    # nor "No recuerdo la última vez que me vestí de blanco. ¿Hace un mes quizás? Pero me parecía una buena idea hacerlo hoy."
    nor "I don't remember the last time I wore white. A month ago, maybe? But it seemed like a good idea to do it today."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4605
translate english c30s006_nor_5df46d1d:

    # mc "Si cada vestido blanco te queda como ese, creo que deberías alternarlos con los vestidos rojos."
    mc "If every white dress looks like that on you, I think you should alternate them with the red ones."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4607
translate english c30s006_nor_3915d4cd:

    # nor "*Risa* ¿No te gustan mis vestidos rojos?"
    nor "*Laugh* You don't like my red dresses?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4608
translate english c30s006_nor_af1c9927:

    # mc "Me encanta todo de ti. Tus vestidos y cuando te los quitas. Tus labios rojos que resaltan aún más vestida de blanco."
    mc "I love everything about you. Your dresses and when you take them off. Your red lips that stand out even more when you're dressed in white."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4609
translate english c30s006_nor_3e138c53:

    # mc "No hay nada que me gustaría cambiar de ti. Te lo he dicho muchas veces."
    mc "There's nothing I would change about you. I've told you that many times."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4611
translate english c30s006_nor_6fd2789d:

    # nor "Y esa es una de las razones por las que estoy enamorada de ti."
    nor "And that's one of the reasons why I'm in love with you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4612
translate english c30s006_nor_257109cb:

    # nor "Empezaste besando a una mujer insegura y ahora soy capaz de vestirme de blanco... *Risa* Y el blanco hace gorda."
    nor "You started out kissing an insecure woman and now I'm able to wear white... *Laugh* And white makes you look fat."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4614
translate english c30s006_nor_a36aadf1:

    # nor "Pero ¿de verdad no cambiarías nada de mí? ¿Ni siquiera mi espalda o mis hombros?"
    nor "But would you really not change anything about me? Not even my back or my shoulders?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4615
translate english c30s006_nor_ce3a349f:

    # mc "Lo puedo jurar por lo más sagrado que haya."
    mc "I can swear it on everything holy."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4617
translate english c30s006_nor_cb817f62:

    # mc "Aunque tengo ganas de ver qué te has tatuado."
    mc "Although I really want to see what you got tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4620
translate english c30s006_nor_2344e727:

    # nor "Pues lo siento mucho, pero hay un cambio."
    nor "Well, I'm very sorry, but there is a change."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4621
translate english c30s006_nor_5633de16:

    # nor "Con estos anillos me declaro tu esposa."
    nor "With these rings, I declare myself your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4622
translate english c30s006_nor_492b2426:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¡Me encantan!"
    mc "What? I love them!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4624
translate english c30s006_nor_be145f13:

    # nor "Quise representar muchas cosas con ellos, pero no estoy muy convencida de que puedas entenderlo..."
    nor "I wanted to represent a lot of things with them, but I'm not entirely convinced you'd understand..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4625
translate english c30s006_nor_5d6d2ac3:

    # mc "Puedes explicármelo si quieres, pero antes quiero besarte."
    mc "You can explain it to me if you want, but first I want to kiss you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4627
translate english c30s006_nor_9de8d95f:

    # "¡Cómo ha cambiado todo en un mes! La mujer insegura a la que besaste en aquel café se ha hecho un tatuaje para declararse tu esposa."
    "How much everything has changed in a month! The insecure woman you kissed in that cafe has gotten a tattoo to declare herself your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4628
translate english c30s006_nor_4e46c22c:

    # "Sus labios siguen siendo como un hogar al que volver siempre. Eso nunca cambiará."
    "Her lips are still like a home to always return to. That will never change."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4629
translate english c30s006_nor_ba9d2ce6:

    # "Es imposible no pensar en todos los momentos que habéis pasado juntos en las últimas cinco semanas mientras recorres tu boca con su lengua."
    "It's impossible not to think about all the moments you've spent together over the last five weeks while her tongue explores your mouth."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4631
translate english c30s006_nor_a50ba377:

    # mc "Ahora puedes explicármelo."
    mc "Now you can explain it to me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4632
translate english c30s006_nor_6b556e89:

    # nor "*Risa* Ahora no tengo aliento para hacerlo."
    nor "*Laugh* I don't have the breath to do it right now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4633
translate english c30s006_nor_24cbcccb:

    # mc "Entonces no tendrás aliento tampoco para resistirte si te quito el vestido, ¿no?"
    mc "Then you won't have the breath to resist if I take off your dress either, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4635
translate english c30s006_nor_ef9463b1:

    # nor "¿Qué? ¿Quieres quitarme el vestido? ¿Ahora?"
    nor "What? You want to take off my dress? Now?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4636
translate english c30s006_nor_59ebb47a:

    # mc "*Risa* Siempre quiero quitarte lo que llevas puesto. Pero he pensado que si vas a la fiesta desnuda sería el último paso en tu exhibicionismo."
    mc "*Laugh* I always want to take off whatever you're wearing. But I figured going to the party naked would be the ultimate step in your exhibitionism."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4638
translate english c30s006_nor_ecf892d8:

    # nor "*Risa* Y el primer paso de mi madre hacia el ataúd. Si voy desnuda le dará un infarto."
    nor "*Laugh* And my mother's first step towards the coffin. If I go naked, she'll have a heart attack."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4639
translate english c30s006_nor_e6dd70a6:

    # mc "Estaba bromeando, pero veo que ya has recuperado el aliento. ¿Me explicas el tatuaje?"
    mc "I was joking, but I see you've caught your breath. Care to explain the tattoo?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4641
translate english c30s006_nor_f858ed42:

    # nor "Son dos anillos entrelazados, representándonos a ti y a mí."
    nor "They're two intertwined rings, representing you and me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4642
translate english c30s006_nor_a589503c:

    # nor "Pensé que todo esto no empezó cuando volviste de la universidad, sino que hemos estado caminando hacia este momento desde hace años."
    nor "I thought that all of this didn't start when you came back from college, but rather that we've been walking towards this moment for years."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4644
translate english c30s006_nor_67c3ae50:

    # nor "Por eso los anillos no tienen los bordes lisos... Son como un zigzag en el que nos acercábamos y nos alejábamos."
    nor "That's why the rings don't have smooth edges... They're like a zigzag where we kept getting closer and pulling away."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4645
translate english c30s006_nor_175ae74a:

    # nor "Y tienen varios tonos para representar todas las fases por las que hemos pasado."
    nor "And they have different shades to represent all the phases we've been through."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4647
translate english c30s006_nor_1aab70d4:

    # nor "Ya lo sé... Muy abstracto y nadie va a pillar el significado si no se lo explico."
    nor "I know... Very abstract, and nobody is going to get the meaning if I don't explain it to them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4648
translate english c30s006_nor_249d2dac:

    # mc "¿Necesitas explicárselo a alguien? Bueno, excepto a mí, pero ya sabes que a veces me cuesta pillar las cosas."
    mc "Do you need to explain it to anyone? Well, except me, but you know I have a hard time catching on to things, sometimes."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4649
translate english c30s006_nor_22c1bd1f:

    # mc "Una vez me lo has explicado me parece un tatuaje fantástico."
    mc "Now that you've explained it to me, I think it's a fantastic tattoo."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4651
translate english c30s006_nor_02c1164b:

    # nor "Tienes razón, no le debemos explicaciones a nadie, ¿verdad?"
    nor "You're right, we don't owe anyone an explanation, do we?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4652
translate english c30s006_nor_b1d5bd51:

    # mc "Solo a quién queramos dárselas, cielo."
    mc "Only to whoever we want to give them to, sweetheart."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4665
translate english c30s006_nor_55be637a:

    # nor "Bueno, basta ya de explicaciones. Tienes que irte."
    nor "Well, enough explanations. You need to go."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4667
translate english c30s006_nor_e4a82d36:

    # nor "[mar] se debe de estar impacientando."
    nor "[mar] must be getting impatient."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4669
translate english c30s006_nor_e56ffe5b:

    # nor "[ama] se debe de estar impacientando."
    nor "[ama] must be getting impatient."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4670
translate english c30s006_nor_459986f2:

    # mc "Sabes que me quedaría aquí contigo un rato más, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You know I'd stay here with you a while longer, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4671
translate english c30s006_nor_acca25ea:

    # nor "Lo sé, pero no puedes hacerla esperar."
    nor "I know, but you can't keep her waiting."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4673
translate english c30s006_nor_f0739e10:

    # nor "Bueno, basta ya de explicaciones. Tenemos que irnos."
    nor "Well, enough explanations. We need to go."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4674
translate english c30s006_nor_7f170b3e:

    # nor "Mi madre y Tía [bet] se deben de estar impacientando."
    nor "My mom and Aunt [bet] must be getting impatient."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4675
translate english c30s006_nor_9793940b:

    # mc "Estoy seguro de que lo entenderán si tardamos un poco. Sabes que me quedaría aquí contigo un rato más, ¿verdad?"
    mc "I'm sure they'll understand if we take a little while. You know I'd stay here with you a while longer, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4676
translate english c30s006_nor_670f8956:

    # nor "Lo sé, pero no podemos hacerlas esperar. Y yo tengo que pasar por la cocina antes de unirme a la fiesta."
    nor "I know, but we can't keep them waiting. And I have to stop by [mar]'s kitchen before joining the party."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4678
translate english c30s006_nor_f6f054a1:

    # "Os dais un rápido beso de despedida. Tan solo vais a estar separados unos minutos, pero se os van a hacer muy largos."
    "You share a quick goodbye kiss. You'll only be apart for a few minutes, but it's going to feel like a lifetime."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4679
translate english c30s006_nor_46424b7e:

    # "Y en un par de días os separaréis por unos meses. Eso va a ser un infierno."
    "And, in a couple of days, you'll be apart for a few months. That's going to be hell."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4684
translate english c30s006_mar_430a3249:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta la última parada del alucinante recorrido."
    "Jamaal escorts you to the final stop of the amazing tour."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4686
translate english c30s006_mar_70c8adb4:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta la penúltima parada del alucinante recorrido."
    "Jamaal escorts you to the second to last stop of the amazing tour."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4688
translate english c30s006_mar_ce9bbddd:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña de vuelta a la puerta de tu casa."
    "Jamaal escorts you back to your front door."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4689
translate english c30s006_mar_5f9a0d70:

    # "[mar] está esperando allí, en el mismo sitio donde os visteis por primera vez al volver a casa."
    "[mar] is waiting there, in the same spot where you first saw each other when you came back home."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4701
translate english c30s006_mar_339796c5:

    # mc "Hoy soy el tipo más afortunado del mundo. Varias veces, además."
    mc "Today I'm the luckiest guy in the world. Several times over, actually."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4702
translate english c30s006_mar_aed574b5:

    # mom "*Risa* Espero que te sientas así. Yo me siento la mujer más afortunada del mundo."
    mom "*Laugh* I hope you feel that way. I feel like the luckiest woman in the world."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4706
translate english c30s006_mar_a75d6fb0:

    # mc "Supongo que hoy no colaría si te dijera que soy el repartidor de Amazonian."
    mc "I guess today it wouldn't work if I told you I was the Amazonian delivery guy."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4707
translate english c30s006_mar_c0d0eda4:

    # mom "Supones bien. A menos que traigas una caja de dónuts."
    mom "You guess right. Unless you bring a box of donuts."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4708
translate english c30s006_mar_855cf7d1:

    # mc "Bueno, ya te di el mejor dónut del mundo. El que te convertía en mi esposa."
    mc "Well, I already gave you the best donut in the world. The one that made you my wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4711
translate english c30s006_mar_91d3c180:

    # mom "Lo cual me ha dejado un poco al margen con lo de hoy. Soy la única que no se puede declarar tu esposa. Ya lo soy."
    mom "Which has left me a bit on the sidelines today. I'm the only one who can't declare herself your wife. I already am."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4712
translate english c30s006_mar_b9a8c363:

    # mc "Pero aún y así quiero saber qué te has tatuado."
    mc "But even so, I want to know what you got tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4714
translate english c30s006_mar_86c0f13a:

    # mom "Lo cual ha hecho esto un poco innecesario. Pero las chicas han insistido y creo que es un gesto bonito antes de que te vayas."
    mom "Which made this a bit unnecessary. But the girls insisted and I think it's a nice gesture before you leave."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4715
translate english c30s006_mar_3401de95:

    # mc "No sé si te has dado cuenta, pero aún no sé de qué va esto."
    mc "I don't know if you've noticed, but I still don't know what this is all about."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4717
translate english c30s006_mar_30e17019:

    # mom "Con este dónut me declaro tu esposa. *Risa* Sé que ya lo soy, pero quería decir esa frase."
    mom "With this donut I declare myself your wife. *Laugh* I know I already am, but I wanted to say that line."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4718
translate english c30s006_mar_1923cf45:

    # mom "Tú me regalaste el mejor dónut del mundo, y quiero llevarlo siempre conmigo."
    mom "You gave me the best donut in the world, and I want to carry it with me always."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4719
translate english c30s006_mar_da4b9586:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡Te has tatuado el dónut!"
    mc "*Laugh* You got the donut tattooed!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4722
translate english c30s006_mar_d2e6d6d2:

    # mom "Sé que nunca permitirán que una madre se case con su hijo."
    mom "I know they'll never allow a mother to marry her son."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4724
translate english c30s006_mar_7a4150c1:

    # mom "Además, no me gustaría que el resto del harén sienta que me has elegido a mí por encima de ellas."
    mom "Besides, I wouldn't want the rest of the harem to feel like you've chosen me over them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4726
translate english c30s006_mar_8c2c4991:

    # mom "Nunca podremos casarnos porque no quiero que el resto del harén sienta que me has elegido a mí por encima de ellas."
    mom "We'll never be able to get married because I don't want the rest of the harem to feel like you've chosen me over them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4728
translate english c30s006_mar_de2491b4:

    # mom "No vamos a poder casarnos antes de que te vayas a Aruba y quería mi anillo."
    mom "We won't be able to get married before you leave for Aruba, and I wanted my ring."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4730
translate english c30s006_mar_be4095d9:

    # mom "Y, aunque pudiéramos, no podríamos hacerlo antes de que te vayas a Aruba."
    mom "And, even if we could, we wouldn't be able to do it before you leave for Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4732
translate english c30s006_mar_a3f44eb5:

    # mom "Pero como dijiste en la cocina, no necesitamos el permiso de nadie ni un anillo de boda para sentirnos marido y mujer."
    mom "But like you said in the kitchen, we don't need anyone's permission or a wedding ring to feel like husband and wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4733
translate english c30s006_mar_fc48d175:

    # mom "Creo que este es el anillo más dulce que se puede tener."
    mom "I think this is the sweetest ring I could have."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4735
translate english c30s006_mar_08c2a4be:

    # "Si hay algo más dulce que el anillo, son los labios de tu esposa."
    "If there's anything sweeter than the ring, it's your wife's lips."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4736
translate english c30s006_mar_026b074c:

    # "Y sus abrazos, y su sonrisa, y su mirada..."
    "And her hugs, and her smile, and her gaze..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4737
translate english c30s006_mar_cc8ee238:

    # "Ciertamente eres el tipo más afortunado de la historia."
    "You're certainly the luckiest guy in history."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4739
translate english c30s006_mar_f712afae:

    # mom "Te quiero."
    mom "I love you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4740
translate english c30s006_mar_6616e794:

    # mc "Yo también te quiero."
    mc "I love you too."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4742
translate english c30s006_mar_1eed4823:

    # "No necesitáis decir nada más, al menos por un rato."
    "You don't need to say anything else, at least for a while."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4743
translate english c30s006_mar_4bc295be:

    # "Sabéis que habéis recorrido un largo camino desde aquel día en que se tiró a tus brazos, el día que llegaste, y acabasteis los dos en el suelo."
    "You know you've come a long way since that day she threw herself into your arms, the day you arrived, and you both ended up on the floor."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4744
translate english c30s006_mar_90e6912f:

    # "La sigues teniendo entre tus brazos, de una forma diferente que no podíais imaginar entonces, y no piensas soltarla nunca. Al menos figuradamente."
    "You still hold her in your arms, in a different way than you could have imagined back then, and you don't plan on ever letting her go. At least figuratively."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4757
translate english c30s006_mar_caede29e:

    # mom "Deberías ir a ver a [ama] ahora. Estaba muy nerviosa por lo de hoy."
    mom "You should go see [ama] now. She was really nervous about today."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4758
translate english c30s006_mar_0caaaba9:

    # mc "Me gustaría quedarme un rato más contigo, pero también tengo ganas de verla a ella."
    mc "I'd like to stay a while longer with you, but I'm also looking forward to seeing her."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4759
translate english c30s006_mar_6c48c3f5:

    # mom "Nosotros tuvimos nuestro momento cuando me diste el dónut. No necesito más."
    mom "We had our moment when you gave me the donut. I don't need anything more."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4761
translate english c30s006_mar_dfd3b937:

    # mom "Sé que no es necesario que te lo diga, pero cuida de mi niña cuando estéis en Aruba, por favor."
    mom "I know I don't need to tell you, but please take care of my little girl when you're in Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4762
translate english c30s006_mar_7d340a69:

    # mc "No te preocupes. Creo que cuidará más ella de mí que yo de ella..."
    mc "Don't worry. I think she'll be taking care of me more than I'll be taking care of her..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4764
translate english c30s006_mar_3fcaa9a3:

    # mom "Deberíamos ir hacia la fiesta de bienvenida o se van a impacientar."
    mom "We should head to the welcome party or they'll get impatient."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4765
translate english c30s006_mar_d4d2ed92:

    # mc "Me gustaría quedarme un rato más contigo, pero creo que hemos retrasado la fiesta demasiado."
    mc "I'd like to stay a while longer with you, but I think we've delayed the party long enough."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4766
translate english c30s006_mar_6c48c3f5_1:

    # mom "Nosotros tuvimos nuestro momento cuando me diste el dónut. No necesito más."
    mom "We had our moment when you gave me the donut. I don't need anything else."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4767
translate english c30s006_mar_00314096:

    # mom "Tendremos tiempo para estar juntos antes de que te vayas. Pero tengo que subir a la cocina a coger unas cosas antes de unirme."
    mom "We'll have time to be together before you leave. But I have to go up to the kitchen to grab a few things before joining."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4768
translate english c30s006_mar_8cbe776b:

    # mc "Eso espero..."
    mc "I hope so..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4770
translate english c30s006_mar_f4f0086b:

    # "Os dais un largo beso antes de separaros."
    "You share a long kiss before pulling away."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4771
translate english c30s006_mar_e94c7e2e:

    # "Se os hace corto."
    "It feels too short."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4775
translate english c30s006_ama_0f54145e:

    # "Jamaal te acompaña hasta la puerta de la cocina de [nor]. [ama] te está esperando un poco más allá."
    "Jamaal accompanies you to [nor]'s kitchen door. [ama] is waiting for you a little further away."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4776
translate english c30s006_ama_9fb8fd91:

    # "Parece que se aleje conscientemente del lugar donde rompió a llorar durante su presentación a la familia."
    "She seems to consciously distance herself from the place where she burst into tears during her introduction to the family."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4788
translate english c30s006_ama_4004e0ab:

    # mc "Estás guapísima, [ama]."
    mc "You look gorgeous, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4789
translate english c30s006_ama_b14acb05:

    # ama "Gracias. ¿Podemos pasear?"
    ama "Thanks. Can we take a walk?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4792
translate english c30s006_ama_28f45aed:

    # ama "¿Te apetece que demos un paseo?"
    ama "Do you feel like going for a walk?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4793
translate english c30s006_ama_890c041b:

    # mc "Por supuesto."
    mc "Of course."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4795
translate english c30s006_ama_06e82d27:

    # "Empezáis a caminar mientras [ama] parece pensativa."
    "You start walking while [ama] seems thoughtful."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4797
translate english c30s006_ama_fef2b536:

    # "La coges de la mano, de una forma suave, diciéndole que estás ahí para lo que quiera."
    "You take her hand gently, telling her that you're there for whatever she needs."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4798
translate english c30s006_ama_321ec4e6:

    # ama "Gracias..."
    ama "Thank you..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4799
translate english c30s006_ama_f46bfa3f:

    # mc "¿Pasa algo [ama]?"
    mc "Is something wrong, [ama]?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4801
translate english c30s006_ama_8e44990b:

    # ama "Vas a pensar que soy tonta."
    ama "You're going to think I'm stupid."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4802
translate english c30s006_ama_d697263c:

    # mc "El día que lo piense, pégame un tiro..."
    mc "The day I think that, shoot me..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4803
translate english c30s006_ama_36cb97d2:

    # mc "*Risa* No me hagas caso. Tú serías capaz de hacerlo. Era sarcasmo."
    mc "*Laugh* Don't listen to me. You could actually do it. It was sarcasm."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4804
translate english c30s006_ama_cecd1ab5:

    # mc "A lo que me refiero es que no creo que haya llegado el día en que pueda pensar que eres tonta."
    mc "What I mean is, I don't think the day will ever come when I'd think you're stupid."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4807
translate english c30s006_ama_be136b0c:

    # ama "Sabes lo de los tatuajes... Lo de declararnos tus esposas y todo eso..."
    ama "You know about the tattoos... The thing about declaring ourselves your wives and all that..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4809
translate english c30s006_ama_bd319e56:

    # ama "Las chicas me convencieron para que me hiciera un tatuaje para decirte que me consideraba tu esposa."
    ama "The girls convinced me to get a tattoo to tell you that I considered myself your wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4810
translate english c30s006_ama_debba696:

    # mc "Es muy original, pero ¿dónde está el problema?"
    mc "That's very original, but where's the problem?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4812
translate english c30s006_ama_c1d5c049:

    # ama "En que no lo quiero hacer."
    ama "That I don't want to do it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4813
translate english c30s006_ama_071a60c8:

    # mc "No tienes por qué hacerlo. Decir que te sientes como si estuviéramos casados a estas alturas puede sonar un poco raro."
    mc "You don't have to do it. Saying that you feel like we're married at this point might sound a bit weird."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4815
translate english c30s006_ama_1a542168:

    # ama "¿Porque no he querido tener sexo contigo?"
    ama "Because I haven't wanted to have sex with you?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4816
translate english c30s006_ama_4b1e5e9b:

    # mc "No, no tiene nada que ver con el sexo."
    mc "No, it has nothing to do with sex."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4818
translate english c30s006_ama_2a94d0aa:

    # mc "Tampoco he tenido sexo con [kat], y con ella no ha sonado raro."
    mc "I haven't had sex with [kat] either, and it didn't sound weird with her."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4820
translate english c30s006_ama_f490ceb2:

    # ama "Es que no me refiero a que me sienta como si estuviéramos casados. No sé lo que es estar casado más allá de las películas."
    ama "It's just that I don't mean I feel like we're married. I don't know what being married is like outside of movies."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4821
translate english c30s006_ama_ee4cde3f:

    # ama "No he crecido en una familia... normal."
    ama "I didn't grow up in a... normal family."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4822
translate english c30s006_ama_50d8828a:

    # mc "Lo sé."
    mc "I know. Me neither"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4824
translate english c30s006_ama_608c9c52:

    # ama "Sé que quiero pasar cada momento libre contigo. Sé que me levanto y me acuesto pensando en ti."
    ama "I know I want to spend every free moment with you. I know I wake up and go to sleep thinking about you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4825
translate english c30s006_ama_4d1ce10e:

    # ama "Pensando en que tenemos un mes por delante en Aruba para nosotros solos. Cuando el trabajo nos deje tiempo libre."
    ama "Thinking about how we have a month ahead of us in Aruba all to ourselves, whenever work leaves us some free time."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4826
translate english c30s006_ama_1f9d4d3f:

    # mc "Eso se parece bastante a un matrimonio. Al menos a unos recién casados. Y el viaje a Aruba parece una luna de miel. Mientras trabajamos."
    mc "That sounds a lot like a marriage. At least like newlyweds. And the trip to Aruba feels like a honeymoon. While we work."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4828
translate english c30s006_ama_1cee7dec:

    # ama "Pero, por mucho que he pensado, no se me ha ocurrido un tatuaje que representara lo que siento."
    ama "But, as much as I've thought about it, I couldn't come up with a tattoo that represented what I feel."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4829
translate english c30s006_ama_ae91dc61:

    # ama "Sólo se me ocurría un anillo... Pero me parecía... No sé... No me parecía correcto."
    ama "I could only think of a ring... But it seemed... I don't know... It didn't seem right."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4831
translate english c30s006_ama_ec12d9e1:

    # ama "Y no quiero decir que no haya sido correcto si alguna chica se ha tatuado un anillo. Pero no lo era para mí."
    ama "And I don't mean it wasn't right if any of the girls got a ring tattooed. But it wasn't for me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4832
translate english c30s006_ama_724b12c1:

    # ama "No he querido que nadie me enseñara su tatuaje para que no me pidiera ver el mío."
    ama "I didn't want anyone to show me their tattoos, so they wouldn't ask to see mine."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4833
translate english c30s006_ama_5b3b74c7:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. Un anillo tiene que significar algo. Si no significa nada, sólo es un trozo de metal. O un círculo tatuado."
    mc "I understand. A ring has to mean something. If it means nothing, it's just a piece of metal. Or a tattooed circle."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4835
translate english c30s006_ama_6270bd2b:

    # ama "A eso me refiero. Un anillo no significaría nada entre nosotros. Tenemos que crear recuerdos para encontrar algo que sea significativo."
    ama "That's what I mean. A ring wouldn't mean anything between us. We have to create memories to find something meaningful."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4836
translate english c30s006_ama_7cf98f04:

    # mc "Yo tengo muchos recuerdos contigo, [ama]."
    mc "I have many memories with you, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4838
translate english c30s006_ama_1eb74335:

    # ama "Lo sé. Podría enumerar cien, pero ninguno sería 100%% nuestro."
    ama "I know. I could list a hundred, but none would be 100%% ours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4839
translate english c30s006_ama_3cdca8b9:

    # ama "Ahí detrás, cuando me puse a llorar como una tonta, abrumada por las emociones, tú viniste a salvarme. Pero lloré por ellas, por todos vosotros."
    ama "Back there, when I started crying like an idiot, overwhelmed by emotions, you came to save me. But I cried for them, for all of you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4840
translate english c30s006_ama_e8deb19b:

    # ama "En la puerta del garaje, cuando me diste el primer abrazo el día que vinimos con Aaron."
    ama "At the garage door, when you gave me the first hug on the day we came with Aaron."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4841
translate english c30s006_ama_810ed92d:

    # ama "En el café, cuando me besaste por primera vez mientras hablábamos de la empresa, mientras mirábamos datos en el portátil."
    ama "At the cafe, when you kissed me for the first time while we were talking about the company, while we were looking at data on the laptop."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4842
translate english c30s006_ama_57a2eb6e:

    # ama "En tu cama, el día que se rompió..."
    ama "In your bed, the day it broke..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4843
translate english c30s006_ama_6e89f1f3:

    # mc "El día que Zeus la rompió."
    mc "The day Zeus broke it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4845
translate english c30s006_ama_8402cfb3:

    # ama "*Risa* El día que siete mujeres en tu cama la rompimos."
    ama "*Laugh* The day seven women in your bed broke it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4846
translate english c30s006_ama_51edc81a:

    # "La primera vez que [ama] se ríe desde que os habéis visto suena mejor que cualquier sinfonía de la historia. ¡Chúpate esa, Beethoven!"
    "The first time [ama] laughs since you saw each other sounds better than any symphony in history. Take that, Beethoven!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4847
translate english c30s006_ama_f2c1b74b:

    # mc "*Risa* Siete mujeres y un gato."
    mc "*Laugh* Seven women and a cat."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4848
translate english c30s006_ama_b13bd0d5:

    # ama "*Risa* OK. El día que siete mujeres y un gato rompimos tu cama."
    ama "*Laugh* OK. The day seven women and a cat broke your bed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4849
translate english c30s006_ama_6bc466c0:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso me parece mejor."
    mc "*Laugh* That sounds better."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4850
translate english c30s006_ama_3eea9abd:

    # mc "Veo lo que quieres decir. En nuestros recuerdos siempre está la familia."
    mc "I see what you mean. Family is always in our memories."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4852
translate english c30s006_ama_fb11be84:

    # ama "Y por eso no me he tatuado nada. No me voy a tatuar a Zeus ni a Aaron. No me voy a tatuar a las otras seis mujeres que rompimos tu cama o un portátil."
    ama "And that's why I haven't tattooed anything. I'm not going to tattoo Zeus or Aaron. I'm not going to tattoo the other six women who broke your bed or a laptop."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4853
translate english c30s006_ama_020a162f:

    # ama "Quizás pueda hacerlo el día que tengamos un recuerdo solo nuestro. Pero no hoy."
    ama "Maybe I can do it the day we have a memory that's just ours. But not today."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4854
translate english c30s006_ama_432f6659:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. Y no hace falta que digas que te sientes..."
    mc "I get it. And you don't have to say that you feel..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4856
translate english c30s006_ama_78978161:

    # "Sin dejarte acabar la frase, la preciosa mercenaria te da un tierno beso."
    "Without letting you finish your sentence, the gorgeous mercenary gives you a tender kiss."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4857
translate english c30s006_ama_4a9df10a:

    # "Es solo el roce de sus labios sobre los tuyos, pero comunica más de lo que ningún tatuaje podría hacer en su caso."
    "It's just the brush of her lips against yours, but it communicates more than any tattoo could in her case."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4858
translate english c30s006_ama_be61e307:

    # "El beso dura unos breves segundos. Se hace corto. Pero ninguno necesitáis más por el momento."
    "The kiss lasts for a few brief seconds. It feels short. But neither of you needs more, for now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4860
translate english c30s006_ama_24f2e98c:

    # ama "Con este beso me declaro tu esposa, [mc]."
    ama "With this kiss, I declare myself your wife, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4861
translate english c30s006_ama_f49265ad:

    # ama "Algún día me haré un tatuaje para poder mostrarlo."
    ama "Someday I'll get a tattoo so I can show it off."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4862
translate english c30s006_ama_1e32ad05:

    # mc "¿Ese beso no te parece suficiente forma de mostrarlo?"
    mc "Don't you think that kiss is enough of a way to show it?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4863
translate english c30s006_ama_7e326d95:

    # mc "Se puede mostrar amor de muchas formas diferentes. No es necesario un tatuaje, ni un anillo, ni firmar un papel."
    mc "You can show love in many different ways. You don't need a tattoo, a ring, or to sign a piece of paper."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4864
translate english c30s006_ama_605b9ddd:

    # mc "Desde este momento me considero tu esposo, [ama]."
    mc "From this moment on, I consider myself your husband, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4866
translate english c30s006_ama_35796efc:

    # "Os volvéis a besar. Como marido y mujer esta vez. La primera vez de muchas. Y cada vez os besaréis como si fuera la última."
    "You kiss each other again. As husband and wife this time. The first of many times. And every time you kiss, it will be as if it were your last."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4867
translate english c30s006_ama_7f2decbe:

    # "Y un minuto, una hora, o un día después, os alegraréis de que aquella no fuera la última vez cuando os volváis a besar."
    "And a minute, an hour, or a day later, you'll be glad that wasn't the last time, when you kiss each other again."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4868
translate english c30s006_ama_a5852d0d:

    # "Os esperan muchos besos en Aruba. Os esperan muchos besos el resto de vuestras vidas."
    "Many kisses await you in Aruba. Many kisses await you for the rest of your lives."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4870
translate english c30s006_ama_b8b77b34:

    # ama "*Risita* A veces odio a esta familia."
    ama "*Giggles* Sometimes I hate this family."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4871
translate english c30s006_ama_d15d8518:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Qué ha pasado?"
    mc "*Laugh* What happened?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4873
translate english c30s006_ama_8bdb24a3:

    # ama "A una de nosotras se le ocurre una idea y parece que todas estamos obligadas a seguirla..."
    ama "One of us comes up with an idea and it seems like we're all forced to follow it..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4874
translate english c30s006_ama_eb0c5a0a:

    # mc "Acabas de demostrar con la falta de tatuajes que no es necesario seguir una idea que no te guste o con la que no estés de acuerdo."
    mc "You just proved with your lack of a tattoo that it's not necessary to follow an idea you don't like or one you don't agree with."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4876
translate english c30s006_ama_b51dec54:

    # ama "A veces es complicado no seguir al grupo..."
    ama "Sometimes it's hard not to follow the group..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4877
translate english c30s006_ama_be6646a3:

    # mc "¿Te acuerdas de cuando [eva] se disfrazó de [dap] para intentar engañarme?"
    mc "Do you remember when [eva] dressed up as [dap] to try to trick me?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4879
translate english c30s006_ama_f181a472:

    # ama "Sí..."
    ama "Yeah..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4880
translate english c30s006_ama_0edb3509:

    # mc "¿Por qué lo hizo?"
    mc "Why did she do it?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4881
translate english c30s006_ama_d0acb51d:

    # ama "Para reafirmar su individualidad."
    ama "To reaffirm her individuality."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4882
translate english c30s006_ama_e9ab1f36:

    # mc "También se puede reafirmar la individualidad rechazando seguir a la manada, [ama]."
    mc "You can also assert your individuality by refusing to follow the pack, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4883
translate english c30s006_ama_3bb9938b:

    # mc "Cada una de las mujeres de esta familia sois individuos y debéis tomar vuestras decisiones."
    mc "Every woman in this family is an individual, and you must make your own decisions."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4884
translate english c30s006_ama_25736490:

    # mc "A veces, una de esas decisiones puede ser ir en una dirección diferente a la manada."
    mc "Sometimes, one of those decisions might be going in a different direction than the pack."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4886
translate english c30s006_ama_46556671:

    # ama "*Risa* Dices 'manada' como si fuéramos unas lobas. La mayoría de gente diría rebaño en ese contexto."
    ama "*Laugh* You say 'pack' like we're wolves. Most people would say 'herd' in that context."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4887
translate english c30s006_ama_b6a112d2:

    # mc "*Risa* Sois mis lobas, [ama]. Aún me extraña que no haya habido ninguna lucha para saber quién es la alfa."
    mc "*Laugh* You're my wolves, [ama]. I'm still surprised there hasn't been a fight to figure out who the alpha is."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4888
translate english c30s006_ama_8ab3a581:

    # ama "*Risa* No hacen falta luchas. Las alfas son [mar] y [nor]. Todas lo sabemos."
    ama "*Laugh* There's no need for fights. The alphas are [mar] and [nor]. We all know that."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4892
translate english c30s006_ama_1222f796:

    # mc "Por cierto, no hubiera tenido ninguna queja si te hubieras hecho el tatuaje, pero... ¿qué hubiera pasado si no me hubiera gustado la idea?"
    mc "By the way, I wouldn't have complained if you had gotten the tattoo, but... what would have happened if I didn't like the idea?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4893
translate english c30s006_ama_d72cd586:

    # ama "Como tú has dicho varias veces, hay que aceptar a todo el mundo como es."
    ama "Like you've said several times, we have to accept everyone as they are."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4894
translate english c30s006_ama_0940079b:

    # ama "Si hubiera encontrado algo que nos representara, te hubiera tocado aceptarme con un tatuaje."
    ama "If I had found something that represented us, you would've had to accept me with a tattoo."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4895
translate english c30s006_ama_133c7a17:

    # mc "*Risa* Me parece justo."
    mc "*Laugh* Fair enough."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4901
translate english c30s006_ama_852d27ae:

    # mc "Pero no acabo de entender por qué un tatuaje."
    mc "But I still don't quite understand why a tattoo."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4902
translate english c30s006_ama_3393e29f:

    # ama "Las chicas dijeron que no lo podríamos perder y que sería para siempre."
    ama "The girls said we couldn't lose it and that it would be forever."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4904
translate english c30s006_ama_ef0134df:

    # ama "Además, nunca nos podríamos poner de acuerdo en qué modelo de anillo queremos. Lo que significa que deberías llevar un anillo diferente por cada chica."
    ama "Besides, we could never agree on what kind of ring we want. Which means you'd have to wear a different ring for each girl."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4905
translate english c30s006_ama_7081a0bc:

    # ama "Si sigues añadiendo chicas al harén, acabarías arrastrando los brazos como un orangután, debido al peso de los anillos."
    ama "If you keep adding girls to the harem, you'd end up dragging your arms like an orangutan due to the weight of the rings."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4906
translate english c30s006_ama_556075c6:

    # ama "Y, además, cada una de nosotras podíamos personalizarlo para que significara algo único."
    ama "And, besides, each of us could personalize it so it meant something unique."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4908
translate english c30s006_ama_f4f76642:

    # ama "Un anillo podría servir para una boda... oficial. Un tatuaje nos hace únicos hasta cierto punto."
    ama "A ring could work for an... official wedding. A tattoo makes us unique to a certain degree."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4909
translate english c30s006_ama_d96ad109:

    # ama "Por eso no he podido hacerlo."
    ama "That's why I couldn't do it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4911
translate english c30s006_ama_30739816:

    # ama "Ahora deberíamos ir a la fiesta. Nos deben estar esperando."
    ama "We should go to the party now. They must be waiting for us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4912
translate english c30s006_ama_d36b91bf:

    # mc "Y todas querrán saber qué te has tatuado."
    mc "And they'll all want to know what you got tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4913
translate english c30s006_ama_25d430bc:

    # ama "Y, gracias a esta conversación, no me sentiré como una tonta diciéndoles que no me he tatuado nada."
    ama "And, thanks to this conversation, I won't feel like a fool telling them I didn't get anything tattooed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4914
translate english c30s006_ama_89305487:

    # mc "Esa es la actitud, cielo."
    mc "That's the spirit, babe."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4916
translate english c30s006_ama_dac4457c:

    # "Os volvéis a besar antes de dirigiros a la fiesta. Hace más de un minuto de vuestro último beso."
    "You kiss again before heading to the party. It's been over a minute since your last kiss."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4917
translate english c30s006_ama_95deaf2c:

    # "Alguna vez has intentado aguantar la respiración más de un minuto. Todos los niños lo han hecho alguna vez. La presión en los pulmones se hace dolorosa."
    "Have you ever tried holding your breath for more than a minute? Every kid has done it at some point. The pressure in your lungs becomes painful."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4918
translate english c30s006_ama_b7db1ced:

    # "La falta de contacto con los labios de [ama] parece más dolorosa que la falta de oxígeno."
    "The lack of contact with [ama]'s lips feels more painful than the lack of oxygen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4920
translate english c30s006_ama_ea7ae198:

    # "Desde que te ha besado por primera vez no ha soltado tus manos, como si fueran un ancla a un sueño del que no quiere despertar."
    "Since she kissed you for the first time, she hasn't let go of your hands, as if they were an anchor to a dream she doesn't want to wake up from."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4922
translate english c30s006_ama_54846200:

    # "Cuando vuestros labios se sacian de los labios del otro os dirigís a la fiesta."
    "When your lips are satiated with each other's, you head to the party."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4923
translate english c30s006_ama_83ff60e8:

    # "La saciedad durará un minuto. Por suerte, su mano sigue en la tuya."
    "The satiety will last a minute. Luckily, her hand is still in yours."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4924
translate english c30s006_ama_d1063a9c:

    # "Sigues siendo su ancla. Ella es la tuya."
    "You're still her anchor. She will be yours forever."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4927
translate english c30s007_convJamaal1_5457a963:

    # jam "Está demasiado cansada después de lo de hoy. Me ha dicho que le encantaría, pero que la boda ya ha sido demasiado rápida."
    jam "She's too tired after today. She told me she'd love to, but the wedding was already too fast."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4928
translate english c30s007_convJamaal1_525f528c:

    # jam "Tener sexo de recién casados estando cansados no es una buena idea y estoy de acuerdo."
    jam "Having newlywed sex while tired isn't a good idea, and I agree."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4931
translate english c30s007_convJamaal2_6e11341f:

    # jam "¿A quién vas a elegir para pasar la noche y a quién vas a ofender sin elegirla?"
    jam "Who are you going to choose to spend the night with, and who are you going to offend by not choosing her?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4932
translate english c30s007_convJamaal2_095ff3a6:

    # jam "No creo que sea una buena forma de empezar vuestros matrimonios."
    jam "I don't think that's a good way to start your marriages."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:4960
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e277251f:

    # "Al llegar a la cocina de [nor], te diriges a dar la bienvenida oficial a [mee] y a [bet]."
    "Arriving at [nor]'s kitchen, you head over to officially welcome [mee] and [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5068
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_6aed1108:

    # "Ya las has saludado individualmente durante vuestras bodas, pero no habéis hablado de su viaje."
    "You've already greeted them individually during your weddings, but you haven't talked about their trip."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5070
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d6a7ea64:

    # "Ya has saludado a [mee] durante vuestra boda, pero no habéis hablado de su viaje y es el momento de saludar también a [bet]."
    "You've already greeted [mee] during your wedding, but you haven't talked about their trip, and it's time to greet [bet] too."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5071
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_401be1cc:

    # mc "Bienvenida de vuelta a casa, Tía [bet]."
    mc "Welcome back home, Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5073
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_65c7f9a4:

    # "Ya has saludado a [bet] durante vuestra boda, pero no habéis hablado de su viaje y es el momento de saludar también a [mee]."
    "You've already greeted [bet] during your wedding, but you haven't talked about their trip, and it's time to greet [mee] too."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5074
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_4450e1da:

    # mc "Bienvenida de vuelta a casa, Meemaw."
    mc "Welcome back home, Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5076
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c7d2f9ac:

    # "No las has visto aún desde que Jamaal y tú habéis llegado a casa."
    "You haven't seen them yet since you and Jamaal got home."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5078
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_4b3be834:

    # "El buitre carroñero te ha mantenido ocupado."
    "The scavenging vulture has kept you busy."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5079
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a668da4c:

    # mc "Bienvenidas de vuelta a casa."
    mc "Welcome back home."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5080
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_954ec7ad:

    # mc "Me tenéis que explicar qué tal ha ido el viaje."
    mc "You have to tell me how the trip went."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5081
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d1cdf97a:

    # bet "Todo ha ido bien, pero os echaba de menos a vosotros y la pizza de Gino's. La pizza que pedíamos en Florida no era tan buena."
    bet "Everything went well, but I missed you guys and Gino's pizza. The pizza we ordered in Florida wasn't as good."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5082
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c08b7ba5:

    # mee "Aparte de que [bet] acabara con las existencias de pizza del estado, todo ha ido bien."
    mee "Aside from [bet] wiping out the state's pizza supply, everything went well."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5083
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_0d4d2923:

    # mee "La casa ya está en venta y nuestras cosas llegarán el viernes."
    mee "The house is already for sale, and our things will arrive on Friday."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5084
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_39fd1fac:

    # mc "Pero [bet] no estará aquí..."
    mc "But [bet] won't be here..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5086
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_926e5bd1:

    # bet "No te preocupes, no tenía gran cosa allí. Algunos hábitos y algo de ropa que... ya no es de mi estilo."
    bet "Don't worry, I didn't have much there. Some habits and some clothes that... aren't my style anymore."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5087
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_b39f23aa:

    # mee "Creo que [bet] ha descubierto su gusto por vestidos... demasiado cortos para su edad."
    mee "I think [bet] has discovered a taste for dresses... too short for her age."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5088
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d1daacfd:

    # mc "No creo que la longitud del vestido tenga nada que ver con la edad, Meemaw."
    mc "I don't think dress length has anything to do with age, Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5090
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e8a78308:

    # mc "Y, aunque se puede defender ella sola si cree que la estás atacando, creo que no debería permitirte que criticaras a mi esposa por cómo se viste."
    mc "And, even though she can defend herself if she thinks you're attacking her, I don't think I should let you criticize my wife for how she dresses."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5092
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_33b8c81d:

    # mc "Igual que no permitiría que nadie te criticara a ti por cómo vistes."
    mc "Just like I wouldn't let anyone criticize you for how you dress."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5093
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_30fd24f8:

    # mc "En los dos casos me encanta como vestís mis esposas. Cada una de vosotras está genial en vuestro estilo."
    mc "In both cases, I love how my wives dress. Each of you looks great in your own style."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5095
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_5703b20e:

    # mc "Además, me encanta el cambio de vestuario que ha hecho Tía [bet]."
    mc "Besides, I love the wardrobe change Aunt [bet] has made."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5097
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_28e6b835:

    # bet "No le hagas caso. Ha pasado unos días alejada de la familia y ya cree que nos puede mangonear a todas otra vez."
    bet "Don't listen to her. She's spent a few days away from the family and already thinks she can boss us all around again."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5098
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_cce1cf35:

    # mee "¡Eso no es cierto!"
    mee "That's not true!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5099
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a9658ebb:

    # mc "*Risa* Parece que sí que lo es. Que no te gusta cómo viste tu hermana pequeña ha sido casi lo primero que me has dicho."
    mc "*Laugh* It seems like it is. That you don't like how your little sister dresses was almost the first thing you told me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5100
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_5d0e14d3:

    # mc "*Risa* Mientras no empieces a meterte con el peso de [nor] o con cómo tiene organizada la casa..."
    mc "*Laugh* As long as you don't start picking on [nor]'s weight or how she has the house organized..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5102
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_b162dc73:

    # mee "¿Estoy volviendo a ser esa [mee] otra vez?"
    mee "Am I turning back into that [mee] again?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5103
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_7db1f93c:

    # mc "No lo creo, además no te van a permitir que vuelvas a ser esa versión de ti misma."
    mc "I don't think so, besides, they won't let you go back to being that version of yourself."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5104
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_63d71513:

    # mc "Y, si lo intentas, habrá 19 mujeres y un buitre negro para ponerte en tu sitio cuando yo no esté."
    mc "And if you try, there will be 19 women and a black vulture to put you in your place when I'm not around."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5106
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_86e2998e:

    # bet "No critiques al buitre negro... ¡Mierda! *Risa* A Jamaal. Al final conseguirás que todas lo llamemos buitre."
    bet "Don't criticize the black vulture... Shit! *Laugh* Jamaal. You're going to end up making us all call him a vulture."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5108
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_b5574014:

    # bet "Ha hecho un buen trabajo como maestro de ceremonias."
    bet "He's done a good job as master of ceremonies."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5110
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_1e925ecd:

    # bet "La idea de esta fiesta fue parcialmente suya, por lo que me han dicho."
    bet "The idea for this party was partially his, from what I've been told."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5111
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_13c59e3e:

    # mc "*Risa* Cuando empiece a robar comida entenderás por qué lo llamo buitre."
    mc "*Laugh* When he starts stealing food, you'll understand why I call him a vulture."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5113
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_99836b3f:

    # eri "Os voy a robar a [mc]."
    eri "I'm going to steal [mc] from you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5115
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ba5d4e58:

    # mee "¡Acaba de llegar, jovencita!"
    mee "He just got here, young lady!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5116
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_433931a9:

    # bet "Creo que sé por qué se lo va a llevar."
    bet "I think I know why she's taking him away."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5118
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_b7325a3c:

    # eri "[meg] y [sam.nick] se van a tener que ir en breve y no se van a quedar a cenar. Las dos trabajan esta noche."
    eri "[meg] and [sam.nick] are going to have to leave shortly and won't be staying for dinner. They both work tonight."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5119
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d133b005:

    # eri "Ninguna de las dos quiere irse sin despedirse de [mc] por si no lo ven antes de que vuele a Aruba."
    eri "Neither of them wants to leave without saying goodbye to [mc], in case they don't see him before he flies to Aruba."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5120
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_39e0c13a:

    # mc "¿Y te han mandado a ti a buscarme?"
    mc "And they sent you to look for me?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5122
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a8385687:

    # eri "*Risa* No, me he prestado voluntaria. A [sam.nick] le da miedo la abuela y no se atrevía. Y [meg] está demasiado ocupada metiéndose con Jamaal."
    eri "*Laugh* No, I volunteered. [sam.nick] is scared of grandma and didn't dare. And [meg] is too busy messing with Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5124
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_bfdc3034:

    # mee "*Risa* ¿Le doy miedo a [sam.nick]? ¡Tendré que pasar más tiempo con ella para que cambie de opinión!"
    mee "*Laugh* [sam.nick] is scared of me? I'll have to spend more time with her, so she changes her mind!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5125
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_5c5029b5:

    # bet "*Risa* Eso ha sonado a amenaza."
    bet "*Laugh* That sounded like a threat."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5126
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_4134130e:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que acabo de oír el coche de [sam.nick] chirriando ruedas mientras se va a toda velocidad."
    mc "*Laugh* I think I just heard [sam.nick]'s car tires screeching as she speeds away."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5127
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d375b217:

    # mc "Bueno, señoras, os veo más tarde."
    mc "Well, ladies, I'll see you later."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5129
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_cd7dc533:

    # mee "Hasta luego, [mc]."
    mee "See you later, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5130
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_974b1516:

    # bet "Pásalo bien, [mc]."
    bet "Have fun, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5133
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c86b66eb:

    # mc "¿De verdad [sam.nick] tiene miedo de Meemaw?"
    mc "Is [sam.nick] really afraid of Meemaw?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5134
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a80c5c95:

    # eri "Más que miedo, le infunde un tremendo desasosiego. Piensa que no han coincidido demasiado desde aquel día en la playa. Dos o tres veces."
    eri "More than fear, she fills her with a tremendous sense of unease. Think about it, they haven't crossed paths much since that day at the beach. Two or three times."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5135
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d18048c1:

    # eri "[sam.nick] no ha experimentado de primera mano lo mucho que ha cambiado la abuela."
    eri "[sam.nick] hasn't experienced firsthand how much grandma has changed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5136
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_354ce315:

    # mc "Tienes razón. Supongo que, a partir de ahora, será diferente, con todo el mundo definitivamente en Newport."
    mc "You're right. I guess, from now on, it'll be different, with everyone permanently in Newport."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5138
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a2e720a1:

    # eri "Bueno... No todo el mundo..."
    eri "Well... Not everyone..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5139
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_bcd43393:

    # mc "Vale, sí. [ama], Tía [bet] y yo nos vamos un tiempo... y después [eva], pero ya habrá vuelto Tía [bet] seguramente..."
    mc "Okay, yeah. [ama], Aunt [bet] and I are leaving for a while... and then [eva], but Aunt [bet] will probably be back by then..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5140
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_64f74732:

    # mc "A lo que me refiero es a que casi todas vosotras vais a estar aquí y vais a tener más tiempo para conoceros."
    mc "What I mean is that almost all of you are going to be here and you'll have more time to get to know each other."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5141
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_61be76ff:

    # mc "Además, os vais a tener que ayudar entre vosotras cuando yo no esté."
    mc "Besides, you're going to have to help each other out when I'm not around."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5143
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_136b39dc:

    # eri "Lo sé. Pero va a ser difícil no tenerte aquí. Ni a [ama], [eva], o Tía [bet]."
    eri "I know. But it's going to be hard not having you here. Or [ama], [eva], or Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5144
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_691d4aba:

    # mc "También va a ser difícil para nosotros. Pero yo me voy tranquilo. Sé que tú vas a ayudar a mantener la paz en casa y a que todo el mundo se comporte."
    mc "It's going to be hard for us too. But I'm leaving with peace of mind. I know you're going to help keep the peace at home and make sure everyone behaves."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5146
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f9e76efa:

    # eri "¡Estás poniendo mucha responsabilidad sobre mis hombros!"
    eri "You're putting a lot of responsibility on my shoulders!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5147
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_6c0b15be:

    # mc "*Risa* Y aún no te he dicho que vas a ser una de las principales encargadas de que las chicas nuevas se integren bien."
    mc "*Laugh* And I haven't even told you yet that you're going to be one of the main people in charge of making sure the new girls fit in good."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5149
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_4dcb331e:

    # eri "*Risa* No creo que haya demasiados problemas. Están hablando mucho en el grupo de WhatsUp que propusiste hacer con ellas."
    eri "*Laugh* I don't think there will be too many problems. They're talking a lot in the WhatsUp group you suggested making with them."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5150
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_6e25c3d3:

    # mc "¿Cómo lo sabes?"
    mc "How do you know?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5152
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_8241e206:

    # eri "¿Te acuerdas de lo que dije sobre que escribiría a [zoe] sobre su maquillaje? Hemos hablado mucho, y me ha metido en el grupo."
    eri "Remember what I said about texting [zoe] about her makeup? We've talked a lot, and she added me to the new girls' group."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5153
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a8923324:

    # eri "Ahora hablo con todas. Son buenas chicas y, como te he dicho, no creo que haya muchos problemas."
    eri "Now I talk to all of them. They're good girls and, like I told you, I don't think there will be many problems."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5154
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c49a1173:

    # mc "Ahora entiendes por qué te estoy dando la responsabilidad de mantener todo en su sitio, ¿verdad?"
    mc "Now you understand why I'm giving you the responsibility of keeping everything in line, right?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5156
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a67ca71f:

    # eri "Lo entiendo. Intentaré hacer un buen trabajo."
    eri "I get it. I'll try to do a good job."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5157
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_90d6dd84:

    # eri "Y mi trabajo empieza por mandarte con [sam.nick]. Ahí está."
    eri "And my job starts by sending you over to [sam.nick]. There she is."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5158
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_6e7876ba:

    # mc "Te veo luego, [eri]."
    mc "See you later, [eri]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5159
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_cd8a47d8:

    # eri "Resérvame un baile."
    eri "Save me a dance."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5162
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_5fcba458:

    # mc "[eri] me ha dicho que te vas. ¿Tan pronto?"
    mc "[eri] told me you're leaving. So soon?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5163
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_dd05c28a:

    # sam "Tengo que ir al hospital. Mi turno empieza en poco más de una hora."
    sam "I have to go to the hospital. My shift starts in a little over an hour."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5164
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_8ee6a62f:

    # sam "Pero no quería irme sin tener un baile contigo."
    sam "But I didn't want to leave without having a dance with you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5165
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e2096b7f:

    # sam "Creo que esta fiesta es tanto una bienvenida para [mee] y [bet] como una despedida para [ama], [bet], y tú."
    sam "I think this party is as much a welcome for [mee] and [bet] as it is a farewell for [ama], [bet], and you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5168
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_749258cf:

    # mc "Y una celebración de nuestra boda..."
    mc "And a celebration of our wedding..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5170
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_3c4bad71:

    # mc "Y una celebración de mi boda..."
    mc "And a celebration of my wedding..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5172
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_85e4e7b2:

    # mc "Y una celebración de mis bodas..."
    mc "And a celebration of my weddings..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5174
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_47e5486a:

    # mc "Eso parece, aunque aún nos quedan un par de días para irnos."
    mc "It seems so, although we still have a couple of days before we leave."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5176
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d2dd59f7:

    # mc "Aunque a nosotros aún nos quedan un par de días para irnos."
    mc "Although we still have a couple of days before we leave."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5178
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_3db90a22:

    # sam "Un par de días pasan demasiado rápido. No sé si todas os vamos a poder ver antes de que os vayáis."
    sam "A couple of days go by too fast. I don't know if we'll all be able to see you before you leave."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5180
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a2a9304e:

    # mc "¿Eso quiere decir que no vamos a tener noche de bodas?"
    mc "Does that mean we're not going to have a wedding night?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5182
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_58cabbd8:

    # sam "*Risa* Tengo que mirar mi agenda. Es broma. No te preocupes, estoy segura de que buscaremos un momento antes de que te vayas."
    sam "*Laugh* I have to check my schedule. Just kidding. Don't worry, I'm sure we'll find some time before you leave."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5183
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_904096b3:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso espero. Tengo muchas ganas de pasar tiempo a solas con mi esposa."
    mc "*Laugh* I hope so. I'm really looking forward to spending some time alone with my wife."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5184
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_067fb2e9:

    # mc "*Risa* Aunque me tenga que romper un brazo e ir al hospital a recibir un tratamiento especial."
    mc "*Laugh* Even if I have to break an arm and go to the hospital to get some special treatment."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5186
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_bfe6fdb0:

    # mc "Estoy seguro de que nos volveremos a ver antes de que nos vayamos. Aunque me tenga que romper un brazo para ir al hospital."
    mc "I'm sure we'll see each other again before we leave. Even if I have to break an arm to go to the hospital."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5188
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d142840e:

    # sam "*Risa* Mejor que no te rompas ningún brazo. Y ahora, vamos a bailar. Me encanta esta canción."
    sam "*Laugh* You better not break any arms. And now, let's dance. I love this song."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5190
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_11037303:

    # "Bailas con [sam] y con [meg] antes de que se vayan."
    "You dance with [sam] and [meg] before they leave."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5191
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a9f563c9:

    # "Después pasas de una chica a otra sin tener un momento de pausa."
    "Afterwards, you go from one girl to another without a moment's pause."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5192
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_d01aed74:

    # "Todas quieren tener un último baile contigo y no dejan que bailes más de una canción seguida con otra chica."
    "They all want to have one last dance with you and won't let you dance more than one song in a row with another girl."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5194
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_67c6fff0:

    # "Las conversaciones mientras bailáis tratan sobre las bodas y sobre lo mucho que os vais a echar de menos."
    "The conversations while you dance are about the weddings and how much you're going to miss each other."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5196
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_2a84d81d:

    # "Las conversaciones mientras bailáis tratan sobre la boda y sobre lo mucho que os vais a echar de menos."
    "The conversations while you dance are about the wedding and how much you're going to miss each other."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5198
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c16a5227:

    # "Las conversaciones mientras bailáis tratan sobre lo mucho que os vais a echar de menos."
    "The conversations while you dance are about how much you're going to miss each other."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5199
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_1bc30544:

    # "Es un contraste de felicidad y tristeza entremezclado."
    "It's a mixed contrast of happiness and sadness."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5200
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_0d4ad389:

    # "Es una fiesta de bienvenida y de despedida."
    "It's a welcome and farewell party."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5206
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_46c763de:

    # "Para cuando te dejan descansar, estás hambriento. Te diriges a donde está Jamaal. Seguro que hay comida cerca. Si no se la ha acabado..."
    "By the time they let you rest, you're starving. You head over to where Jamaal is. There's bound to be food nearby. If he hasn't gobbled it all..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5207
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e4fc14c4:

    # mc "¿Queda algo para comer? ¿O te lo has comido todo?"
    mc "Is there anything left to eat? Or did you eat it all?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5208
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c829c01a:

    # jam "Creo que no voy a contestar a esa acusación infundada."
    jam "I don't think I'm going to answer that baseless accusation."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5209
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_228cf3de:

    # jam "Pero no queda nada, a menos que quieras comer helado del que hizo [mee] o algo de la nevera. El helado está sorprendentemente bueno."
    jam "But there's nothing left, unless you want to eat some of the ice cream [mee] made, or something from the fridge. The ice cream is surprisingly good."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5210
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ac0967f6:

    # mc "*Risa* Come, come. No dejes nada para los demás."
    mc "*Laugh* Don't worry, eat that ice cream. Don't leave anything for the rest of us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5213
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_bd54dcae:

    # jam "¿Qué te ha parecido la sorpresa?"
    jam "What did you think of the surprise?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5214
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_0a9ec317:

    # mc "Ha estado genial, pero me hubiera gustado que durase más."
    mc "It was great, but I wish it had lasted longer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5215
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_7518023c:

    # mc "Se ha hecho muy corto. Ha sido casi un 'llego, charlamos un poco, se declara mi esposa, y me voy'"
    mc "It felt really short. It was almost like 'I arrive, we chat a bit, she declares herself my wife, and I leave'."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5217
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f3d2e3c2:

    # mc "Y vuelve a repetir. Los detalles se mezclan en mi cabeza."
    mc "Rinse and repeat. The details are getting mixed up in my head."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5219
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_cc647c02:

    # jam "No podíamos alargarlo más o la fiesta de bienvenida no hubiera empezado nunca."
    jam "We couldn't drag it out any longer, or the welcome party would have never started."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5220
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_389bdd7f:

    # jam "Y mi madre y [meg] se tenían que ir a trabajar."
    jam "And my mom and [meg] had to go to work."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5221
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ff76f0a5:

    # mc "Entiendo por qué ha tenido que ser así y me encanta que haya pasado."
    mc "I understand why it had to be like this, and I love that it happened."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5222
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_634bad2c:

    # mc "Pero quizás lo hubiera planeado de otra forma si lo hubiera sabido."
    mc "But maybe I would have planned it differently, if I had known."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5224
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_cec3681c:

    # jam "Sé cómo lo hubieras planeado tú, y era imposible."
    jam "I know how you would have planned it, and it was impossible."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5225
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_b0063c8f:

    # mc "*Risa* Ilústrame sobre lo que tu bola de cristal te ha dicho sobre mis planes."
    mc "*Laugh* Enlighten me on what your crystal ball has told you about my plans."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5228
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_630225c5:

    # jam "Hubieras querido dedicar un día entero a la boda."
    jam "You would have wanted to dedicate a whole day to the wedding."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5230
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_3c913141:

    # jam "Hubieras querido dedicar un día entero a cada una de las bodas."
    jam "You would have wanted to dedicate a whole day to each of the weddings."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5231
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_8b455716:

    # mc "Es lo lógico, y lo mínimo que deberíamos haber hecho."
    mc "It's the logical thing, and the least we should have done."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5233
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_53c4bcff:

    # jam "Pero te vas dentro de dos días. No hubiera habido tiempo para organizarlo."
    jam "But you're leaving in two days. There wouldn't have been time to organize it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5236
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_304c8369:

    # jam "Ni tiempo para hacerlo. ¿[bodas] bodas en dos días y además preparar el viaje?"
    jam "Nor time to do it. [bodas] weddings in two days and also prepare for the trip?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5237
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e7ca75d5:

    # jam "Además, ¿con quién te casas primero? ¿Cuál de tus chicas tiene una muerte dolorosa porque la has elegido la primera?"
    jam "Besides, who would you marry first? Which of your girls gets a painful death because you chose her first?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5238
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f3684faa:

    # jam "Y todas querrían estar en todas las bodas, y hoy era el único día en que todo el mundo tenía un rato libre."
    jam "And they would all want to be at every wedding, and today was the only day everyone had some free time."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5239
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_163807c1:

    # mc "Tienes razón... Y no te voy a comprar una camiseta que ponga que siempre tienes razón. Esa es para mí."
    mc "You're right... And I'm not buying you a T-shirt that says you're always right. That one is for me."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5241
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_fe8f75a8:

    # jam "*Risa* No necesito una camiseta. Esta adorable cara dice todo lo que es necesario decir."
    jam "*Laugh* I don't need a T-shirt. This adorable face says everything that needs to be said."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5242
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_288886f6:

    # mc "*Risa* Lo que dice esa cara es que eres un comilón que me ha dejado sin cenar."
    mc "*Laugh* What that face says is that you're a glutton who left me without dinner."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5245
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ea732095:

    # jam "*Risa* Al menos no vas a necesitar energía para la noche de bodas."
    jam "*Laugh* At least you won't need energy for the wedding night."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5246
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ce705018:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Por qué?"
    mc "What? Why?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5250
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_aa589089:

    # jam "*Risa* ¡Porque se ha ido a trabajar, idiota!"
    jam "*Laugh* Because she went to work, idiot!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5255
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_34cc9c0a:

    # jam "*Risa* ¡Porque se han ido a trabajar, idiota!"
    jam "*Laugh* Because they went to work, idiot!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5257
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_169ec70c:

    # jam "Una se ha ido a trabajar, y la otra..."
    jam "One went to work, and the other..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5263
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_de82ed41:

    # jam "*Risa* ¡Porque se han ido a trabajar, idiota! Y la otra..."
    jam "*Laugh* Because they went to work, idiot! And the other..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5271
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f050aa61:

    # jam "*Risa* Pues vas a necesitar energía para la noche de bodas."
    jam "*Laugh* Well, you're going to need energy for the wedding night."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5272
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a3d06657:

    # mc "¿También habéis planeado mi noche de bodas?"
    mc "Did you guys plan my wedding night too?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5274
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_9194d9f1:

    # mc "No sabría a quién elegir. Quien no fuera elegida se podría sentir mal."
    mc "I wouldn't know who to choose. Whoever wasn't chosen might feel bad."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5276
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_8f4c1f2c:

    # jam "Solo había una buena opción para hoy, y no me hagas decir quién es si no eres capaz de deducirlo."
    jam "There was only one good option for today, and don't make me say who it is if you can't figure it out."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5277
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_3edf8d8c:

    # jam "Todas tus esposas se han puesto de acuerdo, con lo que no tienes que preocuparte."
    jam "All your wives have agreed on it, so you don't have to worry."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5280
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_81d7c3a8:

    # jam "¿Acaso tienes algo mejor que hacer?"
    jam "Do you have something better to do?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5281
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c764ffcb:

    # mc "Me voy a arrepentir de decir esto, pero tienes razón una vez más."
    mc "I'm going to regret saying this, but you're right once again."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5284
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_0602b6a1:

    # jam "Por cierto, estoy muy decepcionado."
    jam "By the way, I'm very disappointed."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5285
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_54b31be8:

    # mc "¿Por qué? ¿Qué he hecho ahora?"
    mc "Why? What have I done now?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5286
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_8bc53f60:

    # jam "No es contigo. [eil] me prometió que os podría casar yo cuando estábamos en el instituto."
    jam "It's not with you. [eil] promised me I could officiate your wedding when we were in high school."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5287
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_62ab734c:

    # jam "Incluso me saqué un título de sacerdote por la Iglesia Unificada de la Lasaña."
    jam "I even got ordained as a priest by the Unified Church of Lasagna."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5288
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_2cb5870f:

    # mc "*Risa* Lo hemos comentado durante nuestra boda. Los dos temíamos que aparecieras con una túnica."
    mc "*Laugh* We talked about that during our wedding. We were both afraid you'd show up in a robe."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5289
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_fa2ed4c6:

    # mc "*Risa* Y los dos nos hemos alegrado de que no lo hicieras."
    mc "*Laugh* And we were both glad you didn't."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5291
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e8a830da:

    # jam "Los dos sois unos malos amigos. Me hacía ilusión hacerlo..."
    jam "You two are terrible friends. I was looking forward to doing it..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5292
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e87aba5f:

    # mc "*Risa* Tendrías que verte la cara de niño con una pataleta ahora mismo."
    mc "*Laugh* You should see your face right now, you look like a kid throwing a tantrum."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5293
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_dc1dad4f:

    # mc "Te prometo que hablaré con [eil] para que oficies la renovación de votos. Pero ella tiene que aceptar."
    mc "I promise I'll talk to [eil] so you can officiate the vow renewal. But she has to agree."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5295
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_c874476a:

    # jam "*Risa* Eso me sirve. Si la bruja pelirroja no acepta, sé secretos que les puedo contar a las otras chicas."
    jam "*Laugh* That works for me. If the redheaded witch doesn't agree, I know secrets I can tell the other girls."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5296
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_1e5fb909:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que pasas demasiado tiempo con [sai]."
    mc "*Laugh* I think you spend too much time with [sai]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5297
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_acf45809:

    # mc "Yo que tú empezaría a pasar más tiempo con [ama] y [eva], para tener a alguien que te defienda de la furia de [eil] si lo intentas."
    mc "If I were you, I'd start spending more time with [ama] and [eva], so you have someone to defend you from [eil]'s fury if you try."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5299
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_6d01a0e2:

    # "Pasas un rato charlando con Jamaal sobre la fiesta, sobre Anthony, sobre tu viaje a Aruba, y sobre mil otras cosas."
    "You spend a while chatting with Jamaal about the party, about Anthony, about your trip to Aruba, and about a thousand other things."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5301
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_2a39fa4a:

    # "Obviamente también sobre su papel como maestro de ceremonias."
    "Obviously, also about his role as master of ceremonies."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5302
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_664b0c48:

    # "Se sorprende por haberse convertido en el tipo más odiado de la familia."
    "He's surprised to have become the most hated guy in the family."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5303
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e6abda5d:

    # "Entre la conversación y que Jamaal ha dado buena cuenta de toda la comida que había alrededor, no comes nada."
    "Between the conversation and Jamaal gobbling all the food around before you arrived, you don't eat a thing."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5305
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_a7fcc991:

    # oma "*Risa* Vengo a arrestarte, [mc]."
    oma "*Laugh* I'm here to arrest you, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5306
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_62e576e3:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Qué he hecho ahora? ¿De qué se me acusa, Agente?"
    mc "*Laugh* What have I done now? What am I accused of, Officer?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5307
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ddf8c5b0:

    # oma "*Risa* De dejar a 20 mujeres desatendidas. Ya te hemos dado un rato para que comieras algo. Te toca volver a bailar."
    oma "*Laugh* Of leaving 20 women unattended. We've already given you some time to eat something. It's time to get back to dancing."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5309
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_b1475c3e:

    # jam "*Risa* Ya has oído. Te han dado un rato para que comas. *Risa*"
    jam "*Laugh* You heard her. They gave you some time to eat. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5310
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_65254a86:

    # mc "*Risa* Puto comilón."
    mc "*Laugh* Fucking glutton."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5313
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_77e17875:

    # oma "¿De qué iba eso?"
    oma "What was that about?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5314
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_78ac3684:

    # mc "¿Has visto comida alrededor? Has dicho que me habíais dado tiempo para comer algo, pero Jamaal ha acabado con todo."
    mc "Do you see any food around? You said you gave me time to eat something, but Jamaal finished it all."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5316
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_97c6b9d1:

    # oma "No me había dado cuenta. Te hemos secuestrado para bailar contigo y no te hemos dado tiempo de comer hasta ahora."
    oma "I hadn't noticed. We kidnapped you to dance with you and haven't given you time to eat until now."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5317
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f0fcce10:

    # oma "Nosotras hemos ido comiendo algo entre baile y baile contigo."
    oma "We've been grabbing bites between dances with you."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5318
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_16dd2b81:

    # mc "*Risa* Deberíais sacar a Jamaal a bailar cuando hay comida cerca. Así dejaría algo para los demás."
    mc "*Laugh* You should ask Jamaal to dance when there's food around. That way he'd leave some for the rest of us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5320
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_81a991d6:

    # oma "*Risa* Sería capaz de mordernos una mano si le separamos de la comida."
    oma "*Laugh* He'd probably bite our hand off if we pulled him away from the food."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5321
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_2f8b7a81:

    # oma "Pero no te preocupes, cuando acabe este baile iré con alguna de las chicas a prepararte algo para comer."
    oma "But don't worry. When this dance is over, I'll go with one of the girls to make you something to eat."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5322
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_62d43dfd:

    # mc "*Risa* No hace falta, de verdad. Puedo comer algo de fruta o algo de la nevera."
    mc "*Laugh* There's no need, really. I can eat some fruit or something from the fridge."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5324
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_40eebeba:

    # oma "Pues casi me estás haciendo un favor. No me atrevería a cocinar con este vestido. Me lo ha prestado [nor] y no querría mancharlo."
    oma "Well, you're almost doing me a favor. I wouldn't dare cook in this dress. [nor] lent it to me and I wouldn't want to stain it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5325
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_1f3a1424:

    # mc "Estás guapísima con él."
    mc "You look gorgeous in it."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5327
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_aa7a8aa1:

    # oma "No tenía ningún vestido blanco y, aunque nuestra boda haya sido corta, quería vestirme de blanco para hoy."
    oma "I didn't have a white dress and, even though our wedding was short, I wanted to wear white for today."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5329
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_bb4ade43:

    # mc "No todas habéis elegido ir de blanco hoy."
    mc "Not all of you chose to wear white today."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5331
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_8e534b1f:

    # oma "Bueno, las hay que somos más tradicionales que otras. Aunque la boda no haya sido demasiado tradicional."
    oma "Well, some of us are more traditional than others. Even if the wedding wasn't too traditional."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5339
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_1596677b:

    # oma "Y después tienes a [personaje], que se ha vestido literalmente de novia."
    oma "And then you have [personaje], who literally dressed as a bride."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5340
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_084ff1ca:

    # oma "Y ahora es el momento de que bailes con otra. Creo que el resto de las chicas me están mirando como lobas esperando su ración de [mc]."
    oma "And now it's time for you to dance with someone else. I think the rest of the girls are looking at me like wolves waiting for their share of [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5342
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f8272697:

    # "Vuelves a bailar con las mujeres que aún están en casa y pasas el resto de la velada yendo de los brazos de una a los brazos de otra."
    "You go back to dancing with the women who are still at home and spend the rest of the evening going from the arms of one to the arms of another."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5343
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_2e6dbe46:

    # "El cansancio empieza a hacer mella en todos vosotros, y cada chica te dice que es la última vez que baila contigo y que te van a dejar descansar."
    "Exhaustion begins to take its toll on all of you, and each girl tells you that it's the last time she'll dance with you and that they're going to let you rest."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5344
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_f75158f5:

    # "Ninguna cumple su palabra y vuelves a encontrarte con ellas entre tus brazos al cabo de una hora o así."
    "None of them keep their word and you find them in your arms again after an hour or so."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5345
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_2121e8d7:

    # "20 mujeres. 20 canciones. Y vuelta a empezar."
    "20 women. 20 songs. And start all over again."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5347
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_ff28e007:

    # "Cuando se hace tarde, empiezan las despedidas de las chicas que se van a ir."
    "When it gets late, the goodbyes begin for the girls who are leaving."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5348
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_eedda809:

    # "[oma] lleva a Jamaal, [sim] y [mad.nick] a casa. Los cuatro tienen que trabajar mañana y el comilón tiene que levantarse temprano."
    "[oma] takes Jamaal, [sim] and [mad.nick] home. All four of them have to work tomorrow and the big eater has to get up early."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5349
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_e0b17834:

    # "[ama] y [eva] no abandonan la casa. Van a dormir con [mee] y [bet] respectivamente."
    "[ama] and [eva] don't leave the house. They're going to sleep with [mee] and [bet] respectively."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5351
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_83ef3118:

    # "Tras ayudar a recoger la cocina de [nor], subes a tu habitación."
    "After helping clean up [nor]'s kitchen, you go up to your room."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5352
translate english c30s007_MeeBetAtHome_86326168:

    # "Ha sido un día alucinante."
    "It's been an amazing day."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5356
translate english c30s007_KatConv_aeca0d27:

    # "Al cabo de un rato..."
    "After a while..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5357
translate english c30s007_KatConv_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5358
translate english c30s007_KatConv_d184b98b:

    # kat "*A través de la puerta* ¿Puedo pasar? Traigo comida."
    kat "*Through the door* Can I come in? I'm bringing food."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5359
translate english c30s007_KatConv_36c3b34c:

    # mc "*Risa* Adelante, [kat]."
    mc "*Laugh* Come in, [kat]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5369
translate english c30s007_KatConv_8bd819eb:

    # kat "Me han dicho que Jamaal te ha dejado sin cenar... O entre Jamaal y nosotras."
    kat "I was told Jamaal left you without dinner... Or between Jamaal and us."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5370
translate english c30s007_KatConv_f122747e:

    # kat "Te he hecho unos gofres. No sabía si te gustaban con nata o con chocolate, con lo que traigo de los dos."
    kat "I made you some waffles. I didn't know if you liked them with whipped cream or chocolate, so I brought both."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5372
translate english c30s007_KatConv_e2445707:

    # kat "No puedo permitir que mi marido pase hambre, ¿no?"
    kat "I can't let my husband go hungry, can I?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5373
translate english c30s007_KatConv_9d5c2504:

    # mc "Creo que, ahora mismo, del único gofre que tengo hambre es del que llevas tatuado en el hombro."
    mc "I think, right now, the only waffle I'm hungry for is the one tattooed on your shoulder."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5374
translate english c30s007_KatConv_2cad9834:

    # kat "*Risita* El gofre está lo suficientemente cerca del cuello... Eso hace que esa propuesta resulte MUY tentadora."
    kat "*Giggles* The waffle is close enough to my neck... That makes that proposal VERY tempting."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5376
translate english c30s007_KatConv_6ae1ee9d:

    # mc "Gracias, [kat]."
    mc "Thank you, [kat]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5377
translate english c30s007_KatConv_5b187f57:

    # kat "Te dejo que te los comas antes de que se enfríen, y me voy a la cama. Hasta mañana."
    kat "I'll let you eat them before they get cold, and I'm going to bed. Goodnight."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:5378
translate english c30s007_KatConv_5b62e19a:

    # mc "Hasta mañana, [kat]."
    mc "Goodnight, [kat]."

